<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">EJEKIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Ejekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ejekiel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eje</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">EJEKIEL</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Ejekiel ceng obedo i lobo Babilon, i kine ka mwaka miya abic ki pyere aboro wiye abicel ma peya kinywalo Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, ki bene ikare ma dong Jerucalem cok poto i cing mony me Babilonia. En otito lok ma pire tek bot jo ma onongo gitye i opii i lobo meno, wa ki bot jo ma gudong i Jerucalem ikare ca.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Ejekiel </char> kipoko loke i dul abicel ma pirgi tego. Ma gin aye: (1) Lubanga olwongo Ejekiel me bedo lanebine. (2) Juk ma lanebi obedo kamiyo bot dano pi ngolo kop pa Rwot Lubanga ikomgi, ki kit ma kibibalo dok kibireto Jerucalem woko piny. (3) Ejekiel omiyo lok pa Lubanga malube ki ngolo kope ikom rok ducu ma gudiyo ki gungako jone woko. (4) En omiyo lok me kweyo cwiny jone inge turu ki reto Jerucalem ki miyo cike botgi pi kwo i anyim. (5) Tucu nebi malube ki lobo Gog. (6) Nyutu neno ma Ejekiel obedo kwede pi roco odoco Ot pa Lubanga ki roke Icrael.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ejekiel obedo dano matye ki niye matut ikom Rwot Lubanga kadi tame me ryeko bene nongo dit tutwal. Pol diro me ryekone onen ikit ma en miyo loke bot lwak kun mukene wok ki i ginanyuta. Kidok pwonye obedo dwong ki cal mapol ma nyutu te kare meno ma loke okemo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ejekiel bene oloko matek ni mite mada ni dano myero gulok tamgi me cwinygi wek odok nyen. Kidok bene ni obedo tic pa ngat acel acel me cung kun bene ye bale ma en otimo. Ka dok bene en otito lok ikom gen ma en tye kwede mamako roco kwo pa dano ki rok ducu me Icrael, ki en macalo ajwaka kidok bene lanebi; en bene onongo tye ki miti madit matek pi Ot pa Lubanga ki pi nenoni pe kikelo iye kit gin me keni mo, wek kigwok lengo me kabedo meno.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lwongo pa Ejekiel <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 1:1-3:27">1:1—3:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok matito kit ma kibityeko kwede Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 4:1-24:27">4:1—24:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga ikom rok mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 25:1-32:32">25:1—32:32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cike pa Lubanga bot jone <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 33:1-37:28">33:1—37:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me nebi ma kitito ikom Gog <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 38:1-39:29">38:1—39:29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ginanyuta ma lanebi oneno ma kemo Ot pa Lubanga ki ma kwako lobo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZK 40:1-48:35">40:1—48:35</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="ms">Ginanyuta mukwongo ma Ejekiel oneno ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="EZK 1:1-7:27">1:1—7:27</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Komker pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:11">Niy 19:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino dwe abic me dwe me angwen i mwaka pyere adeke, an onongo atye abedo kacel ki Lujudaya ma gin opii inget kulu Kebar i lobo Babilon. Ci aneno polo oyabe, cutcut atugi neno Lubanga i ginanyuta. <verse eid="EZK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2 Luk 24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2 Tek 36:9-10</ref></char></note>Man otime inino dwe abic i mwaka me abice cake ma kitero rwot Yekoyakin kwede i opii. <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" />Ikare ma atye i lobo pa jo Kaldaya inget kulu Kebar, an Ejekiel wod pa ajwaka Buji, awinyo ka Rwot loko kwede ci tekone obino ikoma.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />Ikare ma aneno piny, ci aneno yamo matye ma kodo mager oa ki i lobo matye tung kumalo, kacel ki pol madit ma lutkot onongo tye kawil ki iye, kun mac bedo kalyel teretere iye calo nyonyo ma kibuku. I dye mace onongo tye iye gin maryeny macalo mola. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Niy 4:6</ref></char></note>Dong idye yamo matye ma kodo mageri, aneno gin mo manen calo lee makwo angwen, ma gubedo calo dano, <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />ento lee acel acel ikin gi onongo tur nyime tye angwen, dok bene lee acel acel bwome onongo tye angwen. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />Tyen gi ocung atir, ki dye tyen gi onongo nen calo dye tyen obong twon dyang, ma giryeny calo mola ma kijwayo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Ite bwomgi angweni onongo tye iye cing angwen macalo cing dano. Dong gin lee angweni onongo yam tur nyimgi ki bwomgi tye kit man: <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />bwomgi okube ogudu lawotgi, kun lee acel acel cito ma okemo nyime atir, giwoto ma kun pe giloke kamo. <verse eid="EZK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:14">Eje 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:7">Niy 4:7</ref></char></note>Kit macalo tur nyimgi nen kwede, lee acel acel onongo tur nyime tye angwen mapatpat: ki tung inyime wange nen calo wang dano; ki tung lacuc wange nen calo wang labwor, ki tung lacam wange nen calo wang twon, ci dong ki tung ingeye wange nen calo wang ocur. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />Tur nyimgi yam obedo kitmeno. Lee acel acel bwome tye aryo ma onongo oyare dok otinge malo kun ogudu wi bwom lee lawote mukene macok kwede, ki bwomgi aryo mukene oumu komgi woko. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Lee acel acel woto kemo nyime atir, kama cwinygi onongo omito ni gucit iye, giwoto ma kun pe giloke kamo. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Ikin lee makwoni onongo yam tye iye gin ma lyel calo miri mac, ma obedo calo mac ma wire ikin lee makwo, mace onongo lyel maleng, ki lutkot bene obedo ka wil ki idye mac kunu. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Lee magi bene onongo gitye kawire gidok tungi ki tungi calo mil pa lutkot.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 10:9-13">Eje 10:9-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma aneno lee magi angwen, aneno lawala angwen ma gudu ngom, lawala acel acel ocung inget lee acel acel bene. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Lawala acel acel onongo ryeny calo kidi me wel, ci gin lawala angwen ni ducu ginen maromrom. Kit ma kitiyogi kwede nen calo lawala acel acel kirwako odonyo i i lawala mukene. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />Ka dong gucako wot, gucito kama gukemo i yoo angwen mapatpat ma pe giloke kamo. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Niy 4:8</ref></char></note>Gin Lawala angwen magi yam doggi tye, ciliki bene onongo tye ikomgi, kun wang mapol orumu doggi woko ducu litit. <verse eid="EZK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Ka inen lee makwoni giwoto gicito anyim, ci lawala magi bene giwoto kacel kwedgi, kace inen lee gua malo ki i ngom, ci lawala bene gitinge kwede malo. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Kama cwiny mito ni gucit iye, gin bene gicito iye, ci lawala bene gitinge malo gicito kacel kwedgi; pien onongo cwiny lee angweni tye i i lawala ducu. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Ka lee tye kawot, nyo ka gucung woko, dok ka gua malo, ci lawala angweni bene gitimo kitmeno, pien cwiny leegu tye i igi mamiyo gitimo kumeno.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 4:6">Niy 4:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ki malo ka wi lee magi makwoni onongo kiriyo iye gin mo manen calo pete me polo, maryeny aryenya calo pee, kun opete lamalo ka wigi. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />Ite pete meno onongo guyaro iye bwomgi, kun bwomgi acel acel gukeme ki luwotgi; ki lee acel acel onongo tye ki bwome aryo me umu kome woko. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:15">Niy 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:6">19:6</ref></char></note>Awinyo bwomgi ka nguru ikare ma gitye katuk, bwomgi mor calo mor pa pii ma core, macalo mor pa Won Twer Ducu, ki dok macalo woo madwong pa dwon jo me mony madit; ki ka gucung mot, ci giumu bwomgi woko. <verse eid="EZK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Ci dwon owinye kun oa ki malo inge pete ma oriine malo ka wigini; ikare ma onongo gucung mot, guumu bwomgi woko.<verse eid="EZK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 10:1">Eje 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:2-3">Niy 4:2-3</ref></char>
    </note>Malo iwi pete matye ka wigini onongo tye iye gin mo calo komker, manen calo got capir ma bulu; dong gin ma nen calo danoni aye obedo iwi gin manen calo komker meno. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:2">Eje 8:2</ref></char></note>Gin meno ma obedo calo danoni onongo tye karyeny calo mola ocake ki i pyere odok kwede malo, manen calo mac ma omoko orumu kome woko ducu; cake ki i tung pyere dok kwede piny, onongo nen calo mac, mace bene onongo tye kalyel orume woko dyere. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />Nen calo danyu manen ikom pol ka inino me kot, mac mayam obedo kalyel ma orume dyereni bene obedo kitmeno. Meno aye kit mayam cal me deyo pa Rwot nen kwede.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="EZK 1:28">Lubanga olwongo Ejekiel me bedo lanebi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Ikare ma aneno ci atugi poto woko piny aryeba ic, cutcut awinyo dwon ngat mo matye kalok.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Ngat ma onongo tye kaloki owaco bota ni, “Wod pa dano, a icung, ci abilok kwedi.” <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />Ikare matye kalok kweda, Cwiny pa Lubanga odonyo i iya ci omiyo acung; pud awinyo en omede kun loko kweda ni, <verse eid="EZK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />“Wod pa dano, abicwalo in ibicito bot jo Icrael, ma lujemo ma gin gujemo ikoma, ci guloke ka lweny ikomani. Gin pud lujemo wa onyo kit macalo yam kwarigi gujemo ci gutimo bal ikomani. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />Gin aye jo ma kitgi obedo acak dok ngutgi bene nwang ma pe guwora. Abicwalo in me tito botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga abiwaco botgi. <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Ka gibiwinyo loki nyo gikwero winyone, (pien gin jo ma lujemo) ento kadi bed kumeno gibingeyo ni lanebi yam obedo ikin gi. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />Dong in wod pa dano, pe myero ilworgi, pe bene ilwor lok ma gin waco. Gibirumi woko macalo okutu lango ma orumi, kun ibedo iwi oton mapol; ci pe ilwor lokgi, cwinyi bene pe myero obale kadi gineni ki wang marac, pien gin jo ma lujemo. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Ibiloko loka botgi, kadi ka giwinyo nyo gikwero winyone; pien gin jo ma lujemo.<verse eid="EZK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Ento in, wod pa dano, winy gin ma an awaco boti; pe ibed lajemo calo jo meno ma lujemo. Ngam dogi ci icam gin ma abimiyo boti me acama.” <verse eid="EZK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Niy 5:1</ref></char></note>Ikare ma aneno piny, ci aneno cing mo ma kiryeyo tung bota; ci nen onongo omako buk adola ma kicoyo iye coc. <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />Ci oyaro buk adola inyima, ci aneno kicoyo ryoryo ducu, i iye ki tung i ngeye bene. Lok ma kicoyo iye onongo obedo lok me koko me can, kumu ki aroma me can.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 10:9-10">Niy 10:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lubanga dok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cam gin ma dong kimiyi; cam buk adola man, ci icit ilok bot jo me ot pa Icrael.” <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Kitmeno angamo doga, ci en omiya buk adola ni acam. <verse eid="EZK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />Kadok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cam buk adola man ma amiyo botini, nio ka iyeng woko kwede ma ii odeng.” Ci acamo; anongo buke obedo lim mada ki idoga calo moo kic.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Ci Lubanga dok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cit io bot jo me ot pa Icrael ci itit botgi gin ducu ma atye ka wacini. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />Pe atye kacwalo in ni icit i rok mo ma jone loko leb mo ma niang iye tek, ento abicwalo in bot jo me ot pa Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />Kace onongo acwalo in bot rok mogo ma jone loko leb matek mapatpat ma in pe iniang iye, ci kono guwinyo lok ducu ma ibiwaco botgi. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Ento jo me ot pa Icrael pe gibiwinyo loki, dok bene pe gibiwinyo loka. Pien gin ducu jo ma ngutgi nwang dok wigi tek. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Nen, kombedi dong abimiyo nguti doko nwang calo ngutgi ki wii bene bedo tek calo wigi. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />Abimiyo wi bedo tek calo meggi; ci pe ibilworogi, pe bene ilwor kit wang ma gineni kwede, pien gin jo ma lujemo.”<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Ci Lubanga omede ki loke kun waco bota ni, “Wod pa dano, lok ducu ma abiwaci myero igam obed icwinyi, dok iwinygi bene maber. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Ka dong ia icit bot jo ma gitye i opii, cit bot lutuwu kikome, ci iwac botgi kadi giwinyo nyo gikwero winyone.”<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Ka Cwiny pa Lubanga otinga woko malo, ci awinyo dwon ki tung kungeya ma mor matek calo oyengyeng ma yengo piny, kun dange ni, “Kipak deyo pa Rwot i kabedone!” <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />Awinyo bwom lee magi ka gitye kagone kacel i yamo, ki koko pa lawala bene mor matek calo oyengyeng ma yengo piny. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Ikare ma Cwiny pa Lubanga oila malo otera woko, ci abedo ki keco icwinya, kiniga bene omaka woko, ci acito ma dong onongo teko pa Rwot odiya matek mada. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Acito i Tel Abib, kama onongo jo ma kiterogi i opii gibedo iye, inget kulu Kebar. Abedo kunu ikin gi pi nino abiro kun atye ki ur madit atikatika pi gin ma onongo aneno otime ikoma ca.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ociko Ejekiel ni obed lakurpiny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 33:1-9">Eje 33:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Lacen inge nino abironu Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, dong aketi me bedo lakurpiny pi rok me Icrael. Ibitito botgi lok ducu ma acikogi kwede ma an awaci. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />Kace awaco ni dano ma latim marac bito ada, ento kun in pe ijuku en ma icike ni oloke owek timo gin marac, wek olar kwone, en bito i baleni; ento alii me tone abidwoko iwii. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Ento kace onongo ijuku en latim marac meno, kun icike ni owek yo me tim maracu, ka pe oloke oweko timo gin maracu, nyo yo me tim maracuneni, en bito i balenu; ento nongo in giri ilaro kwoni. <verse eid="EZK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />Dok bene kace dano ma kite atir oloke woko oweko timo gin matye atir, ce otimo bal, ce an aketo ariya mo inyime, ci en bito, pien onongo in pe ijuke, en bito pi bale, ki tic ma atir mayam en otiyo pe dong abipo pire; ento alii me tone abidwoko iwii. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Dok bene kace ijuku dano ma kite atir ni pe otim bal, ka en owinyo loki pe otimo bal, ci adada en bibedo kwo, pien owinyo lok ma ijuke kwede; ci in bene ibilaro kwoni.”<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanebi Ejekiel pe bitwero lok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />Rwot oketo cinge i koma; ci owaca ni, “A malo, ci icit idye bar, an abilok kwedi ki kunu.” <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />Ci a malo acito idye bar, ci aneno deyo pa Rwot ocung kunu marom ki deyo ma akwongo nenone inget kulu Kebar; ci cutcut aryebe woko piny wa i ngom. <verse eid="EZK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Ento Cwiny pa Rwot odonyo ikoma, ci ociba acung ki tyena; ci oloko kweda kun waco ni, “Cit paco, ci ilor wii woko i odi. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />Ci in wod pa dano, kibitweyi woko ki tol, man bimiyo pe itwero cito woko ikin dano. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />Dok abimiyo te lebi dwale woko, wek ibed ladogeoto ma pe dong itwero juku dano; pien gin jo ma lujemo. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Ento kace dok aloko kwedi, ci abiyabo dogi, ci in ibiwaco botgi lok ma an Rwot Lubanga atye kawaco. Ngat ma biwinyo lok man wek owiny, ki ngat ma kwero winyo lok man wek en okwer; pien gin jo ma lujemo.”<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ejekiel ogoyo cal Jerucalem ma mony oriko woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />Lubanga dok owaca ni, “Dong in, wod pa dano, kwany matapwali iket inyimi, ci igo cal taun madit man ikome, ci igor cal Jerucalem kikome. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />Ci irume woko dyere, dok itor cel lobo orum woko dyere; ka iket gony dok orum woko bene, ci iket yadi latwom cel orum woko bene. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Dok ikwany caniya nyonyo ci iket obed macalo cel nyonyo ikin in ki taun madit man me Jerucalem, kun wangi kemo taun madit man. Ma bedo calo mony dong orumu taun madit man woko liweng. Macalo in aye ma dong ityeko rumu taun madit man woko pi lweny ikome. Man aye lanyut pi ot pa jo Icrael.<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />Dok ibut ma lakngeti ma lacam odok piny, ci dong abiketo can me bal me ot pa Icraeli ikomi. Pi nino acel acel ma ibutu kwede ibitingo balgi, <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />pi nino miya adek ki pyere abongwen, marom ki wel mwaka me can ma meggi. Ci in bene ibitingo can me ot pa Icrael pi kare marom meno. <verse eid="EZK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />Ka dong ityeko tiyo meno, ibibutu piny doki pi tyen me aryone, ki lakngeti ma lacuc, ci ibitingo can me ot pa jo Juda; abimini nino pyere angwen, ma nino acel acel rom ki mwaka acel. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Ci ibiciko wangi ineno Jerucalem ma kirumu wokoni, kun itito lok me bura ki lok me nebi ikom taun madit man. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />Ci abitweyi woko ki tol ma pe dong ibitwero loke tungi ki tungi nio ka ityeko nino ma kirumu iye taun me Jerucalem woko dyereni liweng.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />Kombedi dong ikwany ngano, cayiri, muranga, ngor, gaya ki kal. Rubgi ducu kacel ci ited ki mugati. Meno aye cam ma in ibicamo pi nino miya adek ki pyere abongwen ma nongo itye ka butu ki lakngeti ma lacami. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Cam ma ibicamo kibipimo apima, maromo gram miya aryo ki pyere adek pi nino acel acel, dok bene inino acel acel ibicamo cam kicel. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Pii ma imato bene kibipimo boti apima, kikopo aryo inino acel acel, dok ibimato kicel keken. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Ibimoko mac i cet pa dano ma otwo ki inyimgi, ci ibitedo mugati macalo capat ka dong icamo.” <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" />Dok Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Ka aryemo jo Icrael akeyogi woko ikin rok ducu, ci man aye kit macalo gibicamo kwede cam ma cik okwero ni pe gucam.” <verse eid="EZK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />Cutcut agamo ni, “Pe kumeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu! An peya abalo koma kekena ki gin me kwer. Cake i ka tinona nio kwede wa onyo peya acamo ringo lee mo ma oto kene nyo ma nguu aye okayo oneko. Pud peya acamo kit ringo lee mo ma kitamo ni obedo me kwer.” <verse eid="EZK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Ci Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Nen, dong abimiyi cet dyang aye ma ka cet dano en aye itwero tedo iye mugatini.”<verse eid="EZK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Dok omede ki lok kun waco ni, “Wod pa dano, nen, abijuku kit cam ducu woko dong pe binen i Jerucalem. Gibicamo mugati ma gipimo apima kun gicamo ki lworo; ki pii bene ma gimato gibipimo apima, gimato ma nongo cwinygi obale woko. <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />Abitimo man wek pe dong gunong mugati ki pii ma oromo, wek dano acel acel obed kaneno lawote ma nongo cwinygi obale woko, wek komgi oloc woko i cangini.”<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ejekiel olyelo yer wiye ki yer tike woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />Lubanga owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kwany pala lucwan mabit ci itii kwede macalo lyedi pa lalyel wic, ci ilyel ki yer wii wa ki yer tiki bene; ka dong ikwany lapim, ci ipok yere woko i dul adek. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Dul me adekeni ibiwangone woko i mac idye taun madit, kun iporo ki kare ma nongo mony dong orumu taun madit otum. Kwany dul me adek mukene ci itong woko ki pala lucwani ikare ma nongo iwoto irumu taun madit. Dong dul me adeke ma odongi kwany ibol i yamo ci an abilwenyo ikome ki pala lucwana. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Gwok yer mogo ci itwe woko i dog bongoni. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />Dok ikwany yer mogo ki ikom yer ma onongo igwokoni, ci ibol woko i mac, wek owang woko. Dong mac bia ki ikom yer man ci nya o kwede wa ikom ot pa Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Man aye Jerucalem; ma dong atyeko keto en icwiny lobo me rok ducu, kun lobo mapol pa lurok orume woko dyere. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Ento Jerucalem ojemo woko ikom gin ma an aciko, ci oloke katimo gin maracu atika makato rok mukenegu ducu. Gin gubedo jo ma oding ma pe gilubu cika makato rok mukene mayam gurumu en dyeregu ducu. Jo Jerucalem gukwero tiyo gin ma an aciko, ci gukwero bene lubu cika. <verse eid="EZK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />Ma omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, wun aye dong rok ma luyela makato lurok ma gurumuwu dyereni, en gin ma omiyo pe wuye lubu cika ducu ma aketo, dok bene pe wugwoko gin ma an aciko, ento wun dok wubedo kalubu cik pa rok mukene ma gurumuwu. <verse eid="EZK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />Dong pimeno, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atito botwu ni abingolokop ikomwu ma lwak me rok ducu gineno. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Dong pi gin me kwer ducu madong wutyeko timone, abitimo gin mayam pud peya atimo ikomwu, en lakit gin acelu ma pe dok abitimo. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:10">Kok 4:10</ref></char></note>Dong adwogine aye bibedo ni wegi lutino ma i Jerucalem gibicamo lutinogi woko, ki lutino bene gibicamo wegigi woko ki i dyewu. Dok bene abingolokop ikomwu acobo kakare, ci dong jo mogo ki ikinwu ma gibidong gibedo kwo, ci abikeyogi woko ata. <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />Pimeno, kit macalo an Lubanga makwoni, man lok pa Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, adada, pien dong wubalo kabedona maleng woko ki tim me kwerwugu ducu, ki gin ducu ma obedo cilo ma cwinya dagi, pimeno abinekowu woko, pe dong abinenowu ki wang maber, dok bene kica pe bimaka i komwu wa ki acel. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />Dul me adek pa lwak mewu, two gemo ki kec aye binekogi woko idye taun madit; ki dul me adek mukene kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan inge taun madit; ki dong dul me adek mudongeni abikeyo woko ata, dong abiwoto pala lucwana aye aryemogi kwede.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />Ci kinigana bitum gire kene kitmeno, dong abitoyo akecana ikomgi ka dong cwinya bikwe. Ka man otime gibingeyo ni an a Rwot, dong aloko ki nyeko, ikare ma atoyo akecana ikomgi. <verse eid="EZK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />Dong makato ducu abiweko pacowu dong obur ki wun wubibedo ginacaya ikin lurok ducu ma gurumuwu dyere ki bot jo ducu ma gikato ki kanget pacowu ma odong oburri.<verse eid="EZK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />Ikare ma abingolokop i komwu ma nongo kiniga omaka ki akeca, abiketo can magwa i komwu. Rok ducu ma gurumuwu gibibedo ki lworo madwong. Gibicayowu kun giloko lok agec ikomwu ci wubibedo lanen me pwonyogi. <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />Abijuku kit cam ducu mayam wunongoni pe dong binen, man bimiyo kec nekowu matek. Wubiwinyo arem me kec matek mada calo atero ma lake bit ma kicelo i komwu wek otyekwu woko. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:8">Niy 6:8</ref></char></note>Abicwalo kec ki nguugu me neko wun ki lutinowu woko, dok bene abicwalo two gemo ki tim bwami ki lweny me nekowu me tyekowu woko. An Rwot dong aloko.”<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ojuku jone me woro cal jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />Rwot ceng oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, cik wangi inen godi me Icrael, ci itit loka botgi. <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />Wac bot godi me Icrael ni guwiny lok pa Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, wek guwiny lok ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone bot godi, ki ceregu, ki lung matut, ki notagu ducu: nen, abikelo lweny ma kilwenyo i komwu ki pala lucwan, dok bene abijwero wang jogiwu woko liweng. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Abimuku keno tyerwu woko, ki keno tyer kama wuwango iye odok ecetani bene abimukugi woko. Lutuwu jo Icrael ma gitye kunu kibinekogi woko inyim cal jogiwu. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />Abimiyo kom jo Icrael ma otoni rade inyim cal jogigi; dok abimiyo kikeyo cogogi rumu ki keno tyergi woko. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />I kabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye ki taunwu ducu kibijwero woko dong obur, ki wang jogiwu ducu kibimuku woko, ki keno tyerwu ducu kibimuku woko, ki cal jogiwu ducu kibitongo kibalogi woko, ki keno tyer me wango odok eceta bene kibitongo kireto woko piny, ki gin ducu ma wutiyo dong kibijwerogi woko liweng. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Dok jo ma kinekogi komgi birade ata, ci man miyo wun wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />Ento abimiyo jo mukene gibwot ki i lak to ci gibedo kwo. Ka dong jo mogo ma gubwot gibibedo ikin lurok, dok ka kikeyowu woko i rok ducu, <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />ci dong lutuwu ma gubwot gibipo ikoma ki ikin lurok kama onongo kiterogi iye i opii. Ci gibipo ikoma ki kunu kun gingeyo ni yam aketo can ikomgi wek amii lewic omakgi, pi cwinygi ma gen pe iyeni ma onongo dong oa woko ki ikoma pi tim tarwanggi, omiyo gumaro woro cal jogi makato an. Gibibedo ki kec cwiny ikomgi keken gi pi gin maracu me lewic ma gutimoni, ki pi gin me kwer ducu mayam gutimo. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot; dok lok mayam aloko ni abitimo gin marac man ikomgini onongo pe aloko me nono.”<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Wudong korwu ki cingwu, kun wunyono tyenwu bene i ngom ka wukok kun wuwaco ni can madit dong opoto! Can man opoto pi bal me gin me kwer ma jo me ot pa Icrael gutimo. Pimeno, kibinekogi woko i lweny, kec ki two gemo bene binekogi woko. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Jo ma gitye kamabor two gemo aye ma binekogi; ki jo matye cok kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan; ki jo ma odong ma gubwot ki ilak to, kec aye ma binekogi. Meno en aye kit macalo abitoyo kwede akecana ikomgi. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />Kom jo ma oto birade lirat ikin cal jogi ki ikabedo ducu ma orumu keno tyergi, wa iwi ceregu ducu, ki iwi godi mabocogu, ite yadi ducu ma potgi oluk, ki ite yat kworo ma pote oluk, ki ikabedo ducu kama kityero iye gin ma ngwece kur me woro cal jogigi. Ci gin ducu dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />Abiryeyo cinga woko ikomgi, ci abibalo lobogi woko, amiyo iye dong nono, ikabedo ducu kama gibedo iye, cake ki i tim nio kwede wa i Ribla. Ci gin ducu dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kare me agiki pa Icrael dong cok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, an a Rwot Lubanga dong awaco bot lobo pa jo Icrael kuman ni, agiki! Agiki dong obino woko ikom twok lobo angwen ducu.<verse eid="EZK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />Wun jo Icrael, agiki dong obino woko ikomwu; abitoyo kinigana woko ikomwu, pien abingolokop ikomwu kun poro kit gin ma wun wutimo. Dok bene abiketo can ikomwu pi gin me kwer ducu ma wutimo. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />Pe dong abiparo pirwu, kica dong pe bimaka ikomwu. Ento abiketo can ikomwu pi kit gin ducu ma wutimo, gin me kwer ma wumede ki timogini. Meno dong bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, “Can me topaco bibino ikomwu kun lube aluba inge lawote cutcut. <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Agiki dong obino, dong oo; dong otyeko core woko ikomwu. Nen, tye kabino. <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Agiki man bino pirwu wun jo ma wubedo i lobo man; kare bene dong oromo, nino me woo me lweny dong cok, pe nino me yomcwiny ma wuwo kwede i wang jogi matye iwi godi. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />Kombedi dong acok toyo akemona woko ikomwu, kun atoyo kinigana ikomwu, dok bene abingolokop ikomwu kun lubu kit gin ducu ma wutimo. Abiketo can ikomwu pi gin me kwer ducu ma wutimo. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />Pe dong abiparo pirwu, kica dong pe bimaka ikomwu. Ento abiketo can ikomwu pi kit gin ducu ma wutimo, gin me kwer ma wumede ki timogini. Meno dong bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ma apwodowuni.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />Nen, nino tye kabino! Topinywu dong obino woko. Tim bwami tye kamede ameda, ki wake bene dong omede adada. <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Tim bwami dong onya omede odoko odoo me tim maracu; dong ngat mo bene pe bidong ki ikin lutim maracu, kadi wa jami mabup ma gitye kwede, nyo lonyogi; dok bene dano mo madit pe dok bibedo tye ikin gi. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Kare dong oo, nino dong onyiko cok. Lawil jami myero cwinye pe obed yom, kadi lacat jami bene pe myero obed ki kumu, pien akemo pa Lubanga bipoto ikomgi ducu maromrom. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Lacatwil dong pe bitwero dwoko jami mayam en ocatoni cen bote, ma nongo en pud tye kwo. Pien akemo pa Lubanga bipoto ikomgi lwak ki ducu maromrom, ma pe bidok cen; dong ngat ma bigwoko kwone ki ikin gi bibedo peke pien gin ducu gubalo.<verse eid="EZK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Gukutu tum, ci gin ducu dong gitye kayube. Ento ngat mo pe ma cito ka lweny, pien akemo pa Rwot opoto ikomgi lwak ki ducu maromrom.<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pwod ikom Icrael pi balgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />Lweny tye woko idye gudu, two gemo ki kec tye i ot. Ngat matye i tim kibineko woko ki pala lucwan; ki ngat matye i taun madit, kec ki two gemo bineko woko. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Jo mogo ma gubwot gibilaro wi godi calo akuri me nota, ma gin ducu gibicur pi balgi. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />Ci cing dano acel acel bidoko goro, ki conggi bene bimyel amyela calo pii ma milamila limakmak. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />Gibiruku bongo cola i pyergi, ki lworo madwong bimakogi; lewic bimakogi ducu, gin ducu kibilyelo wigi woko. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />Gibibolo ryalgi ki jabugi woko idye gudu macalo gin ma pe leng, pien ryal ki jabu pe twero larogi inino ma Rwot bionyo iye kinigane ikomgi. Pe gibitiyo kwede me cobo mitigi, dok bene pe gibimiyo igi yeng kwede. Ryal ki jabu aye gire omiyo gupoto i bal. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />Yam onongo gubedo kawake pi ginarukagi me deyo ma giruku pi nyutu ditogi mamwani, dok gutiyo kwede me yubu cal lubangagi me kwer ma giracu atikani. Meno aye gin ma omiyo Rwot biloko lonyogi doko gin ma pe leng botgi.<verse eid="EZK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />Abimiyo lurok yakogi woko, ci dok abimiyo lutim maracu matye i lobo yako jamigi ki lonyogi woko bene liweng, ci gibipyedo jamigi woko bene. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Abiloko wanga cen pe abinenogi, wek gin gigi gupyed kabedona maleng tutwali, luyak bene gibidonyo iye ci gipyedone woko.<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />Wuyub nyor me tweyowu. Lobo dong opong ki nek ki taunwu maditonegu ducu opong ki tim bwami. <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />Abikelo rok ma giracu makato ducu kany me leyo odigi, ki me bedo iye. Abigiko tek me wakegi woko ki i kabedogi maleng gu ducu ma gibipyedoni woko. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Ka remcwiny dong obino, ci gibiyenyo kuc, ento pe gibimedo ki nongone wa ki acel. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Can me topaco bibino ikomgi, kun lube aluba inge lawote cutcut, ki lok anii bene bilubu lawote. Gibiyenyo ginanyuta ki bot lunebi kwe; ajwaki dong pe gibibedo ki kit gin mo ma myero gupwony ki dano, ki ludongo bene pe gibibedo ki tam mo ma myero gumi bot dano. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Ci rwot bikumu, ki gen pa laker bene birwenyo woko, ki lwak bene komgi bimyel pi lworo madwong. Ci abitimogi kun lubu kit timgi, ci abingolokop ikomgi kun lubu kit ma gin kikomgi gingolo kwede kop ikom jo mukene. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="ms">Ginanyuta me aryo ma Ejekiel oneno ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="EZK 8:1-10:22">8:1—10:22</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Woro cal jogi i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />Inino dwe abic, dwe me abicel, mwaka me abicel madong wabedo kwede i opii, ludongo me Juda onongo gubedo i oda kun gitye kalok kweda. Cutcut tek pa Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu obino opoto ikoma. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:27">Eje 1:27</ref></char></note>Ci aneno gin mo manen calo dano. Cake ki i pyere tung piny, onongo nen calo mac malyel, dong a i pyere dok kwede malo onongo ryeny aryenya calo mola. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />Ci ocwalo gin ma obedo calo cing dano ci omaka ki yer wiya ka otinga kwede malo. Dong i ginanyuta man Cwiny pa Lubanga otinga malo oterawa i pol ikin polo ki lobo ci otera i Jerucalem. Cwiny pa Rwot otera i dog gang ma i iye matye tung kumalo me Ot pa Lubanga, kama onongo cal jok mo tye iye, en aye gin mamiyo nyeko mako Lubanga.<verse eid="EZK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:28">Eje 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma atye kunu aneno deyo pa Lubanga pa Icrael kit macalo onongo kong aneno kwede deyone i ginanyuta ma aneno idye nota. <verse eid="EZK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Ci Lubanga owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, ting wangi malo kombedi ci inen tung kumalo.” Atingo wanga malo aneno tung kumalo, ci aneno cal jok makelo nyeko tye cok ki keno tyer i dog gang meno tung kama kidonyo ki iye. <verse eid="EZK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Ci Lubanga dok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, tika ineno gin ma jo Icrael gitye katimoneni, gin me kwer madito keken wek kiryema woko ki i kabedona maleng? Pud dok ibineno gin me kwer madit makato man ma gitimo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Dok okela i dogola me dyekal; ikare ma aneno piny, ci aneno kor ot kama otuc. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Ci en owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, muk kor ot kany.” Ka amuku kom ot, ci anongo dogola. <verse eid="EZK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />En owaca ni, “Dony i ot ci inen gin me kwer ki me lewic ma gitye katimone kanyi.” <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />Kitmeno adonyo idyere ci aneno kor ot ducu kigoyo iye kit cal ducu mapatpat. Cal gin malak alaka piny, ki cal lee mogo ma komgi kikeni ma kikwero, ki kit cal jogi ducu me ot pa Icrael ma onongo giworo. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Dong onongo tye kunu jo pyere abiro ki, ikom ludongo me ot pa Icrael ma gucung inyim cal jogigu, kacel ki Jajania wod pa Capan ma ocung ikin gi. Dano acel acel onongo omako atabo weene i cinge, kun yito me odok eceta ma giwango duny cito malo macalo pol. <verse eid="EZK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />Dok en owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, tika dong ineno gin ma ludongo me ot pa Icrael gitye katiyone, i mung i colpiny ca? Gin ducu gitye kaworo jogi i kicika ma opong ki cal lubangagu. Gin giloko keken gi ni, ‘Rwot pe nenowa, Rwot dong otyeko bwoto lobo man woko.’”<verse eid="EZK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Ci Rwot owaca ni, “Ibineno gin me kwer madito makato man ma gitimo.” <verse eid="EZK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Ci okela i dogola me dog gang matye tung kumalo me Ot pa Rwot; ci aneno mon gubedo kunu kun gitye kakok pi jok Tamuj.<verse eid="EZK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Ka openya ni, “Wod pa dano, dong ineno gin man? Pud dok ibineno gin me kwer madito makato magi woko.” <verse eid="EZK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />Ci otera idyekal matye i Ot pa Rwot. Ci aneno co maromo pyere aryo wiye abic gitye cok ki dogola me Ot pa Rwot, ikin keno tyer ki kama kidonyo kwede i Ot. Gin conu guloko ngegi ikom Ot pa Rwot, kun nyimgi okemo tung kunyango, gitye kunu karyebe piny me woro ceng matye katuc ki tung kunyango. <verse eid="EZK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Ci en openya ni, “Wod pa dano, dong ineno gin man? Man mono jo me ot pa Juda gineno ni lok matidi ki botgi ka gibedo katimo gin me kwer kany? Itamoni gin myero gubed kamiyo tim bwami omede onya i lobo, kun gibedo kangeto cwinya jwi wek kiniga omaka doki aye? Nen kong kit macalo gitye kanywara kwede i yo marac ma okato kare. <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Pimeno, abitimogi malit ikare me akemona; dok pe abiparo pirgi bene, ki kica pe bimaka ikomgi. Kadi bed gukok bota kun gilego lega ki dwon malongo, ento pe abiwinyo kokogi.”<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Pwod ma kiketo ikom Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Lacen awinyo Lubanga odange ki dwon malongo kun waco ni, “Wunyik cok, wun lunek ma wumito keto can ikom lubalo ma i taun madit man. Wun ducu wukwany jami lwenywu wubin kwede kun wumako i cingwu.” <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Cutcut co abicel gubino ki i dog gang mamalo matye tung kumalo me Ot pa Rwot; laco acel acel omako jami lwenye me nek i cinge. Laco mo bene ma oruku bongo camanini owoto kacel kwedgi, ci en owoto ki gin mo maromo coc kwede. Gin ducu gudonyo idyekal me Ot pa Rwot ci gucung inget keno tyer me mola.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />I karenu onongo deyo pa Lubanga pa Icrael maryeny tutwali oa woko ki ikom lukerubi kama yam en bedo iye kun kato ci obino ocung i dogola me Ot pa Rwot; ci Rwot olwongo laco ma oruku bongo camaninigini, ma onongo owoto ki gin me coc ilak ngeteni. <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3">Niy 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:4">9:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:1">14:1</ref></char></note>Rwot owace ni, “Cit iwok ki idye taun madit me Jerucalem ducu, ci iket lanyut i tur nyim dano acel acel matye ki cwercwiny me can kun gicur pi gin me kwer ducu ma gitye katimone i taun madit me Jerucalem.”<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />Dok awinyo bene ka Lubanga waco bot co mukene ca ni, “Wulub kore kun wuwok ki idye taun madit ci wunek dano. Pe wupar pi ngat mo, dok bene kica pe omakwu ikome. <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Wunek jo ma otii, awobe, anyira, mon, ki lutino bene matino, ento pe myero wugud kom ngat madong kityeko keto lanyut ikome. Wucak ki kany ki i kabedona maleng.” Ci gucako ki ludongo ma onongo gucung kunu i Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Lubanga owaco botgi ni, “Wubal Ot pa Rwot woko. Dok wupong dyekalegu ducu ki kom jo ma kinekogini. Dong wucit mewu anyim ki tic.” Guwoto gucito anyim, ci gucako neko dano ma gitye i taun madit. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />Ikare ma gitye kaneko dano, an dong onongo adong gira kena. Apoto piny i ngom aryeba ic, ci akok bot Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga! Akemo mono dong omaki matek tutwal ikom Jerucalem ma omiyo dong ibino me cito ka neko jo ducu liweng ma gudong i Icraeli?”<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />Ci Lubanga ogamo doga ni, “Jo Icrael ki jo Juda gutimo bal madito dok maracu adada. Gin gubedo ka neko dano i kabedo ducu ma i lobogi ci gumiyo lok me ngolo kop ma atir peke. Dok tim bwami omede onya i Jerucalem. Gin giwaco ni, ‘Rwot dong obwoto lobo man woko, dok Rwot bene pe neno.’ <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />Dong ki tung bota, pe abiparo pirgi, kica bene pe bimaka ikomgi, ento abiculu kwor ikomgi pi gin ducu mayam gin gutimo.”<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Cutcut dano ma onongo oruku bongo camanini, matye ki gin me coc ilak ngeteni odwoko lok bot Rwot kun waco ni, “Dong atyeko tiyo gin ma onongo icika ni acit atim.”<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Deyo pa Lubanga oa woko ki i Ot pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:26">Eje 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:2">Niy 4:2</ref></char>
    </note>Ci aneno pete matye malo ka wi lukerubi, ci aneno gin mo matye ka wigi ma obedo calo komker ma kitiyo ki got capir ma bulu. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Niy 8:5</ref></char></note>Ci Rwot owaco ki laco ma oruku bongo camaninini ni, “Wot idony wa ikin lawala matye kawireni, ki piny katyen lukerubini, ci ijob bilo matye kawangi pong cingi ki ikin lukerubi, ci iket woko atata idye taun maditi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 10:2">Ci aneno en kacito gire. <verse eid="EZK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Ikare meno onongo lukerubi gucung inget Ot pa Rwot tung kupiny, ci ka laconu dong odonyo i Ot pa Rwot; ci pol ocako pongo dyekal me Ot pa Rwot woko. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Ci deyo pa Rwot oa woko ki ikom lukerubi ocito wa i dogola me Ot pa Rwot. Ci pol opongo Ot pa Rwot woko, ki dyekale bene opong woko ki deyo pa Rwot mameny amenya. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Mor pa bwom lukerubi owinye wa idyekal matye woko, calo dwon Lubanga Matwero ducu ma onongo tye kalok.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />Ka dong ociko laco ma oruku bongo camaninini ni, “Kwany mac ki ikin lawala matye kawireni, ki ikin lukerubi,” ci laconu ocito odonyo ikin lawala ci ocung kanget lawala mo acel. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Ci lakerubi mo oryeyo cinge ki ikin lukerubi wadigi okemo mac ma onongo tye ikin lukerubi, ci okwanyo lodi mac mogo, ka oketo i cing dano ma oruku bongo camaninini; ci danonu ogamo ci okato kwede woko.<verse eid="EZK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" />Lakerubi acel acel onongo tye ki gin mo ite bwome manen calo cing dano. <verse eid="EZK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:15-21">Eje 1:15-21</ref></char></note>Dok bene aneno ni inget lukerubi onongo tye iye lawala angwen, ki dok kanget lakerubi acel acel onongo tye iye lawala acel. Lawala ducu onongo giryeny calo kidi me wel. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Gin ducu onongo ginen romrom, dok calo onongo lawala acel acel kiroyo odonyo ki ikin lawala wadi. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />Ka dong gucako wot, gicito ma gukemo yoo angwen mapatpat ma kun pe giloke kamo, ci kit yoo mo keken ma lawala ma anyim okemo, ci lawala mukenegu ducu gilubu ma pe giloke kamo ma nongo gitye kawot. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Niy 4:8</ref></char></note>Kom lawala magi, ngegi, cinggi, bwomgi, ki tyen gi ducu onongo gupong ki wang mapol ma orumugi woko ducu litit. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />Dong lawala magi awinyo ka kilwongo ni lawala ma wire calo “yamo lapiru.”<verse eid="EZK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:10">Eje 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:7">Niy 4:7</ref></char>
    </note>Lee acel acel onongo tur nyime tye angwen mapatpat: ci tur nyime mukwongo onongo nen calo tur nyime lakerubi, tur nyime me aryo onongo nen calo tur nyime dano, tur nyime me adek onongo nen calo tur nyime labwor, ki me angwene onongo nen calo tur nyime ocur. <verse eid="EZK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Magi aye gin lee mayam kong anenogi inget kulu Kebarni. Ci lukerubi gua gutuk woko i yamo. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Ka inen lukerubi giwoto gicito, ci lawala bene woto kwedgi ki ikangetgi; ka inen lukerubi guilo bwomgi me tuk woko ki i ngom, ci lawala bene pud woto kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />Kace inen lee gucung nyo ka gua malo, ci lawala angweni bene gitimo kitmeno, pien cwiny leegu tye i igi mamiyo gitimo kitmeno.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Ci deyo pa Rwot oa woko ki i dogola me Ot pa Rwot, onyiko ocung lamal ka wi lukerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />Lukerubi guyaro bwomgi ci gutuk woko ki i ngom gucito ma an bene aneno, lawala bene onongo tye kawot kacel kwedgi; ci gucung i dogola matye tung kunyango me Ot pa Rwot, ki deyo pa Lubanga pa Icrael onongo tye ka wigi. <verse eid="EZK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />Magi gin aye lee makwo mayam anenogi inget kulu Kebar ma otingo Lubanga pa Icrael iwi komkereni, ci aniang ni gin lukerubi.<verse eid="EZK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Lee acel acel onongo tur nyime tye angwen, bwome angwen, ki gin manen calo cing dano onongo tye ite bwome acel acel. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />Dong tur nyimgi onongo nen calo tur nyim ma nene aneno inget kulu Kebarni kikome. Gin ducu giwoto kacel kun ngat acel acel woto kemo nyime atir.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ojuku rwodi ma gin lutim maracu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Cwiny pa Lubanga otinga malo, ci otera wa i dogola matye tung kunyango me Ot pa Rwot. Dong ikare ma atye kunu kama cok ki dogola ci aneno jo pyere aryo wiye abic, ma onongo ikin gi tye iye Jajania, wod pa Ajur, ki Pelatia wod pa Benaya, ma onongo gin rwodi ma giloyo lwak.<verse eid="EZK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" />Ci Lubanga owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, magi gin aye lutim maracu ma gitye kayubu lok me timo gin marac i taun madit man. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />Gin giwaco ni, ‘Kare pud bor me gero iye odi. Taun madit man obedo calo agulu me tedo, wan wabedo calo ringo matye i iye.’ <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Pimeno, wod pa dano, tit lok me nebi marac ikomgi.”<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Cwiny pa Rwot dok obino opoto ikoma, ci Rwot owaco bota ni atit lok man bot lwak ni: “Wun jo Icrael, angeyo gin ma wutye katamone, ki gin ma wutye kayubune ki i tamwu. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Wun dong wutyeko neko jo mapol i taun madit kany. Ma omiyo yoo ma i taun madit man ducu opong ki kom dano ma oto keken.<verse eid="EZK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />Ma omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco botwu ni: taun madit man bidoko agulu me tedo, ento kom jo ma oto ma wunekogi ka wupyelogi idye taun madit gin aye ringo me ateda. Ento wun kibikwanyowu woko ki idye taun madit! <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Yam wubedo kalworo pala lucwan ce; ento dong abikelo dano ma gitye ki pala lucwan gilwenyo ikomwu. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />Abikwanyowu ki idye taun madit man akelowu woko, ci abimiyowu i cing lurok. Dong atyeko ngolo kop me to iwiwu. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Kibinekowu woko i lweny ki pala lucwan i lobowu kikome. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Taun madit man pe bibedo agulu me tedowu ki wun bene pe wubibedo calo ringo matye i agulu. Abiketo can i komwu ki i kabedo ducu ma wubedo iye ki i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ki cik ma wuturuni meno obedo cika, ki gin ma kiciko ni wutiini, ma pe wutiyoni, onongo an gire aye ma aciko, ento wubedo mere kalubu mewu cik pa lurok ma gurumuwu.”<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />I karenu ma atye katito lok, cutcut Pelatiya wod pa Benaya opoto ci oto woko. Ci apoto bene piny aryeba ic kun akok ki dwon malongo ni, “Ai do, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu! Ibineko jo ma onongo gudong i Icraeli woko ducu?”<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gicike pa Lubanga bot jo ma onongo gitye i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Rwot oloko kweda kun waco ni, <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />“Wod pa dano, jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem gitye kalok piri kadi wa Luicrael wadiwu bene ma kiterogi i opii. Gin giwaco ni, ‘Opii dong gitye kamabor ma pe gitwero woro Rwot. En omiyowa lobo man ni wacam obed mewa.’ <verse eid="EZK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />Kombedi dong itit lok ma atye kawaconeni bot opii wadiwu. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye ceng acwalogi me cito kabedo i lobo pa lurok matye kamabor, ci akeyogi woko i lobo mukeneni ducu. Dong aye ni guwora i lobo kama gucito iye ci an abibedo tye ikin gi, ento man bibedo pi tutunu.<verse eid="EZK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />Pimeno tit botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone ni: abicokogi woko ki i lobo kama yam akeyogi gucito iye, ci abimiyogi lobo Icrael adwoko cen botgi. <verse eid="EZK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />Ka gudwogo cen ki i lobo kunu, ci gibijwero gin ducu ma obedo me cilo, ki gin me kwergu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:26-28">Eje 36:26-28</ref></char></note>Abimiyogi cwiny acel dok abiketo cwiny manyen i igi; kun bene abikwanyo cwiny me dingoni ma obedo calo gotti woko ki ikomgi, ci abimiyogi cwiny me bedo luwiny. <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />Dong man bimiyo gibigwoko cika dok bene gibibedo lugen kun giwinyo loka ducu ki gin ma an acikogi kwede ducu. Ci gibibedo jona, ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Ento abiketo can ikom jo ducu ma giworo gin ducu ma obedo cilo ki gin me kwergu. Ci abiculu kwor ikomgi kun poro gin ducu mayam gin gutiyo, man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deyo pa Lubanga oa woko ki i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 43:2-5">Eje 43:2-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lukerubi gucako tuk me cito malo, ci lawala bene gucito kacel kwedgi. Deyo pa Lubanga pa Icrael onongo tye ka wigi. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" />Ci deyo pa Lubanga oa woko ki i taun madit man, ci ocito ocung iwi got matye tung kunyango me taun madit. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot otinga woko i ginanyuta, ci okela odwoka woko cen bot jowa matye i opii i lobo Kaldaya. Ci lacen ginanyuta meno ma onongo anenoni ocako rwenyo woko ki bota, <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />ci dong atito gin ducu ma Rwot onyuta bot jo ma onongo gitye i opii.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lanebi Ejekiel odoko macalo lanyut me opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ica 6:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:18">Mar 8:18</ref></char></note>En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, in itye kabedo ikin jo ma lujemo. Wanggi tye, ento pe gineno gin mo. Itgi bene tye, ento pe giwinyo lok mo, <verse eid="EZK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />pien gin jo ma lujemo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 12:3">Dong kombedi, in wod pa dano, yube kun itweyo yeci macalo laring ayela, ci icak wot me cito i opii ki inyimgi ki i dyeceng. Wek gin ducu guneni ka icako wot me cito i kabedo mukene. Gwok nyo gin jo ma lujemoni gibiniang ikom gin ma itimo. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />Twe yeci woko ki i dyeceng macalo laring ayela ma tweyo yece kun gin bene gineno, wek guneni ka dong iwoto icito ki otyeno calo dong icito woko i opii. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Tuc kor cel ma gin bene gineno, ci idony ki iye ikat icit woko. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />Ci ibitingo yeci ki inyimgi ma gin gineno, nongo iketo iwi gwoki, kun icito kwede woko i colpiny ma nongo iboyo wangi woko, wek pe inen lobo kama icito iye. Dong atyeko keto in me bedo lanyut bot jo Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Ci atiyo gin ducu ma Rwot nene ocika ni atii. Akwanyo yeca akelo woko ki i dyeceng, calo yec pa laring ayela; ka dong piny odoko otyeno anga makatoni ci atucu kor cel ki cinga. Ci akwanyo yeca ma atweyoni atingo iwi gwoka ma kun gin bene gineno, ci acito woko i colpiny.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Ci orwone ki odiko Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, kombedi Luicrael ma gin lujemoni gitye kapenyi ni in itye katimo gin ango. <verse eid="EZK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />Tit botgi gin ma An a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kaloko botgi. Lok man ma pire teki okemo laker matye kaloc i Jerucalem ki jo Icrael ducu ma gibedo kunu. <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />Tit botgi ni gin madong itimoni tye macalo lanyut me gin ma bitime ikomgi; kibiterogi woko i opii i lobo mukene. <verse eid="EZK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />Dong laker ma loyogini bitingo yece iwi gwoke i colpiny ci bilwi donyo ki iwang cel ma kitucu ikom celi kato kwede woko gire. En biboyo wange woko, wek pe enen lobo kama ecito iye. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />Ento <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:7">2 Luk 25:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:11">Jer 52:11</ref></char></note>abiciko obwona pire, ci en bibino moko i owicca. Ka dong abikwanye atere woko wa i lobo Babilon, ma en lobo pa jo Kaldaya, en bito ki kunu ma nongo pe oneno lobonu. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />Abikeyo jo ducu ma onongo gurume woko dyereni, lumiine tam, ki jo magwoko en i yo ducu mapatpat; lukworgi biyenyogi mada wek kinekgi woko ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="EZK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />Ka akeyogi woko ikin rok mukeneni i lobo pa lurok, ci dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Ento abiweko jo manok ki ikin gi bwot ki i dog lweny, ki ikec ki itwo gemogu ma pe ginekogi, wek guniang maber ki ikin lurok kunu, ci gutuc gin me kwer ducu mayam gutimoni, wek dong gunge atir ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanyut pa lanebi ma kome myel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Rwot dok omede ki lok kweda <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />kun owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, wek komi omyel ka itye kacam, wek komi bene obed kamyel ki lworo ka itye kamato pii. <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />Tit bot wegi lobo meno ni man aye lok pa Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma okemo jo Jerucalem ma pud gibedo i lobogi. Gibicamo cam ki lworo ma nongo komgi myel, ci dok bene gibimato pii ma nongo komgi ryange, ki cwinygi bene nongo obale woko. Ci kibiyako jami ducu matye i lobogi miyo lobogi dong nono, pien jo ducu ma gibedo iye lutim bwami keken. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Taun gi madito ducu ma dano gibedo iye kibijwero woko dong obur, ci lobo meno dong bidoko tim ata. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ma dano gungiyo kwede ki lok ma dano pe mito winyone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />En owaco bota ni, “Wod pa dano, pingo jo Icrael gimaro bolo carolok man ni, ‘Kare tye kakato, ento pingo ginanyuta ma lunebi gineno iwang leki ducu loke pe cobe kakare?’ <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />Kombedi dong itit botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu amito wacone pi lok man. Abigiko tic ki carolok meno woko. Pe dok kibibedo katic kwede i Icrael matwal. Ento tit botgi ni, ‘Kare dong oo, ki ginanyuta ducu dong bicobe kakare.’”<verse eid="EZK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Ento wac botgi ni, “Ginanyuta me gobagoba ki lok me tyet bwolobwolo ma ngako dano dong bibedo peke matwal ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />An Rwot, dong abiloko botgi, ci gin ma awaco bitime, lok man pe dok bigale. Abitimo gin ma acikowu ni abitimoni ikare me kwowu, wun jo ma lujemoni. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Rwot dok oloko kweda, <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />kun waco ni, “Wod pa dano, jo Icrael giwaco ni ginanyuta ma inenoni ki lok ma ititoni tye pi kare me anyim ma pud tye bor.<verse eid="EZK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />Pimeno tit botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone ni, ‘Lok man pe dok bigale. Gin ma awaconi bitime.’ An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko.”<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Rwot ikom lunebi ma co ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, tit lok me nebi marac ikom lunebi me Icrael ma gitito lok ma gitamo atama ki wigi, tit botgi ni, ‘Wuwiny lok pa Rwot!’<verse eid="EZK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />Man aye gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaco ni: can iwi lunebi ma lumingi! Gin gilubu mere tam ma gitamo atama ki i cwinygi kun nongo pe guneno ginanyuta mo. <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />Wun jo Icrael, lunebiwu konygi peke macalo too ma gibedo iwi obur matye i taunwu madito. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Dok bene pe gigwoko kabedo kama kimuku cel woko ki iyeni, kadi bene pe gimito gero cel odoco; ma omiyo jo Icrael pe bicung ka lweny obino inino pa Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />Ginanyutagi ducu ma guneno obedo mere goba. Gityeto bene lok me goba. Ci giwaco ni, ‘Man lok pa Rwot’, ento an gira pe aorogi. Dok mitigi tye ni myero acob lokgi ma gutamoni kakare. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Ci awaco botgi ni ginanyuta magi ducu ma wuneno obedo me goba, ki lok ma wutyetogu ducu obedo lok me goba keken. Kun wuwaco bene ni lok magi ducu loka, ento an gira pe aloko kwedwu.<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />Ma omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaco botgi kuman ni: lokwu ducu obedo me bwolo ki ginanyuta ma wunenogu goba keken. Pimeno, atye ki lok ikomwu. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />Abimiyowu pwod, wun lunebi ma wuneno ginanyuta me bwologu, dok bene wutyeto lok goba keken. Pe wubibedo tye i kacoke pa jona ma gucoke, kadi wa nyingwu bene pe kibicoyo kacel ki nying jo Icrael mukenegu; ki dok bene pe wubidok i lobowu matwal. Ci wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga.<verse eid="EZK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:14">Jer 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:11">8:11</ref></char>
    </note>Lunebi magi gumiyo jona gungak woko kun giwaco ni, ‘Kuc tye,’ ento nongo kuc mo peke. Ma omiyo jona gibino gigero cel ci lunebini gibino gipuyu kome woko ki rangi matar me puyu kor ot. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />Wac bot jo matye kapuyune ki rangi matari ni cel bipoto woko piny. Kot macore acora bicwer matek, ki pee madwong bicore piny ikome, ki yamo lapiru matek bikodo ikom cel meno. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Ci cel bimuk poto woko piny, man bimiyo dano ducu gibipenyowu gin maber ma wunongo pi puyu kom cel ki rangi matari.”<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />Pimeno an Rwot Lubanga atye kawaco kuman ni, “Abicwalo yamo makodo matek, ki kot macore acora bicwer, ki pee madwong bicore piny pi akemona ki kinigana, ma bimuku cel meno woko. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Ci abimuku cel meno ma wupuyu kome ki rangi matari areto woko piny i ngom, ci dok aweko te gutine dong nono. Ka celi bipoto ci binekowu woko ducu. Man bimiyo wun ducu wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Meno aye kit ma abitoyo kwede akemona ikom cel ki ikom jo ma gupuyu cel ki rangi matari. Ci abiwaco botwu ni, ‘Cel dong pe matwal, kadi ki jo ma gupuyu kome ki rangi matari bene dong gipeke, <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />kadi lunebi ma gubedo katito lok ma okemo Jerucalem ni kuc tye iye, kun kuc onongo pekeni, bene dong gipeke.’” Man Rwot Lubanga aye ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi marac ma kitito ikom lunebi ma mon ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />Rwot owaco ni, “Kombedi in wod pa dano, nen mon ma gitye ikin lutuwu ma gitito lok ma gin aye otamo atama ki i cwinygi. Juk gin ma gitye katitoneni woko, <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />kun itito botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaco botgi ni:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 13:18">Can iwiwu wun mon ma wukwoyo lwit wutweyo ingut cing dano, dok bene wukwoyo bongo laum wic ma wuboyo iye lwit pi dano ducu kun wulubu kit bor pa ngat acel acel, wutimo man ni wek gubed ki twero me rwenyo kwo pa dano woko! Wumito tic ki twero me kwo ki me to ikom jona wek wunong giwu iye magoba ma cwinywu mito. <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Dong wutyeko pyeda woko wa ikin jona pi cayiri maromo pong cingwu keken, ki pi kwon mogo matinotino, kun wuneko dano ma onongo myero pe guto, ento wubwoto dano ma onongo myero guto aye gibedo kwo, pi gobawu ma wuloko bot jona, ma guwinyo lok gobawuni.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />Man aye gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone botwu ni: Adag lwit ma wukwoyo i komwu me bedo ki twero ikom dano me kwo ki me to. Abicodo lwit menogu woko ki ingut cingwu ci abimiyo dano ma onongo wutye ki twero me loyo kwogini gibwot, gin jo ma wubedo ka dwarogi calo wudwaro winyo. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Abiyeco bongo laum wiwu woko bene, ci alaro jona woko ki icingwu, pe dong gibibedo ite twerowu matwal. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Wun dong wubalo cwiny jona ma kitgi atir woko ki lok me bwolo, kadi bed onongo an ceng pe abalo cwinygi, ento wun wucuku cwiny jo ma gin lutim maracu, wek pe guloke ki i yo me timgi maracu gular kwogi. <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />Pimeno, pe dong wubineno ginanyuta me gobagoba matwal, dok bene pe wubityeto tyet. Abilaro jona woko ki icingwu. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ongolo kop ikom jo ma woro cal jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Jo mogo ikin ludongo pa jo Icrael gubino bota ci gubedo piny inyima. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Cutcut Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, jo magi dong gitye ki cwiny me woro cal jogi dok gimiyo cal jogi magi ngakogi terogi woko katimo bal. Tika gitamo ni abimiyogi lagam ma gitye kamitoneni?<verse eid="EZK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Kombedi dong lok kwedgi ci itit botgi ni Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, ‘Laicrael mo matye ki cwiny me woro cal jogi dok ma bimiyo cal jogi magi ngako en tere katimo bal, ka obino bot lanebi ni okonye, ci an Rwot kikoma aye abimiye lagam. Lagam ma abimiyo bibedo lagam ma okemo lwak cal jogine ma en otiyogu. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />Cal jogi magi ducu dong oloko cwiny jo Icrael woko ki ikoma, ento ageno ni ki lagam man ma abimiyo botgi abidwoko cwinygi cen ikoma miyo dong giwora.’<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />Kombedi dong itit bot jo Icrael gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone ni: wungut wudwog cen bota wuwek woro cal jogiwuni. Dok bene wuloke wuwek timo gin me kwer ducu mayam wubedo katimogini.<verse eid="EZK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />Ka inen dano mo ki ikin Luicrael nyo dano mo ki ikin lurok ma gibedo ikin jo Icrael ce oloke obwota woko kun dong tye ki cwiny me woro cal jogi, ka cal jogine ongake otere katimo bal, ka obino bot lanebi ni okonye, ci an Rwot kikoma aye abimiye lagam. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />Abikwero kit timenu woko, abimiyo en doko lanen ma bigengogi me lubu kit tim meno ci abikwanye woko ki ikin jona. Dok man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />Kace inen kibwolo lanebi mo ci en omiyo lagam gobagoba, meno nongo an Rwot aye ma abwole. Ci abiryeyo cinga ikom lanebi meno, aneko woko ki ikin jona jo Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Dong lanebi kacel ki ngat ma bino ka nongo kony ki boteni ducu gibilimo lakit can acelu. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Abitimo man wek jo Icrael pe gungak gubwota woko, wek bene pe gubal komgi ki balgi ducu ma gitimo. Ento amito ni gin gubed jona ki an bene abed Lubangagi.” Man Rwot Lubanga ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nua, Daniel ki Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kace inen dano ma i lobo timo bal ikoma ma gituru cika kun bene pe gigena, abiryeyo cinga ci ajwiko wit cam woko ki iye. Abicwalo kec neko dano ma gibedo iye kacel wa ki lee ducu. <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />Kadi bed jo adeki, Nua, Daniel ki Yubu onongo gibedo kunu, kitgi ma atiri gire kono onongo olaro kwogi gin ken gi, man Rwot Lubanga aye ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />Nyo ka acwalo lee tim me neko dano woko ducu ki i lobo meno, ci gibimiyo lobo dong ma obale woko, doko marac ma ngat mo dong pe twero ngolo dyere kato ki iye, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />kadi bed nene jo adeki gubed kunu, kit macalo An a Rwot Lubanga atye ma kwoni, kono onongo pe gin otwero laro kadi wa lutinogi kikomgi. Onongo gitwero laro kwogi keken gigi, ento nongo lobo dong oloke doko tim ata.<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />Nyo kace akelo lweny ikom lobo meno kun acwalo jami lweny maracu wek kinek ki dano kacel ki lee woko ducu, <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />kadi bed onongo jo adeki, Nua, Daniel ki Yubu gibedo kunu, macalo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye makwoni, onongo pe gitwero laro kadi wa lutinogi kono komgi keken.<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />Kace acwalo two gemo i lobo meno, ma aonyo akemona kun dok arwenyo kwo pa jo mapol, ma aneko dano kacel ki lee me tim, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />kadi bed onongo Nua, Daniel ki Yubu gibedo kunu, akwonge ni, onongo pe gitwero laro kadi wa lutinogi. Onongo kitgi ma atir aye gire bilaro kwogi gin ken gi. Man Rwot Lubanga ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:8">Niy 6:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Man aye gin ma Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu tye kawacone ni: Atye ki can angwen ma abicwalo ikom Jerucalem, lweny, kec, lee timgu ki two gemo, wek onek dano woko ducu kacel ki lee ducu. <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Kace inen ngat mo obwot ma obedo kwo ce olaro bene lutinone, ka gubino botwu myero wunen gi. Miyo wubingeyo kitgi ki kit gin ma gitimo ducu marac, man miyo wubiye ni can ma aketo ikom Jerucalem tye kakare. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />Dok wubiye ka wuneno kitgi ki gin ma gitiyo kit ma rac kwede; ci bimiyo wungeyo ni onongo tyen lok ma atir aye omiyo atimo gin ma dong atyeko timoneni, man Rwot Lubanga ma owaco.”<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom olok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kitwero poro yat olok ki yat mukene ningning? Dong yat olok ma kiporo ki yat matye i bungani bere rom mene? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Itwero tongo yate itiyo ki gin mo? Dano twero tongo ci kipayo doko teke ci kiguro ikor ot me ngabo jami? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Yate ber mere me moko mac keken. Ka mac dong owango doge ryoryo ducu ma dong oweko bilo idyere, ci pud dok itwero kwanyone itiyo ki gin mo? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Nen, ma yat meno pud pe owang woko onongo konye dong peke. Dong kit macalo mac owango wokoni kun oweko bilo bene idyere, ci konye dong bibedo peke marom mene, tika dok kitwero kwanyone kitiyo ki gin mo?<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />Man aye gin ma an Rwot Lubanga atye kawacone ni: kit macalo yat olok kikwanyo ki ikin yadi me bunga ci wang wokoni, kitmeno bene abikwanyo jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ci abitimogi i yo acelu. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />Abiciko wanga ikomgi, kadi bed gubwot ki i mac, ci mac pud biwangogi; man miyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ka dong aciko wanga ikomgi. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" />Abimiyo lobo dong doko tim ata, pien jona pe gubedo lugen gubwoto tic bota, man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem taun ma pe gene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Rwot doki oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />En owaco ni, “Mii Jerucalem onen gin me kwer ducu ma en otimo. <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />Tit ki Jerucalem gin ma Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu tye kawacone bote ni:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 16:3">In yam kinywali i lobo pa jo Kanaan; woru obedo jo Amor, ki meni obedo anyira Kit. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />Dong kit macalo kinywali kwede ene aye ni, inino ma kinywali iye kikome tol peni bene pe kingolo, ki komi bene pe kilwoko ki pii wek komi obed maleng, dok pe kiwiro kado ikomi, ci pe bene kiboyi woko ki bongo. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Ngat mo ma kono obedo ki kica ma oromo ikomi obedo peke, onyo me tiyo gin macalo magi ducu ikomi. Ikare ma kinywali dano gubedo ki mar manok tutwal ikomi ma omiyo guboli woko idye bar kamaleng.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />Ikare ma akato ki kangeti, ci aneni ibedo kakwite i remo ma kinywali kwede, ci awaco ki in ma onongo pud itye i remoni ni, ‘Bed kwo, <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />ci idongo malo giri ma komi yot calo ginapita ma i poto.’ Ci idongo ipute nyako mabor wa malo idongo calo yat manyak madit ma kome opire maber. Tununi opong maber, ki yer wii bene olot maboco, ento onongo itye munero labongo bongo mo ikomi.<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />Ka doki akato ki kangeti ci aneni anongo ni mwakani dong oromo me mito co; ci ayaro bongo ma onongo atye kwede woko ikomi, omiyo pe dong ibedo munero. Ada, aketo gicike me nyom kwedi, ci in dong idoko mera. Acike mada ni abimari.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />“Ci akwanyo pii alwoko remo woko ki ikomi, ka dong awiro komi woko ki moo. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />Aruki woko ki bongo mabor ma kideyo maber, ci dok amini war ma dele ber makato ducu, ki bongo camanini me boyo wii ki bongo aridi me umi. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />Dok aruki bene ki ruk me deyo, ci arwako ogul i cingi, kun arwako nyor bene i nguti. <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />Dok arwako agit um bene i umi, ka arwako agit me it i iti ryoryo ducu, ka dong arwako lalukana maber mada iwii. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Onongo yam kiruki ki ruk ma obedo jabu ki ryal, ginarukani onongo obedo bongo camanini mabecone, ki bongo aridi ki bongo ma kideyo maber. Ibedo kacamo kwon ma mokone pwot mada, ki moo kic kacel ki moo jeituni. Ci idongo ma inen mwonya mada, ci idoko daker. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />Ci beri oywek mada i rok ducu. Onongo ibedo mwonya maber mada pi deyo ma aketo ikomi, pien aketi ma inen mwonya mada.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />“Ento in giri ibedo ka geno beri ki ywekani, ci ibedo katimo abor ki jo ducu ma gikato ki kama in itye iye. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Ikwanyo bongini mogo ci iyubu odi jogi ci ideyo komgi woko maber, ka dong imiyo komi woko bot jo ducu i tim me abor calo malaya. Kit tim macalo man pud pe onen, dok bene pe dong binen matwal. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />Dok bene ikwanyo jami me wel me jabu ki ryal mayam amiyo boti, ci itiyo cal dano ma laco ka dong icako timo abor kwedgi. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />Ikwanyo bongini ma kideyo maberi iumu ki kom cal danogu, ci ityero moona woko ki odok ecetana botgi. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />Yam amini cam, amiyo icamo kwon ma mokone pwot adada, moo jeituni kacel ki moo kic, ento in dok ityero woko bot cal jogi macalo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwinygi.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />“Lacen dok ikwanyo awobeni ki anyirani mayam inywalogi kweda, ci ityerogi woko bot cal jogi me bedo gitum awanga. In itamo ni tim me abor ma itimo obedo lok matidi mo ki tung bota <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />ma omiyo ineko lutinona ci ityerogi woko bot cal jogigu me bedo gitum awangani? <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />Ikom tim me kweri ducu ki tim abori ducu ma itimo wii pe opo ikom kare me tinoni, en aye kare ma onongo itye munero ma ginaruka mo pe ikomi, ma onongo itye kakwite iremo ma kinywali kwedeni.”<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem kwo calo malaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco ni, “Can iwii! Can iwii! Lacen ma dong ityeko timo tim maracu, <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" />ci igero kicika piri keni, ka igero dok kabedo ma otinge malo me woro cal jogi inget yoo ducu.” <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />I agiki yoo ducu igero iye kabedo ma otinge malo ka dong icako nyutu beri kunu calo malaya. Ci imiyo jo ducu ma gikato ki kenyo gibutu kwedi, ma imiyo tim me malayani onya omede tutwal. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />Dok bene iweko luwoti ma gin lutarwang ma gin jo Ejipt, gutimo abor kwedi, kun ingeto ki cwinya ni wek kiniga omaka, ci imiyo timi me abori onya omede.<verse eid="EZK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Nen, kombedi dong aryeyo cinga woko ikomi me keto can, ki dok me kwanyo dul me gum ma onongo yam apoko botini woko. Dong atyeko miyi woko i cing lukwori jo Piliciti, ma gidagi tutwal ma lewic bene makogi mada pi timi me abor ma ibedo katimoneni.<verse eid="EZK 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />Dok bene itimo abor ki jo Aciria, pien onongo abor ma itimo ki jo mukeneni pe oromi. Idoko malayagi, ento man ducu mwa, dok gin ma gutimo ikomi bene pud pe oromi. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Imede giri ki tim abori ci itimo abor bene ki lucatwil ma i lobo pa jo Kaldaya, ento kadi bed gubutu kwedi ci gin ma gutimo ikomi bene pud pe oromi.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />Man aye gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone ni, “Cwinyi dong odoko goro woko ki mar, aneno itimo gin magi ducu calo malaya ma lewic pe mako. <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />Igero kicika i agiki yoo ducu ka dok igero kabedo ma otinge malo inget yoo ducu. Ento in onongo pe ibedo calo malaya, pien onongo pe itimo abor pi nongo lim. <verse eid="EZK 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />Ibedo calo dako ma timo abor ki lurok ma gin welo ma ka maro cware. <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Co aye ma gimiyo mot bot mon ma malaya, ento in aye doki imiyo mot bot co ma gimarini, kun iwilogi ki lim i mung ni gua ki i kabedo ducu gubin gubut kwedi. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />In dok ibedo malaya ma kite pat mada ki kit mon mukene ma gin malayagu. Ngat mo ma onongo odiyo in me bedo malaya pe. Pe giculu gin mo boti, ento in aye dok iculu co ma onongo gimarini. Pimeno, in giri kiti pat.”<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Lubanga ogolo ikom Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />Pimeno dong, in malaya ni, winy lok ma an Rwot atye kawacone. <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" />Man aye gin ma Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco ikom in ni, “Ilunyu bongini woko ki ikomi ci imiyo co ma imarogini gubutu kwedi, ci dok ineko lutinoni bene ci ityerogi woko bot cal jogi me bedo gitum. <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />Dong pi lok man omiyo abicoko jo ducu mayam gimari, mayam ibedo kwedgi ki yomcwiny, jo ducu ma onongo imarogi ki jo ducu ma onongo idaggi. Abicokogi ki i kabedo ducu ci amiyo gicung girumi woko dyere, ka dong alunyu bongo woko ki ikomi idong munero, wek guneni nongo dong itye munero. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />Dok abingolokop ikomi calo angolokop ikom mon ma giketo nyom woko kun bene gineko dano. Ci abingolokop ikomi ki akemo ki nyeko madit ma omiyo ito woko. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Ci abimiyo ibedo ite twero pa co ma gimaro in, ci gibicoro kicikani gireto woko piny, dok bene kibimuku kabedo ma otinge malo ma igero me woro cal jogini woko. Gibilunyu bongo woko ki ikomi ci gikwanyo jami me welgu woko ki boti, ka dong giweki idong munero labongo bongo mo ikomi.<verse eid="EZK 16:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />Dok gibikelo dul mony ka lweny ikomi, gibiceli ki got ci gingoli gingidi woko matinotino ki pala lucwan gi. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />Ci gibiwango odinigu woko ducu, dok bene gibicobo kop ma angolo ikomi ki inyim mon mapol. Ci abijuki woko wek pe dong ibedo malaya, ka dong abimiyo igiko miyo mot bot co ma gimarini woko matwal. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />Abitoyo akemona woko ikomi kitmeno, ci nyeko ma onongo atye kwede bene dong bia woko ki ikomi. Ci abibedo dong mamwol, kiniga bene pe dong bimaka ikomi matwal. <verse eid="EZK 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />Onongo wii owil woko ma pe ipo kit macalo abedo katimi kwede ikare ma onongo in pud itidi, dong imiyo kiniga omaka pi gin magi ducu ma itimoni. Pimeno, abiculu kwor ikomi ki gin ma itimo. Pingo itimo tim me tarwang imedo ki tim me kwergu ducu?” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mego ki nyare ma gitye ki lakit kwo acel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />Rwot owaco kitman ni, “Jerucalem, nen dano ducu ma loko ki carolok gibiloko carolok ikomi ni, ‘Nyako cal ki mine.’ <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />In giri i nya pa meni kikome. En okwero cware ki lutinone woko. Inen calo lumegini ma gukwero coggi ki lutinogini. Meni yam Lakit ki woru mere onongo en Laamor. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />Lameru ma okwongo nyimi en aye Camaria, matye tung kumalo ki gangine. Lameru matidine matye ki gangine tung kupiny en aye Codom. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />In yam pe ibedo kalubu kitgi keken, kadi ki timo kit gin me kwergu bene macalo gin, ento pi kare manok mo keken in kiti ocako bale woko marac makato kitgi ikit yo ducu.<verse eid="EZK 16:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" />Dong kit macalo an atye kwoni, man an Rwot Lubanga ma awaco, lameru Codom ki gangi ma ingete pe gutimo kit gin maracu ma in kacel ki gangini wutimoni. <verse eid="EZK 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />Nen, man aye obedo bal pa lameru Codom. En kacel ki anyirane gubedo luwake mada, pien onongo gitye ki cam madwong ma gicamo, ci camone oloyogi kun gibedo mot ki kuc, ento pe gumiyo kit kony mo bot lucan ki jo ma piny obwoyogi. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />Onongo gubedo jo ma lulyere ma okato kare, ci gutimo gin me kwer mapol inyima; pimeno, ikare ma aneno gin ma gutimo, ci atyekogi woko.<verse eid="EZK 16:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />Ci Camaria pe otimo kit tim me bal maromo nucu bal ma in dong itimo. Itimo gin me kwer mapol makato gin me kwer ma en otimo. Dok bene imiyo lumegini ginen calo jo ma kitgi atir ka kiporogi kwedi, ki kit gin me kwer ducu ma dong ityeko timogini. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Dong kombedi, in myero icir lewic. Bali dong rac atikatika makato bal pa lumegini ducu ma omiyo ginen calo jo ma gipeke ki bal mo ni. Gin lokgi tye atir ma okato loki. Kitmeno in bene myero lewic omaki, dok myero icir cac ma kicayi kwede pien imiyo lumegini ginen calo jo ma kitgi atir.”<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bidwoko gum pa Codom ki Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />Rwot otito lok man bot Jerucalem ni, “Abidwoko gumi boti, ki gum pa Codom ki gangi ma ingete, ki gum pa Camaria ki gangi ma ingete. Abidwoko lonyoni bene boti. <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />Lewic bimaki ikomi kekeni, dok bene cac ma kibicayi kwede bikweyo cwiny lumegini ni, gin kara gitye maber ada. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Gibibedo maber ki lonyo doki, ci in bene kacel ki gangi ma ingeti ducu wubibedo maber kit mayam con. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />Itamoni ikare ca ma iwakeni onongo pe ibedo kabolo ongon ki nying lameru Codom macalo i lok abokani kun ipong ki awaka ki cac, <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" />ikare ma timi maracu pud peya onen kamalengi? Kombedi dong iloke idoko calo en, ginacaya pa jo Edom ki luwotgi ducu, ki pa jo Piliciti, ki pa jo ma gibedo cokcok ma gurumi kun gidagini. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" />Ci dong ibiciro can malit pi bali ma itimo me lewic ki gin me kwer mapol ma itimo.” Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gicike ma bedo nakanaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />Ci Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco ni, “Abitimi ma oporo gin mayam itimo, pien icayo kwong meri dok bene ituru gicikeni woko. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Ento pud abipo ikom gicikena ma aketo kwedi cake ikare me tinoni. Ci dong abiketo gicikena kwedi ma bedo rii nakanaka. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />Ibipo kit macalo ibedo kwede ducu, ci lewic bimaki ka akwanyo lameru madit ki lameru matidi adwokogi cen boti. Ci abimiyo dong gibedo macalo anyirani, ento pe pi gicike macon ma aketo kwedini. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />Dok abimoko gicikena kwedi, ci ibingeyoni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />Ikare ma abiweko ki bal ducu mayam itiyo, ci ibipo ikomgi ci lewic bimaki matek mada ma pe dong bene ibingamo dogi kalok.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom olok ki ocur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />Owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, wac lok me koc lit, ci ilok carolok bot jo Icrael <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />wek gunge gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone. Yam tye ocur mo madit matye ki bwome madito, ma oyaro woko malac. Onongo yec kome nen mwonya mada matye ki rangi mapol ma kitgi patpat. Otuk ocito i Lebanon ci oturu cwiny yat cedar me Lebanon woko. <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />Oturu cwiny wi yat lano cedar me agikine, ci ocito kwede otero wa i lobo pa lucatwil, ci oketo i taun madit pa lucatwil. <verse eid="EZK 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />Dok okwanyo jang yat ki obokene ki i lobo Icrael ci opito i lobo mabere kama pii dwong iye wek odong. Opito kit macalo kipito kwede yat ma dongo i dog kulu, <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />ci odoko yat olok ma ojany oluk lapiny. Jange ojany okemo tung bot ocur, ki lwite obedo kadonyo piny i ngom kama yat ocung iye. Kitmeno ocako doko yat olok, ci oketo jange mapol wa pote bene dong ocako lot oluk mada.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />Ento yam onongo tye ocur mo mukene madit matye ki bwome madit ki yece madwong. Nen, lwit yat olok man olot oket ki piny i ngom okemo tung bote, ci oloko jange ma pote oluk bene okemo tung bote kun geno ni bimiyo ecwiyo pii ma oromo makato pii ma en olimo ki ikabedo kama onongo en dongo iyeni. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Ento onongo yam kipito i ngom mabere matye inget pii madwong, wek oket jange ma otegi mapol, onyak nyige, wek odok yat olok ma pire tek adada.”<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu openyo kuman ni, “Yat olok man bidongo maber ci bedo kwo? Ci ocur mukwongoni pe biputu woko ki lwite ducu, ci tongo jange woko, wek pote ma pud lot alotani otwo woko? Man pe bimito dano ma kome tek nyo lwak me rok ma gitek me putune woko ki lwite ducu. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Ada, dong kipito, ento tika twero dongo bedo kwo? Pe bitwo woko liweng kace yamo ma a tung kunyango obino okodo matek ikome ci ocoro woko piny? Pe bitwo woko ki ikabedo kama onongo tye kadongo iyeni?”<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Te lok me carolok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:15-20">2 Luk 24:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10-13">2 Tek 36:10-13</ref></char></note>“Peny jo magi ma gin Lujemoni kace gingeyo telok me carolok man. Wac botgi ni rwot me Babilon obino i Jerucalem ci omako rwot ki rwodine ci odok kwedgi cen i Babilon. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />Ci okwanyo latin ker acel, oketo gicike kwede, kun omiye okwongo kwong ni ebigwoko cike meno. Ci omako jo madito ma ngene oterogi woko <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />wek ker dong okwe woko mot, pe dok oile malo, dok bene me neno ni kigwoko gicikene wek ker ocung. <verse eid="EZK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Ento rwot me Juda ojemo woko ci ocwalo lukwena gucito i Ejipt, kakelo bote lwak aguragura ki dul mony madit. Tika en biloyo lweny? En twero loyo pi timo gin ma kitmeno? En twero turu gicike ci ringo bwot woko ma pe kong nongo kiketo can ikome?”<verse eid="EZK 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />Nen, “Dong adada akwonge ni,” man Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco, “Rwotnu bito i Babilon, pien ocayo kwonge, dok oturu gicike ma onongo en oketo ki rwot me Babilon, ma okete me bedo iwi komker. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Kadi ki Parao ki dul monye mateki ki buca mony madit pe gibitwero konye ki lweny ka jo Babilon gutoro cel me lobo gurume kwede woko pi neko lwak jo mapol ma gibedo kenyo. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Dong kit macalo en ocayo kwonge, kun oturu bene gicike ma onongo en oketo, dok otimo gin magi ducu, pimeno en pe bibwot.”<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />Ma omiyo Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “An Lubanga makwo, pimeno abiketo can ikome pi kwong ma okwongo inyima ci en ocayo ki pi gicikena bene ma en oturu wokoni. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />Abiciko obwona wek omok iye, ci en bimoko ii owicca, abitere wa i Babilon ka dong acako ngolo kop ikome ki kunu pi lok roro ma en obedo kaketone ikoma. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />Lulwenye ma kiyerogi ayera kibinekogi woko ducu ki pala lucwan, ki jo ma gudong makwo gibiket woko ata. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an Rwot dong atyeko loko lok man.”<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Lubanga pi miyo gen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “An kikoma aye ma abikwanyo cwiny yat cedar ma toconeni ki i lano wiye, abituru ki malo kunu, ci an kikoma aye abipito iwi got mabor kama otene. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />Ci abipito iwi got mabor matye i lobo Icraeli; wek ojany iye mapol onyak nyige, ci odok yat madit wek kit kwayi lee ducu me tim gubin gubed i tere; ki kit kwayi winyo ducu ma gibigero odigi i tipu jange ducu. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Dong yadi ducu me tim bingeyo ni An a Rwot aye ma ngolo yat madit ma odongo mabor, ki yat matidi amiyo doko yat madit ma odongo mabor, dok bene amiyo yat madyak two woko, ka amiyo yat ma otwo pote lot ci luk mada.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 17:24">An Rwot dong atyeko loko lok man, dok bene abitiyo gin ma onongo dong awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Dano ma timo bal bito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:29">Jer 31:29</ref></char></note> Owaco ni, “Man kit carolok ango ma dano gibedo kanwoyone teretere ma okemo lobo Icraeli? ‘Kwarowa gucamo nyig olok mawace, man odingo lak lutino woko.’”<verse eid="EZK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />Nen, “Dong akwonge ni,” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco, “Pe dong wubiloko carolok man wunwoyo i Icrael matwal. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Nen, kwo pa wego nyo pa latin ducu mera. Dano ma timo bal bito.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />Kong itam pi dano ma kite atir, ma tiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir. <verse eid="EZK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />En pe woro cal jogi pa Luicrael dok bene pe camo lee me gitum ma gityero i wang jogi. En pe balo ikom dako pa lawote me butu kwede, dok bene pe butu ki dako mere ikare ma nongo dakonu twoyo two kwer. <verse eid="EZK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />En pe unu dano mo dok bene pe yako jami pa ngat mo. En kwanyo jami ma labanyane ojengo bote dwoko cen bot labanyane; ki bene miyo kwon bot jo ma kec nekogi, ci dok bene miyo bongi me aruka bot jo matye munero. <verse eid="EZK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />En pe miyo lim me den wek enong iye magoba, ki en bene kwero timo gin marac woko, ento en ngolo kop ki ada dok ki gen ikin dano. <verse eid="EZK 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>En Lubu cika ducu dok bene gwoke tutwal kun tiyo gin ma an aciko ducu. En bene kite atir dong pimeno adada en bibedo kwo,” man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />“Pimeno ka gwok nyo en onywalo wode ma layak dok lanek dano bene, meno nongo en otimo gin mayam wone pe otimo. <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" />Ce en bene camo ringo lee ma kityero i wang jogi, dok bene balo dako pa lawote woko wek ecit ebut kwede. <verse eid="EZK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />Ci en unu lucan ki jo ma piny obwoyogi, ki en yako jami pa dano, dok gwoko gin ma labanyane oketo bote macalo gin ajenga ma pe kwanyo dwoko cen bote. Ka dong en woro cal jogi, dok bene timo gin me kwer ma pe wace, <verse eid="EZK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />en bene miyo lim me den kun nongo mito ni enong iye magoba. En tika bibedo kwo? Pe bibedo kwo. En dong otyeko timo gin me kwer magi ducu, pimeno en bito pirgi. Alii me tone bibedo i wiye gire kene.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />Ci kong dong iket ni danoni onywalo wode. Latin meno neno kit bal ducu ma wone otiyo, ci obedo ki lworo, pe timo lakodi bal ma wone otiyoni. <verse eid="EZK 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />En pe woro cal jogi pa Luicrael, dok bene pe ocamo ringo lee me gitum ma kityero i wang jogi. En pe balo dako pa lawote kun butu kwede, <verse eid="EZK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />ci pe timo ngat mo marac, pe bene yako jami pa ngat mo. En pe kwanyo gin mo me aketa macalo kijengo kadi ki acel. Ci en miyo kwon bot jo ma kec nekogi dok bene miyo bongi me aruka bot jo matye munero. <verse eid="EZK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />En kwero timo gin marac, pe miyo lim me den wek enong iye magoba. En lubu cika dok bene gwoko gin ma an aciko ducu kun tiyo bene. Pimeno en pe bito pi bal pa wone; ento adada en gire bibedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Ento wone bito pi bale; pien otimo tim me bura, dok oyako omine ki bene, otimo gin ma pe nen maber wacel ikin lutugi.”<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />Ci dong in, “Ipenyo ni, ‘Pingo latin pe myero onen can pi bal pa wone?’ Lagam me peny man tye kit man ni, latin otiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir, dok bene ogwoke tutwal kun tiyo gin ma an aciko ducu. Adada en gire bibedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Nwo 24:16</ref></char></note>Ento dano ma timo bal bito mere. Latin pe bineno can pi bal pa wone, kadi ki wego bene pe myero olim can pi bal pa wode. Dano ma kite atir gire bilimo mot pi gin matye atir ma en otiyo, ki latim marac bene bilimo can pi gin maracu ma en otimo.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />Ento ka dano ma latim marac oloke oweko timo bal ducu mayam en otiyo, ce olubu cika kun tiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir, adada, ci en bibedo kwo; pe bito. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />Bale ducu mayam en otimo an abiwekogi ducu, ci en bibedo kwo, pien otiyo gin matye atir.” <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu openyo ni, “Wutamo ni cwinya bedo yom me neno ka latim marac to? Pe gire, amito ni en ongut owek timo bal ci oloke odwog bota wek obed makwo.<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />Ento kace dano ma kite atir oloke oweko tiyo gin matye atir woko ce ocako timo bal, kun timo bene gin me kwer kit ma latim marac timoni, tika en bibedo kwo? Dong gin matye atir ducu ma en ceng otimo pe kibipo pire kadi ki acel. En bito pi lok roro ki pi bal mapol ma en otimo.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />Ento wun jo Icrael wuwaco ni, ‘Gin ma Rwot tye ka timoneni pe atir.’ Ento pe gin ma wun wutimoni aye ma pe tye atir dok pe kakare? <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Ka dano ma kite atir oloke oweko tiyo gin matye atir ce ocako timo bal, en bito pi balenu. En bito pi bal ma dong otyeko timone. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Ka dano ma latim marac ongut ikom tim maracu ma en otimo ce oloke ocako tiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir, ci en bilaro kwone. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Dong kit macalo en obedo kalwodo lok ki i cwinye ce en ongut oloke oweko timo bal ducu mayam obedo ka timogi, i adada en bibedo kwo, pe bito. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Ento wun jo Icrael pud wuwaco ni, ‘Gin ma Rwot tye katimoneni pe atir dok pe kakare.’ Wun wutamo ni gin ma atye katimoneni pe atir dok pe kakare? Ento gin ma wun wutimoni aye mono ma pe tye atir dok pe kakare.<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />Pimeno, an Rwot Matwero ducu dong abingolo kop ikomwu, wun jo Icrael, kun angolokop pa dano acel acel lubu gin ma en otiyo. Ci dong wungut, wuloke wuweko timo bal, pe wuwek balwu otyekwu woko. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Dong wuwek bal ducu mayam wubedo katiyone ikomani, wucak dong bedo ki tam manyen dok ki cwiny manyen bene. Pingo wun jo Icrael wumito ni wutim bal wek wuto woko?” <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" />An pe amito ni dano mo oto, man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. “Wuloke wungut ci wuwek timo bal wek wubed kwo.”<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Wer me kumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />Wucak wer me kumu pi rwodi me Icrael, <verse eid="EZK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />kun wuwero ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Meni nene obedo macalo min labwor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">ikin lwak labwor!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Obutu ikin lutino labwor, kun pito lutinone.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />Opito latine acel ci opwonyo ki dwar;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">odoko wod labwor madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">obedo kamako dano kun neko ci camogi woko.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Rok mapol guwinyo pire ci gudongo oduru ikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">ci gukwinyo bur me make ci guweko en opoto iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Gugole woko ki goli ci gukete i canduk ka gutere wa i lobo Ejipt,<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />Ka mine dong oneno ni kibodo wiye nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">ma gene dong orwenyo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">ci okwanyo latine mukene opwonyo oloko odoko twon wod labwor madit.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Ikare ma dong odongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">obedo kawot kacel ki labwor mukenegu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Ka dong opwonyo dwar kit me mako lee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">obedo kamako dano kun nekogi ci camogi woko.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Oturu cel gogogi otyeko woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">ci oketo taun gi woko ducu ma omiyo odoko wi obur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">ma omiyo jo ma gibedo i lobo meno gubedo ki ur dok ki lworo madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">ikare ma nongo en kok.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Jo me rok ducu gucoke ka lweny ikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">guciko owic woko ikabedo ducu me make,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">kadok guciko obwogi gurume kwede woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">ci opoto woko i bur ma gin gukwinyo.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />Gugole woko ki goli ci gukete i canduk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">ci gutere woko wa bot rwot me Babilon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Gutere gukete i ot mabuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">wek pe dong kiwiny kokone matwal iwi godi me Icrael.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yat olok ma otwo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />Meni yam obedo calo yat olok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">ma kipito i poto olok matye inget pii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Pi pii madwong ma onongo tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">omiyo oketo jange mapol dok onyako nyige mabup.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Jang olok man onongo gitego mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">ma omiyo odongo ci odoko odoo ker pa luloc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Olok man odongo mabor adada ma wiye mito gudu polo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Dano ducu guneno kit ma pote oluk kwede</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">ki kit ma bore onongo tye kwede.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Ento kiputu olok ni woko ki lwite ducu ki kiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">ci kibolo woko wa i ngom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Yamo oa ki kunyango, okodo, ci otwoyo nyige woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Kituru jangegu woko ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">ma gutwo ci kiwango woko ki mac.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />Kombedi dok kinako dok kipito itim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:13">i lobo ma otwo ma pii peke iye.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Mac omoko ci olyel ikor yat oloki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">ci mac owango jange ki nyigegu woko ducu liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Jange ducu dong pe bibedo tek doki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">odoo ker pa laloc pe dong bibedo iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Man wer me kumu ma kibedo kawerone kare ki kare.<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gumede ki jemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />Ludongo mogo ki ikin ludongo pa jo Icrael gubino bota kapenyo dog Rwot inino dwe apar me dwe me abic, i mwaka me abirone, ci gubino inyima. <verse eid="EZK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Ci Rwot oloko kweda kun waco ni, <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />“Wod pa dano, lok ki ludongo pa Icrael, kun iwaco botgi ni, Rwot Lubanga matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, ‘Man wun wubino kapenyo doga bo? Akwonge ni, pe wubipenyo doga. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.’<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />Dong in wod pa dano, ibingolo kop ikomgi bo? Ka kumeno ci dong ingol kop ikomgi. Po wigi ikom gin me kwer mayam kwarigi gutiyo. <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:2-8">Nia 6:2-8</ref></char></note>Tit botgi lok man ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaconeni. Ikare ma ceng ayero Icrael, akwongo kwong bot likwayo pa Yakobo. Dok anyute botgi i lobo Ejipt, kun awaco botgi ni, ‘An a Rwot Lubangawu.’ <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />Inino meno bene en aye acike kwedgi ni abikwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt ci aterogi i lobo ma ayero pirgi, lobo Kanaan maber dok ceko cam mabup, ma en aye lobo me deyo adada dok ber makato kun loyo mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />Ci awaco botgi bene ni gubol cal jogi me kwer ma gimarogu woko, dok ni pe myero gubal komgi ki lubanga mogo me gobagoba pa jo Ejipt, pien an aye a Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="EZK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />Ento gin gujemo ikoma gukwero winyo loka. Gin ducu pe gubolo cal jogigi me kwer ma gimarogu woko dok bene pe gubwoto woro lubanga pa jo Ejipt me gobagobani. Pi man omiyo atamo ni onongo myero aony akemona ikomgi dok ato kinigana ikomgi ki idye lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Ento pe dong atimo gin ma onongo atamo ni abitimoni, pien meno onongo twero miyo pe giworo nyinga, ci miyo bene gipyedo nyinga ikin lurok kama onongo jo Icrael gibedo iye; pien yam aloko bot jo Icrael ki inyim jo ma gin gibedo ikin gi ni abikwanyo jo Icrael ki i lobo Ejipt akelogi woko.<verse eid="EZK 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />Kitmeno akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt ci akelogi wa idye tim. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note> Ci amiyo cika botgi ka dok anyutigi gin ma aciko ducu, kun nongo ngat magwoko cika en aye bedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:13-17">Nia 31:13-17</ref></char></note>Amiyo botgi bene ceng Cabit ni gin gugwoki, ma en aye lanyut matye ikin an ki gin, wek gunge ni an Rwot aye ma alonyogi miyo gibedo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />Ento jo Icrael gujemo woko ikoma ki i tim, pe gulubu cika dok bene gukwero tiyo gin ma an aciko ducu, kun ka onongo ngat mo ogwoko cika ci en aye bedo kwo. Gupyedo wa Cabita woko marac adada. Ma omiyo atamo ni myero aony akemona ikomgi ki idye tim, wek atyekgi woko liweng matwal. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Ento pe dong atimo gin ma onongo ceng atamo ni abitimoni, meno onongo twero miyo pe giworo nyinga, miyo bene gipyedo nyinga ikin lurok kun an akwanyo jo Icrael ki i lobo Ejipt akelogi woko ma gin bene gineno. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Wel 14:26-35</ref></char></note>Dok bene yam akwongo kwong botgi ki itim ni pe dong abiterogi i lobo ma onongo dong atyeko miyone botgi, lobo maber atika dok ceko cam mabup, ma en aye lobo me deyo adada makato lobo mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />Akwongo kwong pien onongo gukwero lubu cika, dok bene pe gubedo katiyo gin ma an aciko ducu, ci gupyedo Cabita bene. Gumaro gigi woro cal jogigi. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Ento kica omaka ikomgi. Pe anekogi woko dok bene pe atyekogi woko ki i tim kunu, <verse eid="EZK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />ci awaco bot lutinogi ni, ‘Pe wulub cik mayam kwariwu guketo; pe bene wulub kitgi, dok bene pe wubal komwu ki woro cal jogigini. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />An Rwot aye Lubangawu. Wulub cika dok bene wugwoke kun wutiyo gin ma an aciko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Wugwok ceng Cabita obed nino maleng botwu, ci wuwek obed lanyut me cike ma waketo ikin an ki wun, ci dong wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubangawu.’<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />Ento lutinogi bene gujemo woko ikoma; pe bene gulubu cika dok pe gugwoke me tiyo gin ma an aciko ducu, kun kono nongo ngat ma gwoko cika aye bedo kwo. Gupyedo Cabita woko. Ma omiyo atamo ni onongo myero aony akemona ikomgi madit wek ato ki kinigana bene ikomgi ki idye tim. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Ento ajuku cinga, pe dong atimo gin ma onongo atamo ni abitimoni, meno nongo twero miyo pe giworo nyinga, miyo bene gipyedo nyinga ikin lurok, kama an akwanyo jo Icrael ki i lobo Ejipt akelogi woko ma gin bene ginenoni. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>Dok bene akwongo kwong mukene ki i tim ni abiketogi woko ikin lurok, ci akeyogi woko iwi lobo ducu. <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />Atimo man pien gukwero lubu cika dok bene gukwero tiyo gin ma aciko ducu, gupyedo Cabita, dok gubedo kaworo cal jogi mayam kwarigi guworoni. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />Lacen dok amiyo botgi cik maracu kun acikogi ki kit cik mogo ma pe twero miyo dano bedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />Amiyo gubalo komgi ki mot mapatpat ma gityero bot cal jogi, dok bene amiyo gutyero lutino kayogi ma co calo gitum awanga. Atimo man pi miyogi lworo madwong ki pi keto can ikomgi; wek gunge ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />Ma omiyo kombedi dong in wod pa dano, lok ki jo Icrael kun itito lok ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone botgi. Man aye kit yo mukene mayam kwarigi gucaya kwede dok bene pe gubedo luwiny dok omiyo pe gin ogene ci oweko yam pe gutiyo gin matye atir inyima. <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />Akelogi i lobo mayam onongo acike ni abimiyo botgi. Ci ikare ma guneno cere ki yadi ma potgi oluk mabeco ikabedo ducu, ci gutyero gitum woko ducu kunu. Gungeto cwinya oweko kiniga omaka pi gitum awangagi ma guwango, ki pi gityer amata ma gukelo guonyo kununi. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />Apenyogi ni, ‘Wang jogi magi ma wucito iyeni gin obedo gin ango?’ Ma omiyo nyinge kilwongo ni Bama nio wa onyo. <verse eid="EZK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />Kombedi dong itit lok man ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaconeni bot jo Icrael: pingo wumito ni wutim lakit bal acel mayam kwariwu gutimoni kun bene dong wungak woko wubedo kaworo cal jogi? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Kadi bed wa ikare man pud wutyero lakit mot acelu dok bene wutyero awobewu iwi mac me gitum awanga, ma omiyo wubalo komwu kekenwu pi woro cal jogiwugu ducu. Wun jo Icrael pud dok wubibino kapenyo doga? Dong akwonge ni, pe wubipenyo doga. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />Dong wutyeko moko tamwu woko kun wumito wubed calo jo me rok mukeneni, wumito wubed calo jo me kaka ducu matye iwi lobo ducu, wek wuwor yadi ki godi, ento meno pe bitime matwal.<verse eid="EZK 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga keto can pi bal dok weko bal pa dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />Dong akwonge ni, abilweny ikomwu ki tekona ducu, ci akemona bene abionyo ikomwu ducu, ci dong abibedo Rwot ma loyowu. Man an Rwot Lubanga ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Ci abinyutu twerona botwu kun aonyo akemona woko ikomwu ka acokowu woko ducu ki ikin lurok ma iwi lobo ducu kama yam gikeyowu wucito iye, ci akelowu aketowu kacel. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />Abikelowu i tim pa lurok, ka dong abingolo kop ikomwu ki kunu wang ki wang. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" />Kit macalo yam apwodo kwariwu idye tim i lobo Ejipt, ci abipwodowu bene kitmeno. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />Abidiyowu ki tek nio ka wubilubu gicike ma aketo kwedwu. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />Abikwanyo jo ma gin lujemoni ki jo ma gin lutim bal ikoma woko ki ikinwu. Abikwanyogi akelogi woko wa i lobo kama yam gubedo kawot iye macalo welo, ento pe gibidonyo i lobo pa jo Icrael. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco ni, “Kombedi dong wun jo Icrael, wun ducu wucit wutii giwu bot cal jogiwu. Ento acikowu matek mada ni lacen inge man omyero dong wuwiny loka, ma pe dong wupyedo nyinga malengi matwal, dok pe dong wutyero motwu bot cal jogi bene.”<verse eid="EZK 20:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" />Dok an Rwot Lubanga awaco ni, “Wun jo Icrael ducu wubiwora ki kunu i lobo meno, iwi got mera maleng, ki iwi got me lobo Icrael mabori. Ci dong cwinya bibedo yom i komwu ki kunu, ci abimito motwu, kit motwu mabeco makato ducu me gityer, ki gityerwu maleng. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />Lacen ka dong acokowu woko ducu ki ikin lurok ma iwi lobo ducu kama yam kikeyowu wucito iye ci akelowu aketowu kacel, abijolowu macalo gitum awanga ma ngwece kur me lakwe cwiny. Ci dong abinyute botwu ni an aleng dok rok ducu gibineno man ki wanggi. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />Ka dong akwanyowu adwokowu cen i lobo Icrael, en lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo bot kwariwuni, ci wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />Ci wubipo pi balwu ki gin ducu me kwer ma wutimo ma omiyo wubalo komwu woko kekenwu. Wubibedo ki kec cwiny i komwu kekenwu pi gin ducu maracu me lewic ma wutimoni. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" />Wun jo Icrael wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot, pien pe atiyo kwedwu kun lubu gin maracu ma wutimo, nyo ma oporo kitwu maraci, ento atiyo kwedwu kun agwoko deyo me nyinga wek kiwora.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mac olyel tung kupiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />Rwot Lubanga dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, nen tung kupiny. Wac lok ikom kabedo matye tung kupiny, dok bene itit lok ikom lobo bunga me Negeb. <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" />Tit lok marac me nebi ikom bunga me Negeb wek owiny gin ma Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu tye kawaconeni: nen, abimoko mac, ci abiwango yadi ma otwo ki yadi madyak ducu woko ki i in! Gin mo ma bineko leb mac man ma lyeli bibedo peke. Mac man biwang nya cake ki tung kupiny o kwede wa tung kumalo ci wango kabedo ducu. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" />Ci Dano ducu gibineno ni an Rwot aye ma acwinyo mac man wek ngat mo pe onek woko.”<verse eid="EZK 20:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" />Ci awaco ni, “Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, dano ducu giwaco lok ikoma ni, ‘An pe abedo ngat ma kalok loko kwedgi ci alok i carolok me koclit kare ducu?’”<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Pala lucwan pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, cik wangi inen Jerucalem ci itit lok me nebi me juk ikom kabedone ducu ma dano giworo iye lubangagu. Tit lok me juk bene ikom lobo Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />Wac bot dano ducu ma gibedo i lobo Icrael ni an a Rwot awaco ni, ‘Atye ki lok ikomwu. Abiwoto pala lucwana woko ki i akurane, ci anekowu woko ducu, jo ma kitgi atir ki jo ma gin lutim maracu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Dong ka atiyo man, abitic ki pala lucwana kun anekowu woko ducu, jo ma kitgi atir ki jo ma gin lutim maracu, cake ki tung kumalo o kwede wa tung kupiny. <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Ci dano ducu gibingeyo ni an a Rwot dong awoto pala lucwana woko ki i akurane; pe doki abidwoko i akurane.’<verse eid="EZK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />Wod pa dano, cur calo cwinyi mito dem woko kun nongo geni mito rwenyo woko. Cur giri ki keccwiny madit mada ki i kabedo kama jo ducu twero neni. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />Ka inen dano gupenyo in ni pingo itye kacur, ci itit botgi ni pi lok man mamito timeni. Tit botgi ni ka inen lok man bitime cwinygi bipong ki lworo. Ci cinggi bikwe woko doko goro. Tekcwiny mayam gitye kwede bitum woko. Ci conggi bene bibedo kamyel amyela calo pii ma tage. Nen, kare dong obino woko; lok man dong bicobe kakare.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />Ci Rwot dok owaca ni, <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />“Wod pa dano, tit loka. Myero itit lok ma an atye kawaconeni bot jo ducu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">‘Pala lucwan, pala lucwan dong kipako lake woko mabit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">dok bene kijwayo kome olil woko maber licwic.<verse eid="EZK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />Kipako lake mabit me neko dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">ci kijwayo ni wek omeny mawil calo lutkot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">Ngat mo matwero jukune peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:10">pien wun dong wucayo pwod ma amiyowu dok wukwero winyo tama ma amiyo botwu.<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />Dong kimiyo pala lucwan kitye karudune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">wek dong obed maber ma kiromo makone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">Dong kipako lake woko mabit dok bene kijwayo kome woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">wek dong kimii woko i cing lanek dano.<verse eid="EZK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />Wod pa dano, dange matek kun ikok kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">pala lucwan man kimiyo pi neko jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">ki pi neko rwodi ducu me Icrael.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Ci kibinekogi woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">kacel ki jona ma gudongegu ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Ma omiyo myero idong emi pi gen madong orwenyo woko!’<verse eid="EZK 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />An atye katemowu atema wun jona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 21:13">Ento ka pud wumede ki kwero winyo tama ma kimiyo botwuni, ci dong wutamo ni gin ma kit magi pe bitime i komwu?” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />“Kombedi dong, wod pa dano, tit loka. Ci idong cingi, ci pala lucwan bibino piny kiryo nyo kidek. Man aye pala lucwan ma neko mere dano, pala lucwan mamiyo lworo dok ma neko dano tyeko woko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Pala lucwan man miyo tekcwiny pa jona rwenyo woko, ki jo mapol gibipoto i dog taun madito ducu. Dong atyeko miyo pala lucwan ma mil amila; kijwayo meny calo lutkot ma wil, dong kityeko rudune woko pi neko dano. <verse eid="EZK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Ngol tung acuc ki tung acam, in pala lucwan mabiti! <verse eid="EZK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Ci an bene abidongo cinga, ka kinigana dong bitum woko. An Rwot dong aloko.”<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pala lucwan pa rwot me Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, ket alama ma nyutu yoo aryo kama rwot me Babilon bibino ki iye ki pala lucwane. Ci icib lanyut yoo kama yoo ma cito kadonyo i taun madit poke kwede ki iye. <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Ci inyut kamaleng kama yoo aryonu gicito iye. Yoo acel cito i Raba ma en aye gang pa jo Ammon, ki mukeneneni binyutu yoo ma cito i Juda, ma cito donyo wa idye Jerucalem kikome ma kirumu woko litik ki cel gogo mateki. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Ci laloc me Babilon bicung i angaka ngaka yoo aryo kama kicibo iye lanyut yooni. Ci en bicung kenyo katyeto tyet, wek enen yoo mene ma myero elubi; biyengo aterogu, ka bipenyo cal lubangane, ci bingiyo acwiny me lee ma kityero me gitum. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Dong kwir ma en omako i cinge lacuc aye binyutu Jerucalem. Man tito bote me ngamo doge me koko, ki me dange ki dwon me mony ki woo malongo, ki me keto yat latwom cel orum gang meno woko bene; ci bitoro cel lobo rumu gang woko. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Man binen macalo tyet me goba ki tung bot jo ma i Jerucalem, ki pi kwong gi maleng madong gukwongoni. Ento lok man tye me poyo wigi ikom balgi ci binyutu ni kibimakogi woko amaka. <verse eid="EZK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />Man aye gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone: wumiyo kipo ikom balwu, ma omiyo balwu kinyutu kun kiyarogi kamaleng. Ci dano ducu gingeyo ni wubalo. Dok bene wunyutu balwu woko ducu ma wutiyo. Dong atyeko ngolo kop woko i komwu, pimeno abimiyowu woko i cing lukworwu.<verse eid="EZK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />Nen, ninoni tye kabino, in latim marac, in rwot marac maloyo Icrael, ma en aye dong nino ma kibiketo iye can malit ki pwod ikomi me agiki. <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko. Kwany lalukana ki kitambara labo wic woko ki iwii. Pe tye gin mo ducu ma bibedo kit macalo gitye kwedeni. Abitingo lucan ailo malo kama ber! Ci jo ma gitye ki twero me loc ikare man kibidwokogi woko piny! <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Ka dong abimiyo taun madit man doko wi obur, wi obur, wi obur! Ento gin man pud pe bitime nio wang ma ngat ma dong ayero me keto can magi ki me miyo pwod ikom taun maditi obino.<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubanga bingolokop ikom jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jer 49:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-7">Eje 25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>In wod pa dano, tit lok kun iwaco ni, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong owaco lok ma okemo jo Ammon, ki kit ma gitye kwede kayeto jo Icrael. Wac botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">‘Pala lucwan, pala lucwan dong kiyubu woko me neko dano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">dong kijwayo woko tye kameny amenya calo lutkot mawil.’<verse eid="EZK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />Tit bot jo Ammon ni ginanyuta ki gin anena ma gineno iwang lekgu ducu goba, dok bene gin jo ma gityeto tyet me goba me bwologi. Ci dong ninogi tye kabino, gin jo maracu, en aye nino ma kibiketo iye can malit ki pwod ikomgi me agiki. Kibingolo ngutgi woko ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="EZK 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />Dwok pala lucwan i akurane kakare. Abingolo kop ikomi i kabedo kama yam kwoni ocake iye, wa i lobo kama yam kinywali iye. <verse eid="EZK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />Ci abionyo kinigana ikomi; dok bene abikutu mac me akemona ikomi man miyo ibiwinyo lwak arem malit tutwal. Abimiyi bene woko i cing jo mager ma gin lutim bwami marac ma gingeyo neko dano tutwal, ci gibineki woko. <verse eid="EZK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />Kibiwangi woko ki mac. Kibineki woko i lobowu kikome, pimeno ngat mo ma bipo piri dong bedo pe matwal. Pien an Rwot dong atyeko loko.”<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa jo Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />En owaco ni, “In wod pa dano, in tika iyube me ngolo kop ikom taun madit man ma opong ki lunek mapol tutwali? Tit bot jo Jerucalem gin me kwer ducu ma dong gutyeko timoneni. <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />Wac botgi ni, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: pien dong wutyeko neko jo mapol ma gubedo i taun madit man, dok bene dong wubalo komwu kekenwu pi woro cal jogi, pimeno karewu bene tye kabino. <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />Dong wutingo alii pi dano ma wunekoni, dok bene komwu obale woko pi cal jogi ma wutiyogini; ma omiyo dong wudiro ninowu onyiko cok, kare me mwakawu ma kiciko pire dong oo pimeno amiyo wudoko ginacaya bot lurok ducu, ki ginanyera bot jo me lobo ducu. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Jo ma gitye cok kwedwu ki jo ma gitye kama boco ducu kibinyerowu, wun dong olano nyingwu dok oweko kabedowu obale woko, ma jamine tye ma onywene ki koko bene tye licur iye. <verse eid="EZK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />Nen, rwodi ducu me Icrael ma gitye i taun madit man, gingene pi tekogi ci gibedo kaneko dano jwi. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:21-22">22:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17">24:17</ref></char></note>Pe tye ngat mo i taun madit man ma woro lunyodone. Dok gibedo kaunu labedo matye i lobo; dok timgi ikom lutino kic ki mon to nen marac tutwal <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:30">Lev 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:2">26:2</ref></char></note>Gubedo bene kacayo jamina maleng, ki dok bene gupyedo ceng Cabita. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Tye jo mogo ikinwu ma giloko lok me tongo dano wek kinek woko. Jo mukenenu ma ikinwu gucamo cam ma kityero bot cal jogi ma iwang jogi matye iwi godi. Ci gutimo tim kipyeda tutwal idye gang kun gitiyo tim me kwele ma lemo cwiny. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:7-20">Lev 18:7-20</ref></char></note>Dano gibutu ki megigi ki ciwegigigu i Jerucalem; dok bene gidiyo mon gi ki tek ikare ma nongo gitwoyo two kwer ci gibutu kwedgi tetek. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />Dok gutimo gin me kwer bene kun bene gitimo abor ki mon pa luwotgi. Jo mukene gitimo tim kipyeda i kor ciwodgi, ki jo mukene gibalo kom lumegigi ma anyira pa wegigi kikome. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Nia 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:8">23:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lev 25:36-37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Nwo 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19">23:19</ref></char></note>Jo mogo gineko dano pi lim ma nongo kiculugi kwede, jo mukene limo magoba madwong, ki jo mukene nongo lim pi yako jami pa luwotgi tektek; ma omiyo wigi dong owil woko ikoma.” Man Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />“Nen, pimeno dong abidongo cinga ki akemo ikom jo me Jerucalem pi magoba lim ma gulimo i yo ma pe tye atiri, ki dok bene pi lok me neko dano ma wubedo kanekogi idye gang man. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Tika wubibedo ki tekcwiny me ciro lweny ki cingwu kono bibedo tek maromo lweny inino ma abilweny iye ikomwu? An Rwot dong atyeko loko lok man, dok bene abitiyo. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />Abikeyowu woko ikin lurok, dok abimiyo wuket iwi lobo ducu ci dong abityeko tim maracu woko liweng ki i gang man. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Nyingwu bibale ikin lurok ducu; ci man bimiyo wun jo ma i Jerucalem wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruk mac pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Rwot dok owaca ni, <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />“Wod pa dano, jo Icrael dong gudoko gin ma konygi peke ki tung bota. Gin ducu gudoko calo cet nyonyo me, ryal, mola, koc, nyonyo ki racac mapek ma kitye kaliyone i ruk mac. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: dong kit macalo wudoko cet ryali, wunge ni dok abicokowu aguruwu woko kacel idye gang me Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Dong kit macalo dano coko ryal, mola, nyonyo, ki nyonyo racac mapek ki koc ci ketogi i ruk mac ci kutu mac ikome wek oleny woko, kitmeno bene an abicokowu woko ki kinigana kacel ki akemona, ci abiketowu i mac ci alenyowu woko. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Abicokowu ci akutu mac me akemona ikomwu, ci wubileny woko idye gang. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Kit macalo kilenyo ryal i ruk mac, wun bene kibilenyowu woko kumeno idye gang; ci wubingeyo ni an Rwot dong aonyo akemona woko ikomwu.”<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal pa lutela pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, tit ki jo Icrael ni gin jo ma pe gileng, dok jo ma kot pe ocwer i ngomgi ikare me kinigana. <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />Rwodigi ducu bene gicalo labwor ma kok kun tye kakilo ringo lee ma nongo en omako. Guneko dano gutyeko woko, dok guyako lonyo kacel ki jami me welgu ducu. Gumiyo mon mapol gudoko mon to idye gang me Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref></char></note>Ajwakigi ducu gukwero lubu cika, dok bene gupyedo jamina maleng gu woko. Pe guketo apokapoka ikin jami maleng ki jami me nino ducu. Pe bene gupwonyo dano kit me ngeyo apokapoka matye ikin gin ma keni ki gin ma pe keni, dok bene pe gubedo kagwoko ceng Cabita, meno ducu omiyo gitye kapyeda ikin jona. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />Rwodigi ma gitye i Jerucalem ducu gicalo orudi matye kakilo ringo lee ma gumako, ma kun gioyo remo pa dano bene, kitmeno guneko dano mapol woko liweng wek dong gunong magoba i yo ma pe atir. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />Lunebigi bene gukano balgi woko macalo dano gibuku kor celgi woko ki rangi matar, dok bene guneno ginanyuta me gobagoba, ki dok bene gityeto tyet botgi me goba keken kun giwaco ni, ‘Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman,’ ma kun nongo an Rwot gire pe oloko botgi lok mo. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Ci jo me lobo man dong gunyebe katimo tim me buma, ci giyako jami pa dano woko. Dok guunu lucan kacel ki jo ma piny obwoyogi, kun gubumu wa lurok ma gibedo ikin gi marac tutwal. <verse eid="EZK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />Onongo abedo kayenyo dano mo ma myero oger cel mupotoni kun en bicung inyima kama obarri pi lobo man, wek pe ajwergi woko; ento pe amedo ki nongo ngat mo wa ki acel. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" />Pimeno omiyo aonyo kinigana woko ikomgi; ci awangogi woko ki mac me akemona, ci aculu kwor ikomgi pi gin ducu mayam gutimo.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Lumego aryo ma gin lubalo tutwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, yam tye mon aryo, ma pud gin anyira ma megigi bene acel. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />Ikare ma onongo gin pud lutino anyira, ma gibedo i Ejipt, gubedo katimo tim me kwelekwele; ci dano gubedo kakwako korgi kun gimako tunugi ma ogulugu. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Nyako maditeni onongo kilwongo nyinge ni Okola, ki lamine matidine onongo nyinge kilwongo ni Okoliba. Ci anyomogi gudoko mona ka gugamo ic ci gunywalo lutino co ki lutino anyira. Okola aye Camaria, ki Okoliba aye Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />Okola omede ki timo tim kwelekwele ma kun an dong anyome woko, dok bene onongo cwinye omaro jo Aciria tutwal, <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" />ma gubedo lulweny ma giruku bongo ma obedo lamarlamar, luloc me dul lobo ki ludito wi mony, gin ducu awobe mabeco ma ginen mwonya mada; gin wegi aguragura ma giringo ki aguragura. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />En omine kene katimo tim kwelekwele kwedgi, gin oyita lweny me Aciria ma kiyerogi ayera. Ci obalo kome woko kekene ki woro cal jogi pa jo ducu ma en omarogini. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />En yam pe oweko timo tim me malayaneni ma en ceng obedo katimone ki i Ejipt ikare ma pud en nyako; ci co gubutu kwede gukwako kore gunyongo wa tunune ma oguluni, kun gubedo katyeko mitigi ikome calo ngat mabedo ki malaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />Pimeno, amiye i cing pacoge, ki i cing jo Aciria ma en omarogini. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Jo meno guweko en odong munero, ci gumako awobene ki anyirane woko; ento en mere guneke woko ki pala lucwan. Ci odoko lok aboka ikin mon, ki ikare ma dong kingolo kop ikome.<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />Ci lamine Okoliba bene oneno time man, ento en dok onongo rac atika makato lamine Okola i mare ki i time me kwelekwele, ma dong obedo rac ma okato pa lamine woko. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />En omaro jo Aciria ma luloc me dul lobo ki ludito wi mony, lulweny ma giruke woko ki jami lwenygi ducu, wegi aguragura, ma giringo ki aguragura, dok bene gin ducu awobe mabeco ma ginen mwonya mada. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Ci aneno en dong obale woko, gin anyiranu aryo ducu gubedo katimo tim kwele acelu. <verse eid="EZK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" />Ento en obedo kamede ameda ki tim kwelekweleneni; ci oneno cal co ma kigoro ikom ot, ki cal lubanga pa jo Kaldaya ma kideyo woko ki rangi makwar, <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />ma gutweyo pyergi ki del, ma gin ducu guboyo wigi woko ki kitambara maboco me boyo wic; gin ducu ginen calo jo matye ki rwom me tic madito; meno obedo cal pa jo Babilon ma lobogi kikome aye Kaldaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />Cutcut ikare ma en onenogi ci cwinye ocako pyete ikomgi, ci ooro lukwena gucito botgi i Kaldaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />Ci jo Babilon gubino bote gubutu kwede iwi kitanda me mar, ma omiyo gubale woko ki tim meno me abor ma gutimo ikomeni, ci lacen ma dong kimiyo en onyobe woko ki bal, ci en otare woko ki botgi ma onongo cwinye ocido woko marac tutwal ikomgi. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Ikare ma en omede ki kit tim kwelekweleneni kun bene dong timo atyer kamaleng ma onongo bedo kwede munero, ci an bene aloke atare woko ki bote ma cwinya ocido woko ikome, kit macalo aloke woko ki bot lamineni. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />Ento en pud omede ameda ki time me malayane, kun po pi kare ma onongo en pud nyako, ikare ma en obedo katimo tim malayane i lobo Ejiptni. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />Ci cwinye opyete ikom co ma gimaro tim kwelekwele, ma komgi me co obedo calo pa kana, ma pig komgi bene obedo calo pa aguragura. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Kitmeno in Okoliba bene ibedo kayenyo tim me tarwang ma itimo katinoni, ikare ma jo Ejipt gukwako kori ci gunyongo tununi ma onongo pud ogulu agulani.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ongolo kop ikom lumego aryoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />Nen, man omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco boti in Okoliba, kuman ni, cwinyi dong ocido woko ikom pacogi mayam imarogini, abikelogi ikomi, kun gia ki ikabedo ducu ma orumi: <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />ci jo Babilon ki jo Kaldaya ducu, jo Pekod, jo Coa ki jo Koa, ki jo Aciria ducu kacel kwedgi. Gin ducu awobe mabeco ma ginen mwonya mada, luloc me dul lobo ki ludito wi mony, ludito ki lulweny, gin ducu nongo giringo ki aguraguragi. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />Ci gibibino ikomi, ki tung kumalo ki gadigadi lweny ki gadigadi ma otingo yec, ki lwak mony. Ci kibirumi woko dyere ki kwot ocal ki kwot bani ki otang nyonyo, dong abimiyogi twer me ngolo kop ikomi kit macalo ngolo kopgi tye kwede. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />Abimiyo kinigana kemi, wek kong gutwenyi malit. Ci kibingolo umi ki iti woko, ka dong i agikine kibineki woko ki pala lucwan. Kibimako lutino awobeni ki lutino anyirani ci kibiwangogi woko makwo ki mac. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />Ci gibilunyu bongo woko ki ikomi dok gibikwanyo jamini mabeco me welgu woko. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />Dong an abigiko tim kipyedani ki tim me kwelekwele ma ikelo ki i Ejiptni woko. Ci pe dong ibineno jo Ejipt ki dok bene pe dong ibipo pirgi matwal.”<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Nen, abimiyi woko i cing jo ma idaggini, i cing jo ma iloke ki botgi ma cwinyi ocido woko. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" />Kit macalo gidagini gibimayo jamini ma itiyo tic piregu ducu woko, ci gibiweki idong munero, nono labongo gin mo; ci gibinyuti woko kamaleng iwang dano ma nongo itye munero calo malaya. Ci tim kipyedani ki tim kwelekweleni <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" />aye ma okelo can man ikomi, pien itimo abor ki lurok, ci inyubu komi woko ki cal jogigi. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />In dong ilubu kit lameru, pimeno abiketo can acelu ma ceng aketo ikomeni ikomi.” <verse eid="EZK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 23:32">“Ibimato ki i kikopo pa lameru kikopone lac dok iye tut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 23:32">Ci dano binyeri kun gicayi bene acaya, pien kikoponi dong opong woko ligwik.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Ci ibimer woko kun ibedo ki cwercwiny, pien kikopo me lworo ki bale pa piny, en aye kikopo pa lameru Camaria.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />Ibimato gin ma i ikikopo ka dok ibicwiyone ducu, ci ibityero kikoponu woko, ka dong ibingolo tununi ki nginyinginyi me kikopo ma otoni pi cwercwiny.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 23:34">Pien an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong atyeko loko.” <verse eid="EZK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kit macalo wii bene dong owil woko ikoma, dok bene dong ityeko bola woko ingeyi, pimeno in dong omyero icir gin ma oa ki i tim kipyedani ki tim kwelekweleni.”<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />Rwot dok owaco bota ni, “Wod pa dano, tika ibingolo kop ikom Okola ki Okoliba? Cit i tuc botgi gin me kwer ducu ma gin gutimo. <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />Gubedo katimo abor dok bene guneko wa dano, gutimo abor pi woro cal jogigini, dok bene lutino awobegi ma gin kikomgi gunywalo kwedani, gin gutyero bot cal jogi me bedo camgi. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />Medo ikom meno gin dok gutimo gin magigu: gubalo kabedona maleng inino acelu, dok bene gupyedo ceng Cabita. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />Ka dong gutyero lutinogi ma guneko me gitum bot cal jogigi, ci dong en inino acelu bene aye gua gubino kwede i kabedona maleng ci gupyedo woko. Dong inen, man aye gin ma gutimo i oda.<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />Ci gin bene gucwalo lukwena bot co matye kamabor ni gubin, ci nen, gubino. Ci gulwoko komgi woko pirgi, ka guwiro wanggi, dok bene gudeyo komgi woko ki ruk me deyo. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />Ci gubedo iwi kitanda ma kideyo, ki meja ma dong kiketo kangete ma kipeto kitambara maber woko iwiye, ci bene guketo iye odok ecetana ki moona.<verse eid="EZK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />Woo pa lwak dano ma gutoyo tokgi ata onongo owinye botgi, co ma gubedo kawooni onongo lumero me nino ducuni ma kikelogi ki i tim aroo. Ci gin guketo ogul i ngut cing mon aryoni ducu, ki lalukana mabeco atika bene gurwako iwigi. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Ka dong awaco ki i cwinya ni, mon magi komgi dong oloc woko ki tim kwelegini, ento co magi pud gimito butu kwedgi gire! <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Pien gucito botgi ci gubutu kwedgi, kit macalo co gicito bot mon ma malaya ci gibutu kwedgini. Kitmeno bene gucito bot Okola ki Okoliba katimo tim kwelekweleni, gin mon ma lukweleni. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Ento jo ma kitgi atir bingolo kop ikom gin mon ma lutim abor ki mon ma lunek danogu, pien gutimo abor kun dok gineko dano bene.”<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kel mony obin olweny ikomgi wek komgi omyel ki lworo madwong ka dok kiyakgi woko. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Ci mony bicelogi ki gweng dok kibitongogi woko ki pala lucwan, kibineko awobegi ki anyiragi woko, kun bene kiwango odigi woko ki mac. <verse eid="EZK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />Dong abijwiko kit tim man me tarwang woko ki i lobo man, wek ka mon ducu guwinyo cik ma acikowu kwede, ci pe dok gutim tim me tarwang kit macalo gin dong gutimoni. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Dok abiketo can i komwu wun lumego aryoni pi timwu me tarwang, dok bene wubilimo can malit pi balwu maracu atika ki pi woro cal jogi. Ci dong wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom agulu me tedo ma nyal omako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />Rwot oloko kweda inino dwe apar, dwe me apar, i mwaka me abongwen. <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Luk 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4">Jer 52:4</ref></char></note>En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, coo nino dwe matini piny, pien en aye nino ma laloc me Babilon obino iye ka ocako lweny ma orumu Jerucalem. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />Tuc lok man woko atyer kamaleng idye lwak man ma lujemo, i lok abola ma i carolok botgi kun iwaco ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">Cib agulu i mac, ci ony pii iye bene;<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />ci iket iye ringo ma kingolo woko matino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">ci ket ringo ducu mabecone, ringo em ki ringo akwaya gwok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">ci ket iye cogo mabeco ma iyero ayera wek opong woko.<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />Kwany ringo romo mabere ki ikin romi luwotgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">ci irwak yen ma kingunugi i dul ki dul ite agulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">ci ited ringo ma iketo iyeni, dok bene ited cogone iye.”<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />Pien Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong owaco kuman ni, “Can iwi taun madit ma opong ki luneko, in ibedo calo agulu ma nyal omako, ma nyale bene pe twero kwanye ki iye! Kikwanyo ringo ma kingidoni woko ki iye ki acel acel, kun pe kiyero ayera. <verse eid="EZK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />Pien remo dano ma kinekogi idye taun madit pud tye iye; remone oo wa ikom got bene, pe kineko dano i ngom kama remogi onongo kitwero umune woko ki putu. <verse eid="EZK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />En gin ma omiyo aweko remo dano ma en onekogi ikom got, wek pe kium woko. Pi tugu akemona ikomgi wek acul kwor.”<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Can iwi taun madit ma opong ki luneko! An kikoma aye abiduru yen me tedone. <verse eid="EZK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Dong ibican yen, ci imok mace madit, ci ited ringo woko maber, ka dok idwon pige woko, wek cogo owang. <verse eid="EZK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Ka lacen dong iket aguluni iwi lodi mac ma nongo iye tye nono, wek olyeti, wek molane olyeti makwar calo owang awanga, wek cilo matye iye bene oleny woko, ki nyale bene oware otum woko. <verse eid="EZK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Abedo kaolo koma nono, pien mace bene lyetone pe twero kwanyo nyal mapek matye iyeni ducu. <verse eid="EZK 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />Nyal meno matye iyeni en aye tim macol me tarwang ma wubedo katimone, wun jo Jerucalem. Onongo kono alonyowu wudoko maleng, ento pe dong kilonyowu ikom timwu macol, pe dong wubilonye matwal nio wang ma atoyo akemona mageri woko ikomwu kit macalo amito. <verse eid="EZK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong atyeko loko man; kace kare oromo, abitiyo. Pe abiloko tama, dok kica pe bimaka wa ki acel, ci kibipwodowu malubu kitwu ki gin ma wutimo.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa dako pa lanebi Ejekiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, nen, dong acok kwanyo ngat ma yomo cwinyi ma nenone mitini woko ki adong acel keken. Ento pe ibikumu, pe ibikok, dok bene pig wangi pe bimol cito piny lipya. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />Pe icur matek, ento cur lalingling; pe ikum pi dano ma oto. Twe kitambarani iwii, ci iruk wari i tyeni, pe ium dogi, dok pe bene icam kwon pa jo matye kakumu.”<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Kitmeno aloko bot lwak i odiko, ci oo otyeno dakona oto woko. Orwone ki odiko atiyo kit macalo onongo kicika kwede. <verse eid="EZK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Ci lwak gupenya ni, “Pe itwero tito botwa tyen lok me gin magi, ma omiyo in itiyo gin macalo man?”<verse eid="EZK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Ci awaco botgi ni, “Rwot oloko kweda kun owaca ni <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />atit lok ma en elokoni botwu, wun jo Icrael. Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, ‘Nen, abipyedo kabedona malengi woko, ma en aye tekowu ma wutye kawake pire, ma wumaro nenone, dok ma yomo cwinywu tutwali. Dong awobewu ki anyirawu ma wuwekogi ingewu i Jerucalemi kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Ci wubitiyo kit macalo an dong atyeko tiyoneni; pe wubiumu dogwu, dok bene pe wubicamo kwon pa jo matye kakumu. <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />Wiwu bibedo atweya ki kitambara ki war bene bibedo i tyenwu; pe wubikumu, dok bene pe wubikok, ento komwu bibale woko pi balwu kun wucur kekenwu ma ngat acel acel cur bot lawote. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Kitmeno Ejekiel dong bibedo botwu calo lanyut; ci kit gin ducu ma dong en otiyo wun bene wubitiyo. Ka man otime, ci wubingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu.’”<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. En owaco ni, “Dong in wod pa dano, inino meno aye abikwanyo iye celgi mateki woko, ma yomo cwinygi ki deyogi maditi, gin ma gimaro nenone, en aye Ot mera Malengi, kin gin ducu ma yomo cwinygini. Ci bene abikwanyo awobegi ki anyiragi woko. <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />Inino ma abitiyo lok man iye, ngat mo ma obwot ki i lak to bibino ci titi pi gin ducu ma otime. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Inino meno kikome en aye dogi bingame iye me cako lok doki odoco, ci ibilok bot dano mubwoti, ci ibiloko lok ma pe dong ibibedo latelebe oto matwal. Kitmeno ibibedo lanyut botgi; ci dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ikom jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:1-6">Jer 49:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eje 21:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, nen piny yo tung bot jo Ammon <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />ci itit lok man ikomgi kun iwaco botgini: wuwiny lok pa Rwot Lubanga: Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, pien wun dong wubedo ki yomcwiny ikom kabedona maleng ikare ma dong kipyedo woko, ki ikom lobo Icrael ikare ma dong kijwero woko odong obur, ki ikom jo Juda ikare ma kiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />Pimeno an dong abimiyowu woko bot jo ma gitye yo tung kunyango gibiloyowu. Ci gibigero gonygi ikinwu, dok gibiyubu kabedogi idyewu. Dok gibicamo camwu ci gibimato cakwu bene. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />Abimiyo Raba bedo kacam pa kinaga, ki taun madito pa jo Ammon abiloko doko dwol kama romi ki dyegi gibibedo iye. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong owaco kuman ni: pien dong wudongo cingwu dok wubedo kanyono tyenwu matek i ngom kun cwinywu obedo yom ki tim maracu ducu matye i iwu ikom lobo Icrael, <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />pimeno, nen, abiryeyo cinga woko ikomwu, ci abimiyowu woko bot lurok me bedo ginayaka botgi. Abityekowu woko liweng ki ikin jo ducu ma bedo iwi lobo, abimiyo wuto woko ki iwi lobo ducu; abinekowu woko. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ikom jo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Ica 15:1—16:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Jo Moab onongo yam guwaco ni, nen, jo Juda dong gicalo jo me rok mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />Pimeno abimiyo lweny poto i taun maditogi ma orumu Moab ma gikuru wang lobo pa jo Moabni, kadi wa ki deyo me lobo Moab ma en aye Bet-jecimot, Baal-meon, ki Kiriataim. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" />Abimiyo lobogi woko, kacel ki jo Ammon, bot jo matye yo tung kunyango me bedo meggi, wek pe dong kipo ikome matwal ki ikin lurok. <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />Dok bene abimiyo pwod ikom jo Moab. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ikom jo Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">Eje 35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kit macalo jo Edom gutimo tim me culu kwor ikom jo Juda ma omiyo gutingo bal alii madit tutwal me culu kwor ikomgi, <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />pimeno omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaco kuman ni: abiryeyo cinga alwenyo ikom jo Edom, abineko dano ducu kacel ki lee ma gibedo i lobo Edom. Abimiyo lobogi dong doko obur, nia i Teman nio kwede wa i Dedan jone ducu kibinekogi ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />Abimiyo jona jo Icrael culu kwor ikom jo Edom ma kakara, ci gibitiyo i Edom kitmeno kun jo Edom giwinyo arem me kinigana ki akemona mageri. Ci jo Edom dong bingeyo kwor ma aculu ikomgi.” Man Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ikom jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Ica 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Jep 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Jek 9:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kit macalo jo Piliciti gutimo tim me culu kwor dok bene guculu kwor ki rac cwiny me neko nek ma okelo mone ma pe gik; <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />pimeno an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawaco kuman ni: nen, abiryeyo cinga alwenyo ikom jo Piliciti, abijwero jo Ceret ki lobo mukene matye i dog namgu woko. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />Abiculu kwor madit ikomgi kun apwodogi ki akemo madwong tutwal. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ka dong aculu kwora ikomgi.”<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ikom Turo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1—28:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ica 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Jek 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10:13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Ikom nino dwe mukwongo i mwaka me apar wiye acel ma dong watye i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kit macalo jo Turo guloko lok ikom jo me Jerucalem ki yomcwiny ni, ‘Dogcelgi dong kituru woko, ma dong owire oyabe woko botwani, dong abidoko lalonyo, pien dong kityeko balone woko’, <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen dong, atye ki lok ikomwu, wun jo Turo, abikelo jo me rok mapol ka lweny i komwu, kit macalo pii biamwonyi me nam twage kwedeni. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />Ci kibimuku cel ma orumu Turo kireto woko piny, ki lubelene bene kibituru kireto woko piny. Ka dong abiyweyo ngome woko ducu ci aweko got keken aye dong. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />En bibedo wa idye nam macalo kabedo kama lumakrec gimoyo iye obwogi. Pien an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong atyeko loko. Lurok dong gibiyako Turo woko, <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />dok bene kibineko jone ma gibedo i lobone kikome woko liweng ki pala lucwan. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Abikelo rwot matek makato luker ducu, en aye Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ka lweny ikom Turo. En bibino ki lwak aguragura, gadigadi lweny, wegi aguragura, ki dul mony matye iye acikari mapol. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />Jo ma bedo i taun gi matye iwi tura kibinekogi woko i lweny. Ci lumerok dong gibigero cel girumuwu kwede woko, dok bene gibitoro cel lobo inyimwu, ka dong gibibino ma gutingo kwotgi ci giumu komgi kwede woko. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />En bitworo celwu ki twor latwom cel, ci bityengo lubele ki latonge reto woko piny. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Aguragurane bibedo pol atikatika ma apwa tyen gi biboyowu woko. Dong woo pa wegi aguragura ki mor pa gadigadi ma otingo yec, ki lwak gadigadi lweny biyengo celwu ikare ma nongo gidonyo i dogcelwu macalo ngat mo ma donyo i gang madong mony oturu cele woko. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Wegi aguragura biringo ki aguragura ki i yoowu ducu, gibineko danowu woko ki pala lucwan. Gibireto wirwu matekgu poto woko piny wa i ngom. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />Gibiyako lonyowu ka gicoko jami acatawu. Ci gibimuku celwu gireto woko piny, dok bene gibibalo odiwu mabeco ma yomo cwinywuni woko. Ci gibikwanyo gwengwu, baowu ki ngom kama wuyubu iye gedowu, ci gibolo woko i pii wa idye namgu. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:22">Niy 18:22</ref></char></note> Ci abijuku wer ducu ma kigoyogi agoya, ki dwon opuk mamit ma kigoyo bene dong pe biwinye matwal! <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Abimiyo in Turo dong ibidoko kabedo me moyo obwo pa lumakrec madong abiyweyo ngome woko ducu ci aweko gote keken aye dong. Taun madit man dong pe kibigerone odoco matwal. An Rwot dong atyeko loko.” Man Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco lok ikom taun madit me Turo kuman ni, “Ikare ma nongo kitye kamonyo in, jo ducu ma gibedo i dog nam gibibedo ki lworo madwong pi cur pa joni ma gunongo ret ka dong kinekogi. <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:9-10">Niy 18:9-10</ref></char></note>Ci rwodi ducu me dog nam gibilor woko piny ki iwi komkergi, ci gibilunyu jorgi ki bongigi ma kideyo maber, ka dong gibibedo wa piny i ngom ki myelkom. Gibibange woko ki lworo pi can ma opoto ikomgi, ci bimiyo komgi bedo kamyel amyela i cawa ducu. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />Gibicako wer lyel ikomi kun kiwero ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">‘In dong irwenyo woko matwal ki i nam ningning!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">In taun madit mayam iywek tutwali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">ma onongo itek tutwal kun ibedo ki loc ikom jo matye i nami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">in kacel ki jo ma gubedo i ii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">ma con gukelo lworo madwong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">ikom jo ducu ma gibedo i dog nami!<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Inino ma i poto kwede iyeni kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">cula nam ducu guyenge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">ada, gin cula ma gitye idye nami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">ci jo ma gibedo i igi cwinygi obale woko.’”<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Abimiyo in Turo ibale woko calo taun madito ma dano pe bedo i igi. ‘Ka dok bene abikelo pii aumi woko kwede ma bimiyo imwony woko ki kamatut i nam. <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />Ci abiboli woko piny i bur lyel kacel ki jo ma cito i lobo pa jo ma oto, me bedo kunu kacel ki jo mayam gubedo i lobo ikare ma con tutwal. Ci abimiyo ibibedo i lobo ma ite ngom ikin obur ma orii tutwal, kun nongo itye kabedo kacel ki jo ma oto. Dano pe dok bibedo i ii dok bene pe ibinongo kabedo mo i lobo pa jo makwo. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:21">Niy 18:21</ref></char></note>Abimiyo itum woko i yo makelo lworo, ci ibirwenyo woko matwal; kadi bed kiyenyi, ci pe kibinongi.’” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s1">Wer lyel me koko Turo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kombedi cak wer lyel <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />kun ikok kwede pi Turo, ma en taun madit ma ocung i dog nam, dok bene en lacatwil ki jo ducu ma gibedo iwangwat mapatpat ma orumu dog nam. Cit itit ki Turo ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">In Turo, onongo iwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">‘An aber anen mwonya mada.’<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Wang apoki loboni ducu tye wa i cwiny dye nam madit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:4">jo ma gugeri gugeri woko maber ma inen mwonya adada calo mel.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />Gupayo bao me apeta mapol ki ikom yat odwong ma gukelo ki i got Cenir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Gutongo bene yat cedar ki i Lebanon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">ci guyubu ki yat me yaro bongo mel wek yamo okuti.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />Gutongo kworo me Bacan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">ci guyubu pol me cero yeyani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">gipeto dye kabedoni ki bao me yadi mabeco</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">ma kikelo ki i lobo Caiprac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">kun kideyo woko bene ki lak lyec.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />Bongo me ayara malo iwi yat me mel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">obedo bongo camanini ma kideyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">mabere ma gukelo ki i Ejipt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">kitwero neno ki cen ci kingeyo oyotoyot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Kemani kiyubu ki bongo mabere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">bongo ma obedo bulu ki lamarlamar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">ma kikelo ki i cula nam me Elica.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Jo ma gibedo i Cidon ki i Arvad</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">gin aye gubedo lucer yeyani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:8">Joni ma gikwiri aye gubedo ludwo mel.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Ludongo me Gebal ki jone ma gikwiri onongo bene gibedo ikin joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">ma giyubu mel me wot i nam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">mel ducu me nam ki jo ma dwoyogi gubedo ikin joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">gubedo ka cat i dukani.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />Acikari ma gua ki i Percia, Lud ki Put onongo gitye i dul monyi macalo lulwenyi; gungabo kwot ki otangwic i gang monyi. Gin bene aye ma gumiyi deyo. <verse eid="EZK 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Jo Arvad ki monygi guito malo kagwoko celi, ki jo Gamad guito malo kagwoko wi lubeleni ducu. Gungabo kwotgi ikom cel gurumu kwede woko. Gin aye ma gumiyo inen maber mamwonya tutwali.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />Ibedo kacato wil i lobo Tarcic kun igamo ryal, nyonyo koc ki racac ma kimiyi pi wilo jamini mabeco madwong ata. <verse eid="EZK 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />Jo Javan, Tubal, ki Mecek gubedo kacato wil ki joni kun gimiyo opiigi ki jami molagu ma kiloko ki jami ma joni gicato. <verse eid="EZK 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />Joni gucato jamigi woko kun guloko ki aguragura me tingo yec, ki aguragura ma gingweco kwedgi i lweny, ki kanagu ma gikelogi ki i Bet-togarma. <verse eid="EZK 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />Jo Rodec bene gubedo kacato wil ki joni; lobo mapol me dog nam gudoko cuk gi, kama joni giwilo iye lak lyec mapol ki poi kun kiloko ki jamigi. <verse eid="EZK 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />Jo Edom bene gubedo kacato wil ki joni pi jamini madwong gu; gubedo kalokogi ki emeradi ma en kidi me wel madwong, bongo ma lamarlamar, ki bongi ma kidero komgi maber, ki bongo camanini mabere, ki tiko makwar me wel. <verse eid="EZK 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />Jo Juda ki jo ma i lobo Icrael gubedo kacato wil ki joni; ci guloko jamigi ki ngano, nyig jeituni, ki nyig oduru me wi mwaka, moo kic, moo mukenegu ki yat ma ngwece kur. <verse eid="EZK 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />Jo Damaciko gubedo kacato wil ki joni pi jamigi madwong gu, pi lwak lonyoni mapatpati oweko gumini kongo bwino ma kikelo ki i Kelbon, ki yer romi matare, <verse eid="EZK 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />ki kongo bwino ma kikelo ki i Ujal, gukelo ki jamini mabecogu; nyonyo ma giteto, kacia ki lum ma ngwece kur guloko woko ki jami acatani. <verse eid="EZK 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />Jo Dedan gubedo kacato wil ki joni kun gimiyo bot joni bongi ma kitweyo inge kana me bedo pa dano. <verse eid="EZK 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />Jo Arab ki rwodi ducu me Kedar yam gubedo jo ma yomo cwiny mada pi cato botgi lutino romi ki nyogi romi ki dyegigu, ikare ma gubedo kacato wil kwedi. <verse eid="EZK 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />Lucatwil me Ceba ki Raama bene gubedo kacato wil kwedi; ci gumiyo boti kit angwece ducu mapatpat mabeco makato ducu, ki kidi me welgu ki jabu, kun giloko ki jamini. <verse eid="EZK 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />Jo Karan, Kane, Eden, Acur, ki Kilmad bene gubedo kacato wil kwedi. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />Jo magi gubedo kacato wil kwedi pi bongi mabeco adada, ki pi bongi ma bulu ki ma kikwoyo ki cing ma kidero komgi woko maber, ki kapet ma kideyo ki rangi mapatpat, ma kitweyo woko matek liking ki tol; ci gubedo kacato wil boti pi jami meno. <verse eid="EZK 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:11-19">Niy 18:11-19</ref></char></note>Mel me Tarcic obedo kawot kun tingo jami acatani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">Iloke dong idoko calo mel matye idye nam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">ma kicano jami mapek opongo woko ligwik.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />Ludwo meli guteri woko wa kamabor idye nam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Dong yamo ma a yo tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">okodo omiyo meli otur woko wa icwiny dye nam.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />Lonyoni ducu, jami acatani ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">lutic i mel ki ludwo mel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">lumwon wang bao kama bao okube iye ki wadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">ki lucatwili ma pirgi tego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">acikarini ducu ma gin lulweny ma gitye i mel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">gin ducu ki dul monyi ma gitye idye joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">gumwony woko libuc icwiny dye nam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">ikare ma meli otur wokoni.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Ikare ma koko pa ludwo mel owinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:28">lobo ma cokcok kenyo ducu guyenge.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Pol wegi yeya gukati woko ki i mel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">kun gumako tal me cero yeya i cinggi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">Ci lutic i mel ki ludwo mel ducu ma woto i nam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">gucung iwi tura i dog nam.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Gin gudange ki koko matek piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">kun gikok ma cwinygi kec adada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Guonyo putu iwigi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">kun gingene bene i buru pi cwercwiny.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />Ci gulyelo wigi dong maleng piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">dok guruku bongo cola me kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">kun gikok kwede piri ma cwinygi ton,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">kun bene gikumu ma cwinygi kec.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Ka gikok ci giwero wer lyel piri ma gikok piri kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">‘Anga ma kitwero poro ki Turo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">ma kijwero oling woko idye nami?<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />Ka yam ikelo jami acatani ki bot jo matye loka nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">nongo icobo miti pa jo me rok ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">Luker ducu me lobo gudoko lulonyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ki lonyoni ki lwak jami acatani madwong gu,<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />Kombedi dong mel otur woko idye nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">idye pii kamatut atika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">jami acatani matye iye ki jo ducu ma gitiyo i mel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">gumwony woko bene i nam libuc kacel kwedi,<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Dano ducu ma gibedo i lobo ma orumu dog nam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">gubedo ki ur madit mada</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">pi can man ma opoto ikomini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">lukergi dong gudoko lwor tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">wanggi olwal woko pi lworo.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Lucatwil ma gitye ikin lwak gujwat piri mada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:36">dong io i agikini ma man bikelo lworo adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:36">dong bene ibirwenyo woko matwal ma pe dok ibinen.’”<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ma Ejekiel otito ikom rwot me Turo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, wac bot rwot me Turo ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: itye ki wake i cwinyi ma omiyo iwaco ni in lubanga. Dok iwaco ni kit macalo in ibedo lubangani, ibedo iwi komker ma nam orumu woko dyere. Ento in i dano, in pe lubanga, kadi bed itamo ni in iryek calo lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />In itamo ni in iryek ikato Daniel, dok ni pe tye mung mo ma okane ki boti ma pe ingeyo. <verse eid="EZK 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />Ryeko madit ki niang me cat ma itye kwede, omiyo ilimo lonyo piri keni kun icoko jabu ki ryal i ot me kano lim ma meri. <verse eid="EZK 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />Ryeko madit me cat ma itye kwede omiyo imedo lonyoni, kun ibedo kanongo magoba teretere. Ma omiyo dong icako bedo ki wake madit i cwinyi pi lonyoni ni.”<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />Pimeno an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco ni, “Dong kit macalo itamo ni in iryek calo lubanga moni, <verse eid="EZK 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />pimeno, nen, abikelo lumerok ma gin lurok ka lweny ikomi. Gin jo me rok mager makato jo me rok mukene ducu. Gibiwoto pala lucwangi ci gibilweny ikomi ci gibalo beri ma inongo ki ryekoni ki gin manen mwonya ki boti woko, ci gibalo deyoni me aurani woko. <verse eid="EZK 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />Gin bineki woko ci gicori i poto piny i bur lyel icwiny dye nam <verse eid="EZK 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Kace jo ma gibino ka neki gubino ikomi, ci in mono pud ibimede ki wacone ki inyimgi ni in lubanga? Ento pe kumeno, ki i cinggi gin jo ma ginekini in dong pe lubanga wacel kono i dano ma mwa. <verse eid="EZK 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />Ibito meri macalo dano ma pe kilirogi i cing lurok ma pe gingeyo Lubanga. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong atyeko loko lok man.”<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom rwot me Turo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Rwot doki oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kok pi rwot me Turo, kun iwace ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: in onongo yam ibedo lanen me gin maber makato ducu. Kidok onongo bene iryek dok iber ma inen mwonya mada. <verse eid="EZK 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />Ci dong onongo ibedo wa i Eden, ma en aye poto pa Lubanga, ci ibedo karuke ki kit kidi me wel mapatpat ducu, ma gin aye: kamelian, topaj, ki jacipa, kurocolit, ki onik, capir, kabankel, ki emeradi; ma gin ducu aye kidero komgi maber mayam onongo kitiyo ki jabu, ki gin ducu mayam itye kwede kigoro komgi woko. Kiyubugi piri inino ma kiketi iyeni kikome. <verse eid="EZK 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />Ka dok aketo lakerubi ma kiwiro ki moo me gwoko in. Onongo ibedo iwi got maleng pa Lubanga dok bene iwoto ki idye gang ma lyel mac. <verse eid="EZK 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />Cake ikare ma kicweyi iye, kiti onongo ber; onongo pe itye ki bal mo nio wa ikare madong icako timo bal. <verse eid="EZK 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />Ci ibedo kawilo jami teretere kun icato bene kumeno, omiyo icako timo tim bwami ci itimo bal. Ci omiyo aryemi woko ki iwi got mera maleng calo gin ma dong kipyedo, dok lakerubi ma onongo gwoki ca bene guryemi woko ki idye gweng ma lyel mac. <verse eid="EZK 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />Yam ibedo kawake ki i cwinyi pi beri; ki deyoni me aurani omiyo ibalo ryekoni woko. Ci areti woko i ngom, ci amiyo inen woko kamaleng inyim luker ducu, wek guneni, ci wanggi oniang woko tiktik ikomi. <verse eid="EZK 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />Pi bali mapol ata ma itimo i cato wil i yo ma pe atiri omiyo ipyedo kabedoni malenggu woko ducu. Ci acwinyo taun maditwu woko ki mac, ci owang woko liruk. Ci aloko taun madit meno odoko buru inyim lobo ki inyim jo ducu ma guneni. <verse eid="EZK 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Ci jo ducu ma gingeyi ki ikin lwak me rok ducu gitye ki ur madit mada ikomi; in dong io i agiki ma ibito wokoni ci man bikelo lworo, dok bene ibirwenyo woko matwal.”<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi ma kitito ikom Cidon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-2">Jek 9:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10:13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot dok oloko kweda. En owaco ni, <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />“Wod pa dano, cik wangi kong inen tung Cidon, ci itit lok man ikome, <verse eid="EZK 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />kun iwaco bot jo ma gibedo iye ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, adoko merokwu, wun jo Cidon; dok abinyutu deyona woko kamaleng i dyewu. Man bimiyo jo ducu gibipaka pi gin ducu ma atiyo botwu, ci gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ka anyutu kit macalo aleng kwede kun nongo aketo can ikom jo ma gibedo i taun madit man. <verse eid="EZK 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />Pien abicwalo two gemo i taun madit man, ki remo bimol idye gudune ducu. Kibilwenyo i komwu ki i kabedo ducu, jowu bene kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bimiyo gum bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />Rwot owaca ni, “Okutu lacar pe dong bicobo jo me ot pa Icrael matwal, nyo kadi kit okutu mo mukene pe bicobogi ma minigi ret, ikin luwotgi ma gurumugi ducuni ma ceng gutimogi maraci kun dok bene gucayogini. Man bimiyo gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Ka dong acoko jo Icrael ki ikin lurok kama yam akeyogi gucito iye, ka dok bene anyutu bot rok ducu kit macalo an aleng kwede, ci abimiyo Icrael gibibedo i lobogi kikome, en lobo mayam amiyo bot latica Yakoboni. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />Ci gibibedo i lobo meno labongo lworo mo, dok gibigero odi kun gipuru poto olok bene. Ci gibibedo labongo lworo mo, ikare ma abingolo kop ikom luwotgi ducu ma gutimogi marac kun bene gucayogini. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubangagi.”<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s1">Lok marac me nebi ikom Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1—32:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:1-25">Ica 19:1-25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Jer 46:2-26</ref></char>
    </note>Inino dwe apar wiye aryo, idwe me apar, i mwaka me apare, Rwot dok oloko kweda kun waco ni, <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />“Wod pa dano, cik wangi inen Parao rwot me Ejipt, ci itit lok ikome ki ikom lobo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />Lok kun iwaco ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, atye ki lok ikomi, in Parao rwot me Ejipt, ma ibedo calo nyang ma min kulu ma butu i laora kulugu kun iwaco ni, ‘Kulu Nail mera, en mera kikome, an aye ma atiyo.’<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Abigolo cwaki woko ki goli, ci amiyo rec ducu matye i kuluni gibimoko woko i poki; ci abiywayi ki idye kuluni atingi woko wa malo, in kacel ki rec ducu me kuluni ma gumoko ikom pokini.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />Ci dong abiboli woko wa i tim, in kacel ki rec ducu ma gitye i kuluni, wubipoto wa idye tim kamaleng, pe dok abicokowu bene kun pe kibiyikowu. Dong atyeko miyowu woko me bedo cam pa lee tim ki pa winyo me polo.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 36:6">Ica 36:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Man bimiyo jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo Ejipt gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. Pien in ibedo calo odoo lagada ki bot jo me ot pa Icrael; <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />ikare ma gumaki ki cinggi ci itur ityer, ci ingolo gwokgi iyeco woko ducu. Ka dok gujenge ikomi, ci itur, imiyo pyergi ducu omyel. <verse eid="EZK 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, abikelo lweny ikomwu, ci aneko dano kacel ki lee woko ducu ki ikinwu. <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Ci lobo Ejipt bidoko obur ma dong obale woko. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">“Pien dong iwaco ni Nail meri in aye ma iketo, <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />pimeno, nen, an dong atye ki lok ikomi, dok bene atye ki lok ikom laora kuluni ducu, ma omiyo abimiyo lobo Ejipt doko obur bale woko, iye dong nongo, cake ki i Migdol dok kwede tung Ciene nio kwede wa i wang apoki lobo Etiopia. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Pe tye dano mo nyo lee ma biwoto kun kato ki iye, ci bibedo kumeno ma pe kibedo iye pi mwaka pyere angwen kulu. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />Abimiyo lobo Ejipt doko obur ma iye odong nono makato lobo mukenegu ducu; ki gangi murumu ducu igi bidong nono pi mwaka pyere angwen ki ikin gangi ducu ma dong kityeko balogi wokoni. Abikeyo jo Ejipt woko ikin rok ducu, ci dok bene abimiyo giket gicito i lobo ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “I agiki me mwaka pyere angwen abicoko jo Ejipt woko ki ikin lurok kama yam akeyogi gucito iyeni, <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />ci abidwoko jo Ejipt cen ikabedo gi dok abimiyo gum pa jo Ejipt botgi, kun akelogi aketogi gibedo i lobo Patroc, con en aye lobogi macon kama kinywalogi iye kikome. Dong ki kunu gibibedo ki ker magoro. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Ci kergi bibedo ker magoro adada ki ikin ker ducu, man miyo pe dok gibiloyo lobo mukenegu ducu. Dok abimiyo gibedo jo ma pirgi pe tek tutwal, ci dong bene pe doki gibiloyo lobo mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />Jo Icrael dong pe kibijenge ikomgi pi kit kony mo wacel. Ci dong can ma bipoto ikom jo Ejipt bipoyo wi jo Icrael ni gin onongo gitimo bal me jenge ikom jo Ejipt wek ginong kony mogo ki kunu. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Nebukadnejar bilwenyo ikom Ejipt ci tayo woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />Inino dwe acel, me dwe me acel, mwaka pyere aryo wiye abiro ma wabedo i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon omiyo dul monye otiyo tic matek me lweny ikom Turo, ma omiyo wi dano ducu ma obedo ilweny meno wigi otal woko ki gwokgi bene ducu opwac woko, ento kadi bed kumeno, rwot Nebukadnejar ki dul monye pe gunongo kit gin mo pi tic matek ma gubedo kayele ka tiyone ikom Turoni. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />Pimeno, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen dong, abimiyo lobo Ejipt woko bot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon; ci en biyakogi kun mayo jamigi woko, ci bitingo lonyo me lobo Ejipt loko doko mucara me culu jo ma i dul monye. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />Dong atyeko miyo bote lobo Ejipt me culu wang tic ma en obedo kayele me tiyoneni, pien en ki jo me dul monye gubedo katic pira. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />Inino meno ka gin ma kitmeno otime, ci abimiyo jo Icrael gidoko jo matek, kidok bene abimiyo in Ejekiel iloko lok kamaleng atyer kama dano ducu gitwero winyo loki. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot bipwodo jo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, tit lok kun iwaco gin man ma an a Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye ka lokone kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">‘Wukok wunu ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">nino makelo lworo tye kabino!<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Ninone dong onyiko cok, en nino ma Rwot bitic iyeni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">Man bibedo nino ma opong ki pol keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">en aye bene kare ma can bipoto kwede ikom rok ducu.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Lweny bibedo ikom i Ejipt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">ki aremcwiny madwong bene bibedo ikom Etiopia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Jo ma gibedo i Ejipt kibinekogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">kibiyako lonyone ducu kitero woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">ci kibiweke dong obur.’<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />I lweny meno kibineko acikari ma kiwilogi ki lim ma gua ki i Etiopia, Put ki Lud, Arabia, ki Libya, ki wegi lobona ki komgi.” <verse eid="EZK 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, “Cake i Migdol o kwede tung Ciene, jo ducu ma gibikonyo jo Ejipt kibinekogi woko i lweny. Dul mony pa jo Ejipt ma giwake ni giteki kibijwerogi woko ducu. Kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan idye taun madit. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />Lobo Ejipt bidoko gin ma iye odong nono, gangine igi bidong nono ki ikin taun madito ducu ma dong kityeko balogi woko. <verse eid="EZK 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Ka dong acwinyo Ejipt woko ki mac, dok bene abineko jo ma konyogi woko, man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />Ka nino meno oo, ma Ejipt dong kijwero woko, abicwalo lukwena ma gikwango mel wek gumi lworo omak jo Etiopia ma cwinygi pe potoni; ci gibibedo ki remcwiny madwong inino ma can bipoto ikom jo Ejipt; pien ninone tye kabino!”<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Abitic ki Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon me giko te lonyo me Ejipt woko. <verse eid="EZK 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />En kacel ki jone, ma gin jo me rok mager adada, gibikelogi me balo lobo woko; ci gibilweny ikom jo Ejipt ki pala lucwan, man miyo lobo dong bipong ki kom dano ma oto keken. <verse eid="EZK 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />Abimiyo pii kulu Nail two woko, dok bene abicato lobo woko bot jo maracu; ci abibalo lobo kacel ki jami ducu matye iye amiyo iye dong nono. Lurok gibijwero lobo woko ducu. An Rwot dong atyeko loko.”<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Abijwero cal jogi apaya ki cal lubanga mogogu me goba ki i Mempic; laker mo dong pe bibedo i lobo Ejipt. Kitmeno abimiyo lworo bedo tye i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="EZK 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />Abimiyo lobo Patroc dong nono, dok bene abicwinyo mac woko ikom Joan, ci abingolo kop ikom jo Tebec kun alubu te cik kikome me ngolo kop. <verse eid="EZK 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Dok bene abionyo akemona ikom jo Pelucium, ma en aye cel gogo matek pa jo Ejipt, ka dok aneko lwak me Tebec woko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Ci abicwinyo mac woko ikom Ejipt; ki jo Pelucium gibibedo ki toncwiny madit adada. Kibimuku cel me gang Tebec kireto woko piny, ki gang bene bipong woko ki pii aluka. <verse eid="EZK 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Awobe On ki awobe Pibecet kibinekogi woko i lweny, ki mon kibimakogi kiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="EZK 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Piny bicido woko i Tapanec ikare ma abituru ker me Ejipt woko, ki teke ma onongo jone giwake kwedeni bene dong bigik. Pol biumu Tapanec woko, ci jone kibiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="EZK 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Meno aye kit ma abingolo kwede kop ikom jo Ejipt kun alubu te cik me ngolo kop. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kituru teko pa rwot me Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />Inino dwe abiro dwe me acel, i mwaka me apar wiye acel me bedowa i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda kun waco ni, <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />“Wod pa dano, dong atyeko turu bad Parao rwot me Ejipt woko. Dong inen pe tye ngat mo ma otweye ki bandej wek ocang woko, wek dok odok tek me mako pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Pimeno Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, atye ki lok ikom Parao rwot me Ejipt. Abituru bade ryoryo ducu, bade matekeni ki bade mayam oturi; ci amiyo pala lucwan poto woko piny ki i cinge. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />Abikeyo jo Ejipt woko ikin jo me rok ducu, abimiyo giket giromo wi lobo woko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Dong abijingo bad rwot me Babilon ryoryo ducu bedo matek, ci amiyo pala lucwane i cinge en mako; ento abituru bad Parao ryoryo ducu woko, miyo en dong bibedo kacur inyim rwot me Babilon calo dano ma dong gityeko keto ret woko ikome. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Abijingo bad rwot me Babilon me bedo matek, ento bad Parao bipoto woko; ci bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. Ka dong aketo pala lucwana i cing rwot me Babilon, ci en biryeyo woko ikom lobo Ejipt; <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />ci abikeyo jo Ejipt woko ducu ikin lurok, kun aketogi iwi lobo ducu. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom Parao kacel ki jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />Inino dwe acel, dwe me adek, i mwaka me apar wiye acel me bedowa i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda. En owaca ni, <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />“Wod pa dano, wac bot Parao rwot me Ejipt ki bot lwake ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">In mono kiporo diti ki dit pa anga?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Nen, abipori ki Aciria, en yat cedar me Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">ma jange oluk dok tipune bene calo bunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">ma odongo mabor adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">wiye kikome bor oo wa ikin pol.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Pii onongo tye omiyo yat meno odongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">dok bene obedo kacwiyo pii matye ite ngom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Kibedo ka onyo pii i kabedo kama onongo yat tye kadongo iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">ka gumiyo ora kulugu gumol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">piine ocito ite yadi ducu ma i bunga.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />En aye ma omiyo yate odongo woko mabor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">ma okato yadi ducu ma gidongo i bunga woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">jange odongo maboco dok mapek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">pi pii mabup ma onongo tye i pote.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Winyo ducu me polo gigero odigi i jange;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">ki lee tim ducu ginywalo lutinogi ite tipune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">dok rok madito me wi lobo ducu giywe ite tipune.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Onongo nen maber mada i dite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">ki i boco me jange ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">pien lwite odonyo piny i ngom kama pii mabup tye iye.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aca 2:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yadi cedar ma gudongo i poto pa Lubanga pe kitwero pyem kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">kadi ki yadi ma gudongo maboco bene pe kitwero poro kwede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Pe tye yadi mo ma komgi pwot ma kiporo ki jange wacel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Pe tye yat mo i poto pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ma onongo nen ber calo eno.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Aketo obedo manen maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">ma jange ojany woko i kabedo ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">Yadi ma i Eden ducu dong nyeko omakogi woko ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">gin yadi ma onongo yam gitye i poto pa Lubangani.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />Pimeno, An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni. Kit macalo yat meno odongo mabor, wiye oo wa ikin pol, ka dong ocako wake ki i cwinye pi boreni, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />ma omiyo an dong akwero yat meno woko, amiyo woko bot laloc me rok mukene. En bitic ki yat man ikit yo ducu malubu rac kite. <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />Lurok, ma gin jo mager adada ma gikato rok mukene ducu, gibitongo yat meno gireto woko i ngom ka dong giweko kunu. Jange bipoto iwi godi ki i nota ducu, ci gibitur woko lirum idye kulu ma gimol i lobo ducu. Ma omiyo jo ducu ma gubedo iwi lobo gibia woko ki ite tipune giweko yat meno. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Winyo bene bibino ci gibedo ikom yat ma opotoni, ki lee tim bene gibibedo kawot ki iwi jange ma oturi. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Man ducu bitime wek yadi ducu ma gidongo kanget pii pe gudong maboco tutwal, dok bene pe wigi oo wa ikin pol, wek yat mo ki ikin yadi ducu ma cwiyo pii pe odong maboco calo gin. Gin ducu bito calo dano, ma ka guto ci myero gudony piny i lyel i lobo pa jo ma oto karibe ki jo ma oto matye kunu.”<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Inino ma yat meno dong odonyo piny i lobo pa jo ma oto, abimiyo pii matye ite ngom ume ci kumu pire. Abijuku kulu madongo gu woko ducu, miyo ora kulu ducu dong pe bimol kato woko. Pi yat meno abimiyo piny cido woko ikom got Lebanon ci amiyo yadi ducu ma dongo i bunga two woko. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />Ikare ma abicwalo en kwede me cito i lobo pa jo ma oto, mor me potone keken bimiyo rok ducu yenge. Yadi ducu me Eden, ki yadi ducu me Lebanon ma gibeco adada, ki yadi ducu ma gicwiyo pii, gibikweyo cwinygi i lobo matye piny. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Gin bene gibicito piny kacel kwede, me bedo ki jo mayam dong kityeko nekogi woko i lwenyi. Eyo, jo ducu ma gitye ikin lurok mayam gibedo ite tipune gibito.<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />Ci yat ma kiloko ikomeni en aye rwot me Ejipt ki lwake ducu. Kadi bed yadi me Eden onongo pe gitye kitmeno i deyo ki i bocogi, kibikelo in ibedo kacel ki yadi me Eden idonyo i lobo matye piny; ci ibiribe ki jo ma pe kilirogi dok ki jo mayam kinekogi i lweny.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s1">Kiporo rwot me Ejipt ki Nyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />Inino dwe acel, me dwe me apar wiye aryo, i mwaka me apar wiye aryone me bedowa i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, dange ki koko pi Parao rwot me Ejipt, kun iwace ni: in itamo ni ibedo calo labwor ikin rok ducu, ento in dong ibedo meri calo nyang ma min kulu ma bedo i nam, kun baro dye pii ki i kulu. Irubu i pii woko ki coto tyeni, ma omiyo ibalo pii ma i kulugu woko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />Ka rok ducu gucoke kacel, ci abiciko obwona ci amaki kwede woko, ka dong amiyo kiywayi kwede iwi tura. <verse eid="EZK 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />Ci abiboli woko piny wa i ngom, ka dong abimiyo winyo ducu gipye ikomi ki lee ducu ma i lobo gibino ci gibicami woko. <verse eid="EZK 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />Abipongo wi godi ki notagu ducu ki komi ma otop. <verse eid="EZK 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />Abidyako lobo kadi wa wi godi bene ki remoni ma moli, ma ora kulu ducu bene bipong woko ki remoni keken. <verse eid="EZK 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Niy 6:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:12">8:12</ref></char></note>Ka dong atyeko neki woko, ci abiumu pol woko, kun amiyo lakalatwene ducu gicido macol licuc; ki dok abimiyo pol umu ceng woko, ki dwe bene dong pe biryeny mamiyo deyone caro piny. <verse eid="EZK 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />Abikwanyo dero me gin maryeny ducu ma tye i polo woko ci amiyo loboni dong i colpiny.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />“Abiryango cwiny jo me rok mapol, ka aterowu i opii ikin lurok iwi lobo ducu kama yam onongo pe wungeyo. <verse eid="EZK 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />Abimiyo lwak me rok mapol gibedo ki ur tutwal ikomi, ki lukergi bene komgi bimyel ki lworo piri. Ka atingo pala lucwana inyimgi ikare ma ibilimo iye can, lurok kacel ki lukergi komgi bibedo kamyel amyela cawa ducu, kun nongo dano acel acel paro pi kwone keken.”<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Laloc me Babilon bibino ci lwenyo ikomi ki pala lucwane. <verse eid="EZK 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />Ci abiweko acikari ma gua ki i rok mager ducu giwoto pala lucwangi ci gineko ki lwaki woko. Gibijwero jami ducu ma itye ka wake pirgini, ci gibineko lwaki woko. <verse eid="EZK 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />Abineko dyangini woko ducu ki iwang pii ikabedo ducu mapatpat. Dong dano nyo lee mo bibedo pe matwal ma birubu pii kun balo woko ki coto doki. <verse eid="EZK 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />Abimiyo piine pye mot ci doko maleng, dok abimiyo pii ma i kuluni ducu mol mot calo moo ma mol. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />Ikare ma abimiyo lobo Ejipt doko obur, ma iye dong nono, dok ka jami ducu mayam opongo loboni dong kijwero woko, ka bene aneko jo ducu ma gibedo iye, man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />Man bene biloke doko wer lyel. Mon me rok ducu gibiwero wer man me lyeli, kun gikok kwede pi Ejipt ki lwake ducu; gibigoyo wer lyel man ki jami agoyagu. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo pa jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />Inino dwe apar wiye abic, dwe me acel, i mwaka me apar wiye aryo me bedowa i opii, Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano kok pi lwak ma gibedo i Ejipt, ci icwalgi kacel ki jo me rok matego gudony piny i lobo pa jo ma oto, karibe ki jo mayam dong guto ma kiyikogi i lyel kununi. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />Wac botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:19">‘Wun mono dok wubeco wunen mwonya wukato jo mukene woko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:19">Wucit, wudonyu piny wubut i lyel pa jo ma pe gilirogi.’<verse eid="EZK 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Ci jo me Ejipt gibito kacel ki jo ma kibinekogi i lweny. Dok bene lweny matyeni kiyubu pi neko jo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />Rwodi ma gin cogi oteka kibiloko pirgi ki pi jo mayam konyogi, ma nongo dong gitye idye lyel, kun giwaco ni, ‘Dong gutyeko donyo woko piny kany, kun gibutu mot, gin jo ma pe kilirogi ma kinekogi ki i lwenyi.’<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />Aciria dong tye kunu, ki lyel pa acikari me monye bene orume woko dyere. Gin acikari magi ducu kinekogi ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Lyelgi tye piny wa idye bur kamatut adada, ki acikari dul monye bene gurumu lyele woko; gin ducu dong kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan, gin jo mayam nyayo lworo maracu i lobo pa jo makwoni.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />Elam bene tye kunu, kun lwake ducu gurumu lyele woko; gin ducu kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Ci gudonyo woko piny i lyel ma i lobo pa jo ma oto kun pe kilirogi. Gin aye jo ma ginyayo lworo maracu i lobo pa jo makwo, ento gibedo ki lewic kacel ki jo ma gidonyo piny i bur. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Kipeto kitanda pi jo Elam ikin jo ma kinekogi kacel ki lwake ducu, dok lyel pa acikarine orume woko dyere. Gin ducu pe kilirogi, gin gubedo jo ma kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan. Yam lworo pi komgi onya oromo i lobo pa jo makwo ducu, ento koni dong gibedo ki lewic kacel ki jo ma gidonyo piny i bur; ci kiketogi ikin jo ma kinekogi.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />Mecek ki Tubal bene gitye kunu, kacel ki lwakgi ducu, ki lyel pa acikari monygi bene orumugi woko dyere. Gin ducu jo ma pe kilirogi kinekogi woko i lweny ki pala lucwan; pien gubedo kanyayo lworo maracu i lobo pa jo makwo. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />Dano pe dok bimiyo botgi woro ikare ma kiyikogi, kit macalo kimiyo woro kwede ikare ma kiyiko twoni oteka lweny macon, ma dong kiketogi i lyel ma guruke woko ki jami lwenygi, kiteno wigi ki pala lucwan gi dok kiumu komgi ki kwotgi. Gin twoni oteka magi onongo yam gitego mada ma gubedo kamiyo lworo maracu omako jo makwo.<verse eid="EZK 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />Meno aye kit macalo jo Ejipt bibutu kwede ma nongo dong kinyotogi woko ikin jo ma pe kilirogi, kacel ki jo ma kinekogi ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />Edom tye kunu kacel ki lukerne ki rwodine ducu. Gin onongo gubedo acikari matego mada, ento kombedi dong kiyikogi kacel ki jo ma pe kilirogi mayam kinekogi i lweny.<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />Dong rwodi me lobo ma yo tung kumalo ducu gitye kunu, ki jo Cidon ducu bene tye kunu. Tekogi mayam gitye kwedeni onongo onyayo lworo mada, ento kombedi dong gudonyo i lyel, ki lewic kacel ki jo ma kinekogi i lweny, gubutu dong ma pe kilirogi. Dong gibedo ki lewic kacel ki jo ma gidonyo wa piny i bur.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />Ka Parao rwot me Ejipt onenogi ducu, cwinye bikwe pi tone kekene ki pi to pa acikari me monye ma kinekogi woko i lweny meno. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />An aye ma amiyo rwot me Ejipt onyayo lworo ikom jo makwo, ento kombedi dong en kacel ki acikari me monye kibinekogi woko ci kibipyelogi i lyel ikin jo ma pe kilirogi, ma kinekogi i lweny, Parao kacel ki lwake ducu.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s1">Tic pa lakurpiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, tit bot lutuwu jo Icrael kun iwaco botgi gin ma time ka akelo lweny i lobo moni. Gin wegi lobo meno giyero dano ki ikin gi me bedo lakurpinygi. <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />Kace en oneno lukwor ma gibino i lobo, ci kutu tum wek dano gunge komgi. <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />Kace inen dano mo owinyo koko tum, ce pe oketo iye cwinye, ka lukwor gubino guneke, lok me tone bibedo i wiye kekene. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />Tone bene bedo bale gire, pien kadi en owinyo koko tum, ci pe oketo iye cwinye. Ka nene oketo iye cwinye, kono onongo olaro kwone. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Ento kace lakurpiny oneno lukwor bino ce pe okutu tum, wek otit bot dano gunge komgi, ce lukwor gubino guneko ngat mo ki ikin gi; dong dano ma kitmeno bito i bale, ci man bimiyo abidwoko alii me tone iwi lakurpiny.<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />Dong kombedi, in wod pa dano, aketo in me bedo lakurpiny pi rok me Icrael. Ibitito botgi lok ducu ma acikogi kwede ma an awaci. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />Kace awaco bot latim marac ni. ‘In latim marac, ibito ada,’ ento ka pe iloko bote kun icike me loke owek timo gin maracu, ci dano meno ma latim marac bito i balenu, ento alii me tone abidwoko iwii. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />Ento kace onongo ijuku en latim marac meno, kun icike ni owek yo me tim maracu, ci kace en pe oloke oweko yo me tim maracuneni, ci en bito i balenu, ento nongo in giri ilaro kwoni.”<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma ngat acel acel myero otim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />Rwot owaca ni, “Dong in, wod pa dano, wac bot jo me ot pa Icrael ni: wun wuwaco kuman ni, ‘Tim aranyiwa ki balwa ducu gire tye iwiwa, dong kimiyo wato woko ata; dok watwero bedo kwo ningning?’ <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Wac botgi ni, an Rwot Lubanga makwo akwonge ni, cwinya pe bedo yom me neno ka latim marac to, ento amito ni en bene onguti owek timo bal, ci oloke odwog bota wek obed kwo. Wuloke, wudwog cen wuwek timo bal; pingo wumito ni wuto woko, wun jo me ot pa Icrael?<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />Kombedi, in wod pa dano, wac bot lutuwu jo Icrael ni, ka dano ma kite atir otimo bal, ci gin mabeco ma en otiyo dong pe bitwero lare. Kace dano ma latim marac oweko time me tiyo gin marac, ci pe kibiketo can ikome, ento kace dano ma kite atir ocako timo bal, ci pe dok bimede ki bedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />Ento kadi bed awaco bot dano ma kite atir ni en bibedo kwo ada, ento kace en ojenge ikom kite ma atiri ce dok ocako timo bal, ci pe abipo ikom gin mabeco ducu mayam en otiyo kadi ki acel. En bito pi balenu ma en otimoni. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />Doki kadi ka awaco ki dano ma latim marac ni, ‘In ibito ada,’ ento kace en oloke oweko timo bale, ce otiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir, <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />labole tye kit man ni, kace latim marac meno okwanyo gin ma kijengo bote odwoko cen bot rwode, dok bene ka en odwoko gin mayam oyako ayaka cen, kun lubu cik ducu mamiyo kwo, ma pe dong timo kit bal mo; ci en bibedo kwo ada, pe bito gire. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />Dong abiweko bale ducu mayam en otimo pe dong abipo pirgi. En dong gire bibedo kwo ada pien otimo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir.<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />Ento lutuwu giwaco ni, ‘Gin ma Rwot tye ka timone pe atir!’ Meno pe kakare, gin ma gin timo aye pe atir. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Kace dano ma kite atir oloke oweko timo gin matye atir, ce ocako otimo bal, en bito pi balenu. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Ento ka latim marac oloke oweko time maracu, ce ocako otiyo gin ma cik mito dok matye atir, ci en bibedo kwo pire. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />Ento wun wuwaco ni, ‘Gin ma Rwot tye katimone pe atir.’ Dong abingolo kop i komwu kun lubu gin ma wutimo wun jo Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ikom kit ma Jerucalem opoto kwede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:3-10">2 Luk 25:3-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:2-8">Jer 39:2-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4-14">52:4-14</ref></char>
    </note>Inino dwe abic, dwe me apar, i mwaka me apar wiye aryo, ma onongo dong kiterowa watye i opii, dano mo ma obwot ki i Jerucalem obino bota ci otita ni taun madit me Jerucalem dong opoto woko. <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />I otyeno ma okatoni, ma onongo danonu pud peya obino bota, onongo dong alimo teko pa Rwot ci Rwot ogonyo te leba omiya teko me lok ci doga oyabe, pe dok abedo ma te leba okwe.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal pa lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, jo magi ma gibedo i taun madito magi ma dong odong obur i lobo Icraeli giwaci, ‘Abraim yam obedo dano acel keken, ento kimiye lobo man, ci ocamo woko ducu obedo mere kene. Ento nen wan wapol adada loboni dong kimiyowa me bedo mewa.’<verse eid="EZK 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />Pimeno in myero itit botgi gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone kuman ni: wun wucamo ringo matye ki remo ikome, kun bene wuilo wangwu malo kaworo cal jogigu. Dok wuneko dano bene, ci wutamo ni loboni wubicamo bedo mewu ada? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Ci wun dong wujenge mewu ikom pala lucwan ma i cingwu. Dok bene wutimo gin me kwer mapol kun nongo dano acel acel balo dako pa lawote; adada wun wutamo ni wubicamo loboni bedo mewu?<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />Wac botgi ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: dong akwonge ni, adada jo ma gibedo i kabedo ma dong odoko wi oburri kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan; ki jo ma kibinongogi gibedo i tim ata abimiyo nguu mwodogi woko. Dong jo ma gibedo i gangi me cel gogo, ki jo ma gibedo i boro gotgu two gemo aye binekogi woko. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />Abimiyo lobo man doko obur dok kabedo kama dano mo pe bedo iye. Man bimiyo tek ma onongo giwake pireni dong bigik woko. Godi me Icrael dong bidong nono ma ngat mo pe dok bikato ki ikin gi. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Ka inen amiyo lobo man odoko obur, dok kama dano pe bedo iye, pi tim me kwergi ducu ma gutimo, ci bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adwogi me lok pa lanebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />Rwot dok owaco ni, “In wod pa dano, lutuwu gitye kalok piri ka gurwate inget cel me gang nyo i dog odigi. Dano acel acel waco ki lawote ni, ‘Bin, waciwiny kit lok ango ma oa ki bot Rwot kombedi.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />Ci gibino boti kit macalo dano kare ducu gibinoni, gibedo piny inyimi macalo jona, kun giwinyo gin ducu ma in itito botgi, ento pe gibitiyo gin ma in itito botgini. Ginyutu ni gitye ki mar madwong ki lok goba ma giloko ki doggi keken, ento guketo cwinygi mere i nongo lim i yo ma pe atir. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />Ci in dong inen ki botgi calo dano mo ma wero wer me mar ma nongo winyo dwone mit, kun bene goyo agoya ki nanga. Ci giwinyo lok ducu ma iwacogu, ento pe gilubu mo kadi ki acel. <verse eid="EZK 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />Ikare ma loki bicobe, ci bene bicobe ada, man bimiyo gingeyo ni lanebi mo yam obedo ikin gi.”<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ikom lukwat me Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, tit lok ikom lukwat pa jo Icrael, ma gin romina. Tit botgi lok ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone botgi kuman ni: can iwiwu, wun lukwat me Icrael! Wugwoko komwu keken, ento pe wupito romina. <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Wumato cakgi, wuruku yer romogu, ci wuneko romi ma ocwegu me acamawu, ento pe wupito romina. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Dok pe wubedo kagwoko jo magoro, pe wucango jo ma komgi lit, pe wutweyo tyen jo ma gulimo ret, jo mungak pe wudwogogi cen, pe wubedo kayenyo jo ma gurwenyo, ento wubedo kaloyogi ki tek dok ki gero. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Wel 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Luk 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note>Kitmeno guket woko, pien lakwatgi mo onongo peke; ma omiyo romi gudoko cam pa nguu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Romina guket woko gubedo kalak ata iwi godi ducu ki iwi cere mabocogu ducu. Ci romina guket woko iwi lobo ducu, ento ngat mo pe ma oyenyogi nyo ma oteme me nongogi.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />Kombedi wun lukwat, wuwiny gin ma an Rwot atye kawacone botwu. <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" />Adada, an Rwot Lubanga makwoni, atye kawaco kuman ni, romina dong gudoko lee me amaka, gudoko cam pa nguu, pien onongo pe gitye ki lakwat mo. Lukwat pe guyenyo romina, ento gubedo ka pito komgi keken, ma pe gubedo ka pito romina. <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />Pimeno, wuwiny loka, wun lukwat. <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atucu botwu atyer ni atye ki lok i komwu. Abikwanyo romina woko ki botwu, ci abimiyo pe dong wubedo lukwatgi matwal, dok bene pe wubimede ki pito komwu kekenwu. Abilaro romina woko ki i dogwu, pe dong wubibedo kacamogi.”<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lakwat maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />Ci Rwot dok owaco ni, “An Rwot Lubanga matwero ducu, atito botwu ni an kikoma aye dong abiyenyo romina, dok abiketo cwinya me gwokogi. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />Kit macalo lakwat keto kwede cwinye me yenyo romine ma guket woko i kabedo matye kama bocogu, kitmeno bene an abiketo cwinya me gwoko romina, abilarogi, akwanyogi woko ki i kabedo ducu mayam guket iye inino ma can bipoto iye. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />Abikwanyogi ki ikin lurok, kun acokogi ki iwi lobo ducu, ci akelogi wa i lobogi kikome. Abimiyo gibedo kacam iwi godi me Icrael, inget wang it ma gunye agunya, ki i kabedo ducu ma i lobo kama dano bedo iye. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />Abimiyo gicamo lum mabeco i kakwat mabere, ki i kabedo matye iwi godi maboco me Icrael; ci gibibutu kunu i olet ma lobone ber me kakwat, ci dong gibicamo lum mabeco iwi godi me Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />An kikoma aye abibedo lakwat me romina, ci abimiyo gibutu piny, man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />Abiyenyo romi ma gurwenyo, dok abikwanyo romi mayam gitye kalak ata adwokogi cen, abitweyo tyen romi ma ret tye iye, ki bene abimiyo romi magoro gijing gidoko tek, dok abiketo wanga me neno romi mucwe ki mategone; abipitogi ki kit yo ma atir.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />Kombedi dong, wun romina, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atitiwu ni abingolo kop ikomwu wun ducu, kun apoko kinwu woko, ci aketo jo mabeco pat, ki jo maracu bene aketogi pat kaken gi; ci apoko romi woko ki ikom dyegi. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Lum ma wucamo i kakwat maberi mono pe romowu, ma weko dok wunyono lum mukene woko piny ki tyenwuni? Ka dok bene wumato pii malengi, ento wurubu pii mukene ki tyenwu wubalo woko! <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />Wutamo ni romina mukene myero gucam lum ma dong wunyono woko piny ki tyenwu, dok wumito gumat pii ma wurubu ki tyenwu wubalo wokoni?<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />Pimeno, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong abingolo kop ikin romi mucwe ki romi mujony. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Kit macalo wubedo kacoro romi magoro ki lakngetwu ki gwokwu, kun wutucu igi woko pil ki tungwu, wumiyo guket gucito woko wa kama boconi, <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />an abilarogi, pe dong gibibedo me amaka pa nguu; ci abingolo kop ikin romi ki romi luwotgi. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:17">Niy 7:17</ref></char></note>Abicimo latica ma a ki ot pa Daudi me bedo lakwatgi, lakwat acel keken; en bipitogi kun bene bedo lakwatgi. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:24">Eje 37:24</ref></char></note>Dong an Rwot Lubanga abibedo Lubangagi, ki latica ma bia ki i ot pa Daudi bibedo rwot ikin gi. An Rwot dong atyeko loko man. <verse eid="EZK 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />Abiketo gicike me kuc kwedgi kun atyeko nguu ma yelogini woko ducu ki i lobogi, wek dong gubed idye tim labongo ayela mo, kun bene gibutu wa i bunga. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />Ci abimiyo gum ikomgi ki ikom kabedo ducu murumu got mera maleng. Dok abimiyo kot cwer botgi ikare ma nongo gimito kot kikome, ci bikelo gum botgi. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Yadi ducu me tim binyako nyiggi, ki lobo bene bimiyo ginapita ma kipuru iye cek nya mabup, man bimiyo gibedo i lobogi labongo ayela mo. Ka dong alaro jona woko ki i cing jo mayam gulokogi gudoko opiigini, kun bene aturu rii okol mayam kitweyogi kwede woko, ci dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Ci pe dok lurok biyakogi matwal, kadi ki nguu me tim bene dong pe bimwodogi; gibibedo maber labongo kit ayela mo, dok bene ngat mo pe ma bimiyo gibedo ki lworo. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Dok abimiyogi ngom maber ma ceko cam mabup atika, man bimiyo kec dong pe binekogi matwal i lobogi, ci dong pe gibibedo ginacaya pa jo me rok ducu. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" />Ci gin ducu gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubangagi, atye kagwokogi, dok bene gin jo me ot pa Icrael gin jona. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Dong wun romina, an aye ma akwayowu i oleta, an Lubangawu,” man Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma owaco.<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s1">Pwod ma Lubanga biketo ikom Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cik wangi inen tung got Ceir, ci itit lok man ikome. <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />Wac bot jo ma gibedo kunu ni, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">Nen, atye ki lok ikomwu, wun jo ma ikom got me Ceir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:3">Abiryeyo cinga i komwu ci abimiyo lobowu doko obur kama dano mo pe bedo iye.<verse eid="EZK 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />Ci abiweko taunwu madito ducu doko obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:4">ki wun dong wubibedo i lobo ma obale woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 35:4">Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />Kadi wun bene onongo wubedo ki adagadaga me mone madit ikom ot pa jo Icrael ducu, ci man oweko wumiyo kibedo kanekogi woko ki pala lucwan ikare ca ma can opoto ikomgi, ki ikare ma aketo can ikomgi me agiki. <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" />Pimeno, an Lubanga matwero ducu dong akwonge ni, adada dong ayube me miyo pala lucwan aye ma binekowu, ci binekowu nakanaka tyekowu woko ducu; pien wutye ki bal alii me nek, pimeno pala lucwan bibedo kanekowu nakanaka. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Ci abimiyo got Ceir dong obur, ki lobone iye bidong nono; ci dong abimiyo jo ma gibino ki jo ma gicito gikato ki kenyo gitum woko matwal. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />Abipongo wi godiwu ki kom dano ma kinekogi; ci jo ma kinekogi ki pala lucwan gibipoto iwi cerewu ducu ki i notawu ki longowu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />Abimiyo lobowu iye dong nono kare ducu, ki taunwu madito bene ducu dano dong pe bibedo iye. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />Yam wubedo kawaco ni rok magi aryo, Icrael ki Juda, ki lobogi ducu bidoko mewu, dok bene wubicamo gibedo mewu, kadi bed an Rwot aye abedo Lubangagi. <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" />Pimeno, an Rwot Lubanga akwonge ni, abitic kwedwu kun lubu kit kinigawu ki nyekowu ma dong wutyeko nyutugi woko kamalengi, pien wubedo ki adagadaga ikom jona. Ci abimiyo wungeya ikinwu kekenwu, ka dong acako ngolo kop i komwu pi gin ma wutimo ikom jona. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an Rwot onongo awinyo lok ma wubedo kawacone ki cac ikom godi me Icrael, kun wuwaco ni dong gudong igi nono, ki dok ni dong kimiyo botwu ni wucam obed mewu. <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Dok bene wumiine kenwu me bedo dit makato an woko, kun wunyate kwede ikoma ma wuloko lok mapol; ci dong meno ducu an atyeko winyo.”<verse eid="EZK 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Abimiyo lobowu iye dong nono, wek jo me wi lobo ducu gubed ki yomcwiny pi can ma opoto i komwu. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Kit macalo wun wubedo ki yomcwiny pi ginaleya pa jo me ot pa Icrael ni, pien ni lobogi dong odong nono, an bene abitimowu kitmeno, wun jo ma wubedo i got Ceir, ki jo Edom ducu. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s1">Dwoko gum pa jo Icrael botgi ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />Rwot dok owaco ni, “In wod pa dano, tit ki godi me Icrael kun iwaco botgi ni guwiny lok ma an <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye ka loko botgi ni, ‘Lukwor pa jo Icrael giwaco ni, dong wuneno, cere macongu ducu dong gudoko mewa.’<verse eid="EZK 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />Tit lok kun itucu gin ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone. Pien rok macokcok ma gurumu lobo Icrael gulwenyo ci guyako godi me Icrael woko, kun gin ducu gubedo kanywaro jo Icrael ki lok agec. <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />Pimeno, wun godi me Icrael, dong wuwiny lok ma an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu atye kawacone bot godi ki cere, ki bot ora kulu ki nota, ki bot gangi mayam dong kiweko gudong obur, ki taun madito mayam dong kitenyo woko, ma rok ducu ma gurumu kangetgi guyako ci dong odoko ginacayagi.<verse eid="EZK 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />Ma omiyo an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko woko atyer kamaleng ikom rok ma gurumu Icrael ki kinigana malyet atika, makatone atye kalok ikom Edom. Pien gin jonu gubino ki yomcwiny madit kun gitye ki cac bene, ci gumako lobona gucamo odoko meggi wek giyak jami matye iye woko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />Pimeno, tit lok ma kemo lobo Icrael, ma kun iwaco bot godi ki ceregu ducu, ki bot nota ki longogu ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, atye kalok ki nyeko ki akemo bene, pien dong wuciro cac pa lurok ma omiyowu lewic mada. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Ma omiyo an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, akwonge akwonga ni lurok ducu ma gurumuwu dyere gin kikomgi kibicayogi mada kun lewic bene makogi marac. <verse eid="EZK 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />Ento wun godi me Icrael, yadi dok gibidongo iwiwu ci ginyako nyiggi pi jona jo Icrael; pien gin dong cok dwogo paco. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />Pien an atye pirwu, wun jona, dok abineno ada ni lobowu kipuru dok kipito kodi iye bene. <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />Ci abimiyo wunya wudoko mapol, wun jo me ot pa Icrael ducu. Wubibedo i taunwu madito doki, ki i kabedo mayam kijwerogi gudong oburri wubigerogi odoco. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />Ci abimiyo dano kadi wa lee ginya gimede. Welwu bimede wubibedo pol makato kit mayam con wutye kwede ca, kun wunywalo lutino mapol. Ci abimiyo wubedo kunu kit macalo yam kong wubedo ikare mukwongo ca ci abimiyowu lonyo mabup makato lonyo ma onongo yam wutye kwede. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />Ci abikelowu wun jona jo Icrael adwokowu cen, ka dok amiyo wubiwoto idye lobowu. Dong wubileyo lobo man bedo mewu, ci dong bedowu i loboni pe dok bimiyo kec neko lutinowu wa ki acel.<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco ni: rok mukeneni gilwongowu kun ginywarowu ni, ‘Lobo Icrael obedo lobo macamo jone woko’, kun bene giwaco ni lobo Icrael obedo lobo maneko lutinogi woko. <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />Ento cake tin cito kwede anyim pe dong gibibedo lucam dano, ma giyako lutino ki botwu ci gimwodo woko. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Dok bene abimiyo pe dong wubiwinyo cac pa lurok matwal, ci pe dong wubibedo ki lewic ikin lurok, dok loboni pe dong bineko lutinoni matwal. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo manyen pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, ikare ma jo Icrael gubedo i lobogi gubalo woko ki kitgi ki gin ducu ma gubedo katimone. Aneno kitgi obedo calo gin ma keni calo two kwer ma dako twoyo ka karene oromo. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />Ma omiyo aonyo akemona gira ikomgi pi dano ma gubedo kanekone i lobo, ki dok bene pi cal jogi ma gutiyo ci gubalo kwede lobo wokoni. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />Yam akeyogi woko ikin lurok, ci guket guromo wi lobo ducu. Yam angolo kop ikomgi kun onongo alubu kitgi ki gin ducu ma onongo gutiyo. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />Ento ikare ma gucito ikin lurok, ki i kabedo ducu ma gubedo kacito iye, gupyedo nyinga malengi matek, pien dano gubedo kaloko lok ikomgi ni, ‘Magi dano pa Rwot, ento kiketogi woko ki i lobo mayam Rwot omiyogini.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Ento an onongo abedo kaparo pi nyinga malengi mada, ma jona jo Icrael gumiyo gibedo kapyedone ikin lurok ma gin gucito gubedo ikin gi ni.<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />Pimeno, wac bot jo Icrael lok ma an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu amito waco botgi ni, ‘Gin ma aecito ka timoneni pe pi wun jo Icrael, ento abitimo pi nyinga malengi, ma dong wun wupyedo woko ikin lurok kama wucito iyeni. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />Ci abinyutu kit ma nyinga leng kwede, ma dong kityeko pyedone woko ikin lurok, ma wun wupyedo ikin gi ni. Ka anyutu kit ma aleng kwedeni i komwu ma lurok bene gineno, ci bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco. <verse eid="EZK 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />Ci abikwanyowu ki i rok ducu, dok abicokowu woko liweng ki iwi lobo ducu, ci akelowu i lobowu kikome. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />Ci abikiro pii maleng i komwu miyo wulonye woko ikom gin ma keni ducu, ki i woro cal jogiwu ducu, ci dong alonyowu miyo wubedo leng. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19-20">Eje 11:19-20</ref></char></note>Abimiyowu cwiny manyen dok aketo cwiny manyen i iwu; ci abikwanyo cwiny matek calo gotti woko ki i komwu, ci amiyowu cwiny me bedo lawiny. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />Dok abiketo cwiny mera aye i iwu, kun amiyo wubedo ka lubu cika kun wugwoke katiyo gin ducu ma an aciko. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />Ci wubibedo i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwariwu. Ci dong wun wubibedo jona, ki an abibedo Lubangawu. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />Dok abilarowu ki i gin ducu ma keni mayam wutiyo; ci abimiyo bel cek botwu mabup atika, dong pe abimiyo kec bedo kanekowu. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />Abimiyo yadi nyako nyiggi mabup kidok bene amedo cam ma i potiwu cek mabup, wek pe dong wubed ki lewic ikin lurok pi kec. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Man bimiyo wupo ikom kitwu maracu, ki ikom gin maracu ducu ma wutimo; mamiyo wubibedo ki keco i cwinywu i komwu kekenwu pi balwu me lewic ki pi gin ducu me kwer ma ceng wutimo. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Ci myero wunge atir ni gin ma abitimoni pe atimo pirwu. Myero lewic omakwu dok alee bene myero otwodwu pi timwu maracu. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Inino ma abilonyowu kwede ki ikom balwu ducu, abimiyo dano dong gibedo i taunwu madito, ki kabedo ducu mayam gudong oburgu kibigerogi odoco. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Dong lobo mayam onongo iye odong nononi kibicako purune, miyo pe dong nen macalo lobo ma kibalo woko bot jo ma gikato ki kangete. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />Ci gibiwaco ni lobo man mayam odoko tim atani, dong oloke odoko calo poto Eden, dok taun madito mayam kijwerogi gudong nononi ma gudoko oburri kombedi dong dano gibedo i igi dok bene kigero cel gogo orumugi woko dyere. <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Dong man bimiyo lurok ma gudong ma gibedo kangetwu ma gurumuwu gingeyo ni an Rwot dong agero kabedo magi ducu mayam odoko oburri odoco, ka dok amiyo gipuru kama yam odoko tim atani woko. An Rwot dong atyeko loko ni abitimo man, ci dong bene abitimo.”<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Abitiyo gin makato maca mayam atiyoni. Ci abiweko jo Icrael gilega ni akonygi. Abimiyo ginya welgi mede calo lwak romi. <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />Ci gangi magi ducu ma kombedi dong gudoko oburri dong bipong ki lwak dano mapol ata calo Jerucalem mayam opong ki lwak romi ma onongo giterogi me atyera me gitum inino madito ma kiciko. Man bimiyo gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s1">Nota ma opong ki cogo ma otwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />Rwot onongo odiya matek ki cinge, ci okela woko ki Cwiny mere, ci ociba piny wa idye nota ma opong ki cogo keken. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Ci en otela awoto arumu nota woko adunu ikin cogo; ci aneno lwak cogo mapol ata matye kunu, dok onongo dong gutwo woko adada. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />Ci Rwot dok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cogo magi doki gitwero bedo kwo?” An adok iye ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, in giri aye ingeyo.” <verse eid="EZK 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Rwot dok owaca ni, “Tit lok bot cogo magi, kun iwaco botgi ni, Wun cogo mutwo, wuwiny lok pa Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" />Wac botgi ni an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, abiwaco botgi kuman ni, ‘Abiketo yweyo me kwo i iwu ci amiyo doki wubedo kwo. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />Dok bene abiketo ler i komwu, ci amiyo ringo bino i komwu, ci dok amiyo del kom umu komwu woko. Ci abiketo yweyo me kwo i iwu, ci wubibedo kwo doki. Man bimiyo wungeyo ni an aye a Rwot.’”<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Kitmeno atito lok kit macalo onongo kiwaca ni atit. Ikare ma atye katito lok, awinyo woo, ci cogo gucako coke guribe woko kacel, ci cogo magi gucako moko ikom wadi. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Ikare meno abedo kanenogi, ci aneno ler komgi, ki ringo komgi bene dong obino ikomgi, ka dok del komgi dong oumugi woko. Ento yweyo aye onongo peke i igi. <verse eid="EZK 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Rwot Lubanga owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, tit lok bot yamo. Cit itit ki yamo ni an aciko en ni, omyero yamo obin kun oa ki tungi ki tungi ducu, me kelo yweyo ikom dano magi ma gutoni wek doki gucak bedo ma kwo.” <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:11">Niy 11:11</ref></char></note>Ci atito lok kitmeno kit macalo Rwot ocika kwede, ci yweyo me kwo odonyo i igi, ci gucako bedo kwo, kun gucung ki tyen gi. Dok onongo gin tye lwak dano maromo dul mony madit tutwal.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Lubanga dok owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cogo magi gin aye jo me ot pa Icrael. Giwaco ni cogogi dong otwo woko; ki gen gi bene dong peke matwal pi kwogi me kare me anyim. <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />Pimeno, tit lok bot jona jo Icrael ni an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, abiyabo lyel woko. Ci abicero jonani woko matye i lyeli, ci dong adwokogi cen paco i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Ci gin jona dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot, ka dong atyeko yabo lyelgi, ma acerogi woko ki i lyel. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />Dok abiketo Cwiny mera i igi, ci bimiyo gibedo kwo, ki bene abiketogi gibedo i lobogi kikome. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. Yam acike ni abitimo man, ci dong atyeko timone. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Juda ki Icrael gibibedo ite ker acel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />En owaco ni, “Wod pa dano, kwany odoo yat mo ci ico coc ikome ni, ‘Pi Juda, ki dok pi jo Icrael mayam guribe kwede.’ Ka dok ikwany odoo yat mukene ci ico ikome ni, ‘Pi Yucepu ma koni dong tye i cing Epraim dok ki pi jo Icrael ducu mayam guribe kwede.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Ci dong irib odoo aryoni woko kacel wek dong gudok odoo acel ki i cingi. <verse eid="EZK 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />Ento lutuwu gibipenyi ni itit botgi pi odoo magi aryoni. <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />Ci in itit botgi ni an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, abikwanyo odoo ma ocung pi Icrael, ci aketo ikom odoo ma ocung pi Judani. Gin odoo magi aryoni abimiyo gidoko odoo acel kun amako i cinga bene. <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />Ka dong inen imako odoo magi aryo ma icoyo coc ikomgini i cingi ma gin gineno, <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" />ci dong itit botgi kuman ni an, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu, abikwanyo jo Icrael woko ki ikin lurok kama yam gucito gubedo ikin gi ni, ci abicokogi woko ki i kabedo ducu, akelogi aketogi i lobogi kikome. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />Abiribogi ci gidoko rok acel keken i lobogi, iwi godi me Icrael. Dong gibibedo ki rwot acel keken maloyo gin ducu, pe gibipoke gibedo rok aryo, dok bene pe gibipoke me bedo ki ker aryo. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />Pe dok gibibalo komgi keken gi ki cal lubangagi ki gin me kwer mogo maracu mayam gutiyo, pe bene gibibalo komgi ki kit balgi ducu. Ci abilarogi ki i yo ducu ma weko gingak gidok kwede katimo bal, ma omiyo gungayo wanga woko, ci abilonyogi gibedo leng; gin dong gibibedo jona, ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi, <verse eid="EZK 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:24">Eje 34:24</ref></char></note>Latica Daudi aye dong bibedo rwot ma loyogi. Gin ducu dong gibibedo ki lakwat acel. Ci gibilubu cika dok bene gibigwoko gin ma an aciko ducu kun gitiyo bene. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />Dong gibibedo i lobo mayam kwariwu gubedo iye, ma onongo amiyo bot latica Yakobo. Ci gibibedo kunu matwal kacel ki lutinogi wa ki likwayogi ducu bene. Ci latica Daudi biloyogi matwal. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />Dong abiketo gicikena kwedgi; ci gicike man ma aketo kwedgini bedo gicike me kuc ma rii matwal. Abimiyo gum botgi dok abimiyo ginya gimede, ci dong abiketo kabedona maleng i dyegi matwal. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">Niy 21:3</ref></char></note>Abibedo kunu kacel kwedgi kun abedo Lubangagi, ki gin bene gibedo jona. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Ci man bimiyo lurok dong gingeyo ni an Rwot dong alonyo Icrael woko, ka guneno kabedona maleng ma bedo matwali tye idyegi.”<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kitito ikom Gog</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:8">Niy 20:8</ref></char></note>En owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, cik wangi inen Gog matye i lobo Magog. En aye laker madit me lobo Mecek ki Tubal. Tit loki ikome, <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />kun iwace ni Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni: nen, atye ki lok ikomi, in Gog, laker madit maloyo Mecek ki Tubal. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />Abimiyo iloke ineno kamukene, ci agolo cwaki woko ki goli, ka apeyi kwede akeli kamaleng kacel ki monyi ducu, ki aguragura ni ki jo ma gingweco kwedgi, ma gin ducu guruke woko ki jami lweny. Gin lwak ma gitye i dul mony madit, ma gin ducu giwoto nongo guteno kwot, ma guyube ki gin lweny ducu dok gumako kwot ocal ki kwot kikome, ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />Jo Percia ki Kuc, ki jo Put bene gitye kacel kwedgi, ma gin ducu gumako kwot kun bene guruku tok me lweny. <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Jo Gomer ki dul monygi ducu, ki jo Bet-togarma ma gua ki kamabor i lobo matye tung kumalo, ci gubino ki dul monygi ducu, ki lwak me rok mukene bene ducu gubino ma gitye kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="EZK 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />Tit bote ni en myero oyube woko kacel ki dul monye ducu ma gucoke bote pi winyo cike. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Ci inge mwaka mapol kare bibino ma abicwale ni ocit olweny ikom lobo mo ma dano dong gubedo iye labongo lworo mo me lweny, en lobo kama yam kikelo iye dano ma kicokogi ki ikin rok mapol, wek gubed iwi godi me Icrael ma onongo yam odoko tim atani. Jone kikelogi woko ki ikin lurok ci kombedi gin ducu dong gibedo maber labongo ayela mo. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />Dong en kacel ki dul monyeni, ki lwak me rok mapol ma gitye kacel kwede, gibibino calo yamo lapiru ka lweny, ma nongo giumu lobo woko lipuk calo pol ma oumu piny.”<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman bot Gog ni, “Inino meno ibicako yubu tam i cwinyi me tiyo gin marac. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />Ci ibimoko tami giri me cito ka lweny ikom lobo ma jone gibedo mot maber labongo ayela mo i taun gi ma pe kirumugi ki cel, rii nyonyo bene pe iye, kadiwa dog gangigigu bene peke. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />Ci dok ibiyako jami pa dano ma gubedo i taun madito mayam odoko oburri ci itero woko. Gin yam kicokogi ki ikin lurok mapatpat ci kombedi dong gitye ki lwak dyangi, ki jami mapol, kun bene gubedo wa idye lobo kikome. <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Ci jo Ceba, jo Dedan ki lucatwil ma i taun matye i Tarcic gibipenyi ni, ‘In ibino kara ka yako jami bo? Dong ityeko guru dul monyi me tingo jami ma kiyako, ki dok ibino pi coko ryal ki jabu, ki me coko dyangi ki lwak jami mapolgu, nyo me coko jami mapol ma kiyako?’”<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />Pimeno, Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu oora ni atit ki Gog ni etye kawaco loke boti kuman ni, “Inino meno ka jona jo Icrael dong gubedo maber labongo ayela mo, ci in cwinyi bituge kekeni <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />kun ia ki i kabedoni matye kamabor i lobo matye tung kumalo me lobo Icrael. Ci ibibino kun itelo wi dul mony madit dok matek ma acikari ma gitye iye gua ki i rok ducu, gin ducu jo ma ngweco ki aguragura. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />In Gog ibibino ilwenyo ikom jona jo Icrael calo pol ma umu lobo. Lacen ka kare oromo, abicwali icito ka lweny ikom lobona, wek omii lurok gungeya, dok pi nyutu ni an aleng pi gin ma atiyo ki cinga ikom in Gog, kun gin rok ducu bene gineno. <verse eid="EZK 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />In aye ngat mayam abedo kalok pire ikare mukato con ca, ikare ma amiyo loka bot lutica lunebi me Icrael, ma gutito lok ni ikare ma pud tye anyim abikeli me lweny ikomgi.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwod ma Lubanga biketo ikom Gog</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco ni, “Inino ma Gog bibino ka lweny iye ikom Icrael, abidoko ger ma nongo akemo omaka ma pe wace. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />Atucu loke kamaleng ki nyeko me akemona ma lyel alyela. Inino meno oyengyeng biyengo lobo Icrael matek. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Man bimiyo rec me nam ducu, ki winyi, ki lee tim, ki gin ducu malak alaka i ngomgu, ki jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo komgi bimyel pi lworo an. Ci godigu ducu gibicore gipoto woko piny, ki longogu bene bipoto woko, dok cel bene ducu gibicore gipoto woko i nam. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" />Ci abimiyo Gog bibedo ki lworo madwong atika, kun nongo akelo kit pwod ducu mapatpat aketo ikome. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko. Ci jone ducu gibineke woko keken gi ki pala lucwan kun dano acel acel neko lawote. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />Dong abiketo can ikome kun bene abikelo two gemo ikome ci neko dano. Ka dok abicoro kot ma cwer ki yamo matek, pee ma core, ki gweng calfa ma mac oliyo woko, ma cwer ikome kacel ki ikom lwak me rok mapatpat ma onongo gitye kacel kwede. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Kitmeno abinyutu bot lwak me rok ducu ni an adit dok aleng, kun anyute inyimgi ni wek gungeya. Man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="s1">Kiloyo Gog woko i lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco ni, “In wod pa dano, tit lok ikom Gog, ma en laker madit maloyo lobo Mecek ki Tubal, cit itite ni atye ki lok ikome. <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />Abimiyo en loke neno kamukene ci akwanye woko wa ki i lobo ma en tye iye ca kamabor i tung kumalo, ci en biwot ki kunu nio ka en obino wa i godi me Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Ci abigoyo atume ki i cinge ma lacam poto woko, dok bene amiyo aterone poto woko ki i cinge ma lacuc. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />Gog ki dul monye ki lwak me rok mapatpat ma gitye kacel kwede gibipoto gito woko iwi godi me Icrael, ci dong abimiyo komgi doko cam pa kwayi winyo ducu ma camo ringo ki pa nguugu. <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />Gibipoto idye bar kamaleng ci gito woko. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko man. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />Abicwalo mac i Magog dok ikom jo ma gibedo mot labongo ayela i lobo murumu dog nam, man bimiyo gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />Abimiyo jona jo Icrael gingeyo nyinga malengi, dong pe abimiyo gipyedo nyinga malengi matwal. Ci rok ducu dong gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubanga Maleng pa Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Nino ma aloko pireni ada dong tye kabino. <verse eid="EZK 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />Jo ma gibedo i taun madito me Icrael gibicito woko gicoko jami lweny ma kiwekogu giobo ki mac calo yen. Gibiobo mac ikom kwot, atum, atero, odoo madito ki tonggi, ma gibibedo ka obogi pi mwaka abiro kulu. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />Man dong pe bimiyo gibedo kacoko yen ki i tim, dok bene pe dong gibitongo yen ki i bunga, pien dong gibimoko mac ki jami lweny ma kiwekogu. Gibiyako jami pa jo mayam guyako jamigi gucito kwede.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyiko Gog woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />Rwot Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Inino meno abimiyo kabedo me yik bot Gog i lobo Icrael, i Nota pa Luwot, matye yo tung kunyango me nam me Kado. Gog ki jo me dul monye ducu kibiyikogi kunu, ci notane dong kibilwongo ni Nota me Mony pa Gog. <verse eid="EZK 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />Jo Icrael gibibedo kayiko kom jo ma otoni pi dwe abiro kulu, pi lonyo lobogi wek obed maleng kit mayam con. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Wegi lobo ducu gibibedo kayiko kom jonu, man bimiyo giworogi pi gin ma gutimo inino ma abimiyo iye locani. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong aloko. <verse eid="EZK 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />Gibiyero jo mogo ki ikin gi me bedo kawot kun giwok gikato ki i lobogi teretere me yiko kom jo mogo mayam nongo pud gudong ma onongo pe kiyikogi, pi lonyo lobogi wek dok obed maleng kit mayam tye kwede con. Dong inge dwe abiro gibibedo kangiyo piny i kabedo ducu me neno ka dong kiyiko jo ma oto ducu ki i lobo. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Ci ikare ma nongo jo ma kiyerogini tye kawot i lobo, kace ngat mo ikin gi onongo cogo dano, ci keto lanyut mo kanget cogonu, nio ka luyik dano guyikogi woko i Nota me Kamon-Gog. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />(Taun mo tye kunu ma kibilwongo ni Kamona.) Meno aye kit macalo gibilonyo ki lobo wek obed maleng kit mayam con.”<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:17-18">Niy 19:17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco bota kuman ni, “In wod pa dano, lwong kwayi winyo ducu mapatpat ki lee tim ducu me coke kacamo gitum ma atye kayubune pirgi. Man bibedo karama madit iwi godi me Icrael, kama gibicamo iye ringo dok bene gimato iye remo. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Gibicamo kom acikari ma gin cogi oteka, dok gibimato remo pa luloc me lobo, remo nyogi romi ki pa lutino romi, ki pa dyegi ki pa twoni, ma gin ducu lim makwo me Bacan ma gucwe. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />Ka aneko jo magi macalo lee me gitum, ci winyo kacel ki lee gibicamo kit moo ducu ma giromo nongone, dok bene gibimato remo nio wang ma omerogi woko. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Ci gibicamo gin ducu ma ginongo iwi mejana ma giromo camone, ki aguragura ki jo ma gingweco kwedgi, wa ringo kom acikari ki pa oteka lweny.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bidwoko gum bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />Rwot Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Abinyutu deyona ikin lurok wek gunen, dok bene abinyutu botgi kit macalo atiyo ki twerona me ngolo kop atir, ma nongo aketo cinga me pwod ikomgi. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Cake inino meno cito kwede anyim, jo Icrael gibingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Lurok dong gibingeyo ni jo Icrael yam kiterogi i opii pi balgi, pien onongo gutimo bal maracu atika ikoma, ma omiyo aloko ngeya woko botgi ci amiyo lukworgi gumakogi ka gunekogi woko bene ducu ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Ci atimogi muporo balgi ki rocgi ma gutimo, ci nongo aloke woko ki botgi.”<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco ni, “Pimeno kombedi, kica bimaka ikom likwayo pa Yakobo, ma gin aye jo Icrael, ci abidwoko gumgi botgi. Ci abibedo ki nyeko kun agwoko nyinga malengi. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />Ci wigi biwil woko ikom lewic mayam gibedo kwede, pi bal me tim roro ma gubedo ka timone ikoma, ka dong gibibedo i lobogi mot ma ngat mo pe bimiyo gibedo ki lworo. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />Abikwanyogi ki iwi lobo ducu kama lukworgi gibedo iye ci adwokogi cen, kun anyutu bot rok mapol ni an aleng. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Man bimiyo jona gingeyo ni an aye a Rwot Lubangagi, pien yam amiyo kiterogi i opii ikin lurok, ka dok acokogi adwokogi cen i lobogi kikome. Pe dong kibibwoto dano mo ikin gi dong ikin lurok wacel. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />Pe dong abiloke woko ki botgi doki, ka dong atyeko onyo Cwiny mera ikomgi gin jo Icrael.” Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="ms">Ginanyuta ma okemo Ot pa Lubanga ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="EZK 40:1-48:35">40:1—48:35</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitero Ejekiel i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />Inino dwe apar i acaki me mwaka manyen, inge mwaka pyere aryo wiye abic ma dong warii kwede i opii, i mwaka me apar wiye angwen ma onongo taun madit me Jerucalem dong kituru woko, inino meno kikome teko pa Rwot obino ikoma, <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:10">Niy 21:10</ref></char></note>ci otinga woko i ginanyutane, okela i lobo Icrael, ka ociba piny iwi got mabor. Ci aneno lwak gedo mapol inyima ma ginen calo taun madit ma akeme kwede. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:1">Niy 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:15">21:15</ref></char></note>Ikare ma dong en okela kunu, ci aneno dano mo manen calo mola, omako tol tworo ki lagada i cinge me pimo piny; en danonu onongo ocung i dog gang. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Ci danonu owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, nen piny maber, dok iwiny lok ki iti, ci iket cwinyi me tamo pi gin ducu ma abinyuti, pien kikeli kany ki tyen lok ni myero anyuti gin meno ducu; ci in dong ituc gin ducu ma inenogini bot jo Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dog gang matye tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:5—42:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Luk 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-9">2 Tek 3:1-9</ref></char>
    </note>Gin ma anenoni aye Ot pa Lubanga, ma kirumu woko litit ki cel. Ci laconu dok okwanyo odoo lagadane me pimo piny ma bore romo puti apar, ci opimo cel. Onongo ni bore me dok malo romo puti apar, ki lace nyo dit me kome bene romo puti apar. <verse eid="EZK 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />Lacen en oa ocito i dog gang matye yo tung kunyango. Ka oito rwom ocito kwede malo, ci opimo dogola ki pinye i ngom, ci oromo puti apar. <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />Ki ingeye onongo tye yoo ma kikato kwede, onongo tye iye kicika pa lukurpiny maromo adek ingete acel acel. Kicika acel acel bore onongo tye puti apar ki lace bene puti apar, ki cel ma onongo tye ikin gi, lacgi nyo dit komgi onongo romo puti aboro. I nge kicika pa lukurpiny onongo tye iye yoo me wot ma bore romo puti apar, yone onongo cito donyo i kicika madit ma okemo Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />Lacen opimo kicika meno ma okemo Ot pa Lubangani, ci onongo lace romo puti apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" />Cel ma inget dog gang tungi ki tungi onongo romo puti adek, kicika me donyo iye onongo tye cok ki Ot pa Lubanga kikome. <verse eid="EZK 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />Onongo tye kicika adek tungi ki tungi i dogola matye yo tung kunyango; gin kicika adek meno ducu onongo ditogi romrom, ki cel ma ikin kicika bene onongo ditogi romrom. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Ka dok opimo lac me dog gang ma kidonyo kwedeni, ci oromo puti pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki dong kama twolo i dog gang onongo tye puti apar wiye abicel. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Dong ki inyim kicika pa lukurpiny acel acel onongo tye cel macek ma bore romo incic pyere aryo, ki dit me kome bene onongo romo incic pyere aryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Dok opimo lac me dog gang cake ki i kor ot me kicika acel o kwede wa i kor ot me kicika mukene ma okeme ki lawote, ci oromo puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />Danonu dok opimo kicika me donyo ma kikato kwede idyekal mukene, ci onongo oromo puti pyere adek wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Ci dong bor pa yoo ducu cake ki woko me o i dog gange cito kwede atir wa i kicika me agiki onongo romo puti pyere aboro. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Onongo bene wang dirica madinge tye i kicika acel acel ki i cel ma onongo tye ikin gi. Kicika ma i dogola me donyo bene dirica onongo orumu woko ducu litik. Cel ma ikin kicika bene onongo kigoro iye cal yadi otit.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyekal ma tung ku woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />Lacen danonu okwanya okela idyekal matye tung ku woko. Onongo tye iye kunu kicika pyere adek ma orumu dyekal woko; ki inyimgi tye kama kipeto ki gweng maber. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Kama kicano iye gwengi onongo omede orumu dyekal woko. Man onongo bore rom ki bor pa dog gang; en aye dyekal ma woko matye kupiny ma kipeto iye gweng.<verse eid="EZK 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Ka dok opimo bor piny me dyekal matye tung ku iye ki inyim dog gang ma kupiny, me dok kwede inge dyekal ma i iye, ci bore oromo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doggang matye tung Kumalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Ci lacen danonu otelo nyima ocito kweda tung kumalo, ci nen, onongo tye kunu doggang ma okemo tung kumalo, ma en aye doggang me dyekal ma woko. Ci en opimo bore ki lace. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Ci onongo tye iye kicika adek tungi ki tungi, ki cel ma ikin gi, ki kicika me donyo ma kikato kwede idyekal mukene, gin ducu ditogi romrom ki dito pa mukene ca matye idoggang ma tung kunyango ca. Bor me doggang onongo romo puti pyere aboro ki lace onongo romo puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Kicika madit, wang dirica, ki cal yadi otit ma gigorogi ikom kicika onongo girom ki mukene me dog gang ma okemo tung kunyangoni. Kany bene onongo tye iye rwom abiro ma kicito kwede i doggang ki kicika me donyo onongo tye ki tung i iye. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Dogcel ma donyo idyekal ma i iye onongo okemo dogcel matye tung kumalo kit macalo tye kwede tung kunyango. Ci opimo nia ki i dogcel mukene o kwede wa ikom dogcel matye tungcel, oromo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dogcel matye tung kupiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Ka dok danonu otela otera wa tung kupiny; ka wao kunu ci waneno dogcel mukene. Ci opimo cel ma inget doggang ki tungi, ki kicika me donyo; ci onongo ditogi rom ki mukenegu. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Kidok onongo tye wang dirica i dogcel man ki i kicika me dogola me donyo, ma girom ki wang dirica mukenegu. Ci bore onongo romo puti pyere aboro, ki lace puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Ki bene onongo tye kunu rwom abiro ma kicito kwede i doggang meno, ki kicika me dogola me donyo onongo tye ki tung i iye. Ci onongo bene kigoro cal otit i cel ma inget dogolane; acel tye tungcel ki mukene tye tungcel. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Dok bene onongo tye dogcel mo tung kupiny idyekal ma i iye. Danonu opimo bor piny matye ikin dogcel aryonu ma okemo tung kupiny, ci bore oromo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyekal ma i iye: Dogcel matye tung Kupiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Lacen danonu okela idyekal ma i iye kun wadonyo ki i dogcel matye tung kupiny. Ci opimo dogcel ma tung kupiny, ci onongo ni dite rom ki dito pa dogcel mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Kicika ma ingetegu, ki cel ma inget dogolane, ki kicika ma dogola me donyo onongo ditogi romrom ki dito pa kicika mukenegu. Kidok bene onongo tye wang dirica mapol ma orumu ki tung i iye ki i kicika me dogola me donyo; ma bore onongo romo puti pyere aboro, ki lace onongo romo puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />Dok bene kunu onongo tye iye dogola mapol me donyo ma kirumu woko; borgi onongo romo puti pyere angwen ki lacgi onongo romo puti aboro. <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Kicika ma i dogola me donyo onongo okemo dyekal ma woko, ki cal yadi otit onongo gitye ikom cel ma inget dogolane, ki yoone me ito onongo tye ki rwom aboro.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyekal ma i iye: Dogcel matye tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Ka dok okela idyekal ma i iye kun wawok ki i dogcel matye tung kunyango. Ci en opimo dogcel, ci onongo ni dite rom ki mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Kicika ma ingetegu, ki cel ma inget dogolane, ki kicika ma i dogola me donyo onongo ducu rom ki mukenegu. Kidok onongo tye wang dirica mapol ma orumu woko ki tung i iye, ki kicikane ma i dogola me donyo bore onongo romo puti pyere aboro, ki lace onongo romo puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Kicika ma i dogola me donyone onongo okemo tung dyekal ma woko. Ki bene onongo cal yadi otit ma kigorogi ikom cel ma nget dogolane ducu, acel tye tungcel ki mukene tungcel ki yoone me ito malo onongo tye ki rwom aboro.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyekal ma i iye: Dogcel matye tung kumalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Dok okela i dogcel matye tung kumalo, ci opimo, onongo dite obedo rom ki dito pa mukenegu. <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />Kicika ma ngetegu, ki cel ma inget dogolane ki kicika ma i dogola me donyo onongo ditogi ducu rom ki dito pa mukenegu ducu, onongo bene tye iye wang dirica mapol ma orumu woko dyere. Bore onongo romo puti pyere angwen. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Kicika ma i dogola me donyo onongo okemo tung dyekal ma woko. Onongo cal yadi otit tye ma kigoro ikom cel ma inget dogolane ducu, acel tye tungcel, ki mukene tye tungcel ki yoone ma ito kwede malo onongo tye ki rwom aboro.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedo mapatpat matye cok ki dogcel matye tung kumalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />I dyekal ma woko onongo tye iye kicika mo ki dogolane ma okube ki kicika me dogola me donyoneni, kama onongo kilwoko iye ringo lee ma kityero me gitum awanga. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />Onongo tye meja angwen i kicika me dogola me donyo, aryo tye tungcel ki aryo mukene kicibo tungcel, ma lee me gitum awanga ki gitum me bal ki gitum me tingo alii onongo kingologi iwi meja magi. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Dong tung inge kicika me dogola me donyo kama kidonyo iye i dogcel matye tung kumalo, onongo tye iye meja aryo; ki dok inget kicika ma i dogola me donyo onongo bene tye iye meja aryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Pimeno i i kicika onongo tye iye meja angwen, ki tung wokone bene onongo tye iye meja angwen, magi ducu dong ribe doko meja aboro, ma lee ma kityero me gitum awanga ducu kingologi iwigi. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Dok bene onongo tye meja angwen me got ma kipayo apaya ma kitiyo kwedgi pi yubu lee me gitum awanga, ki bene onongo borgi romo incic pyere aryo ki lac wigi onongo romo incic pyere adek itwoke acel acel ducu. Dong jami tic ma kitiyo kwedgi me ngolo lee me gitum awanga onongo kiketo iwigi. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Goli ducu mabocogi rom ki lac cing, onongo kigurugi gurumu i kicika woko ducu. Ringo ma kimito tyerone me gitum kong kiketo iwi meja magi.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Ka dok okwanya ki idyekal ma woko okela idyekal ma i iye, ci aneno onongo tye kunu kicika aryo; acel onongo tye inget dogcel matye tung kumalo, kun okemo tung kupiny, ki acel onongo tye tung dogcel matye tung kupiny, ki mukene okemo tung kumalo. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Ci danonu otita ni kicika ma okemo tung kupinyi meno pa ajwaki ma giloyo tic i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />Ento kicika ma okemo tung kumaloni meno pa ajwaki ma giloyo tic ikom keno tyer. Ajwaki magi ducu gin Lulevi ma gin aye likwayo pa Jadok; ma gin keken ki ikin likwayo pa Levi aye giyegi me cito inyim Rwot katic bote.<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyekal ma i iye ki Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Ci danonu opimo dyekal ma i iye, bore onongo romo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel ki itwoke acel acel. Keno tyer onongo tye inyim Ot pa Lubanga kikome. <verse eid="EZK 40:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Lacen otera i i kicika matye i dogola ma kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Lubanga. Ci opimo dogola me donyo; bore obedo puti aboro ki lace puti pyere aryo wiye adek, ki dit me kom cel onongo romo puti abic ryoryo ducu. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Bor pa kicika ma i dogola me donyo, ki lace, onongo romo puti apar wiye abongwen, onongo bene tye rwom apar me ito malo iye. Dok bene onongo wir tye kunu inget dogola me donyo tungi ki tungi.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Lacen dok danonu okela i kicika ma idyere. Ci opimo yoo ma kikato ki iye onongo bore romo puti apar, <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />ki lace onongo puti apar wiye abicel, ki dit me kom cel onongo romo puti aboro tung ryoryo ducu. Ka dok opimo kicika onongo bore romo puti pyere abicel wiye angwen, ki lace romo puti pyere adek wiye aryo.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Lacen danonu odonyo i kicika me agikine. Ci opimo dogola me donyo, bore puti adek ki lace puti apar, ki dit kom kicika tung ryoryo ducu onongo romo puti apar wiye acel. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />Ka opimo kicika bore oromo puti pyere adek wiye aryo ki lace puti pyere adek wiye aryo. Ka lacen owaca ni, “Man aye Kabedo Maleng makato ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicika kigerogi ikom cel me Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />Danonu opimo cel me Ot pa Lubanga ci dite oromo puti apar. Dong ikom cel man ma orumu Ot pa Lubanga woko ducu ni, onongo tye iye kicika matinotino, ma lacgi onongo romo puti abicel. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Kicika ma ingete onongo tye i dul adek ma gukube gudok malo, ma acel acel onongo odode iwi wadi kun dul odi acel acel tye ki kicika pyere adek. Ci onongo bene tye gin me latyel kor kicika ducu ma orumu cel me Ot pa Lubanga woko me teno kicika ducu, wek pe gutene ikom cel me Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Dong kicika ma ingetegu gudoko malac kun gutinge woko wa malo likung iwi odi wadigi ki dul odi acel acel, ma guporo lac pa gin latyel kor kicika ma a ikom dul ot acel o kwede ikom dul ot mukene ma gurumu Ot pa Lubanga. Ci onongo bene tye yoo ma kiito kwede malo inget Ot pa Lubanga, kitmeno dano twero a ki i dul odi ma pinye dok kwede malo i dul odi matye i wiye me agiki, kun kato ki dul odi matye idyere. <verse eid="EZK 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />Ci aneno kabedo murumu Ot pa Lubanga bene otinge malo i kabedo ducu. Ci kipimo te guti ma ingete ducu ci kinongo ni bore oromo bor pa lagada acel marom ki puti apar. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Dong dit me kom cel ma woko me kicika ma ingete ducu oromo puti aboro; ki dul abam ma kibwoto tye nono onongo romo puti aboro bene. Dok me a ki ikin abam me Ot pa Lubanga <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />o kwede i kicika me dyekal ma gurumu Ot pa Lubanga woko litik, onongo lace romo puti pyere adek wiye aryo. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />Dogola me kicika ma ingetegu ducu gukemo abam ma onongo kibwoto tye nononi. Dogola acel okemo yo tung kumalo, ki dogola mukene okemo tung kupiny, dong lac pa dul ma kibwoto odong nononi onongo romo puti aboro ma orumu ot woko ducu.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedo matye tung kupotoceng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Ot mo ma onongo okeme ki Ot pa Lubanga ki tung kupotoceng onongo lace romo puti miya acel ki apar wiye aryo, ki cel ma orumu onongo dite romo puti aboro; ki bore onongo romo puti miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye angwen.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit pim ducu ma kipimo ki Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Lacen danonu dok opimo Ot pa Lubanga, bore obedo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel. Dok opimo pinye ki tung inge Ot pa Lubanga dok kwede ariari tung idyekal, medo ki gedo ki cele, bore oromo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Nyim Ot pa Lubanga ma okemo tung kunyango ki dyekale, onongo romo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZK 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Ka dok opimo bor pa gedo ma onongo okeme ki dyekal ma onongo tye tung kupotocengi, ki cele ducu ryoryo, oromo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="EZK 41:15">Lok mukene ducu mamako Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Kicika madite ma kidonyo kwede i Ot pa Lubanga, ki kicika ma i iye, ki kicika ma i dogola me donyo matye tung woko, <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" />onongo kipetogi woko maber ki bao ma oumu kor ot woko ducu; gin adeki ducu onongo gitye ki wang dirica mapol mading. Ki malo ka wi dye ot i dogola me Ot pa Lubanga onongo kiguro kome ducu kirumu ki bao, cake ki idye ot ma dok piny o kwede malo wa i wang dirica (wang dirica onongo kiumugi woko) <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />nio wa i kabedo matye malo ka wi dogola, wa i kicika ma i iye ki tung woko bene. Ci dong ki ikom cel murumu woko ducu ki i kicika ma i iye ki kicika madite, onongo kigoro cal lukerubi ki cal yadi otit.<verse eid="EZK 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" />Ci kiketo cal yat otit ikin lukerubi ma gigwenye agwenya. Lakerubi acel acel onongo tye ki tur nyime aryo, <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />tur nyim manen calo tur nyim dano onongo okemo otit ki tungcel, ki tungcel bene tur nyim manen calo tur nyim labwor okemo otit, ma kigorogi kirumu kwede Ot pa Lubanga woko litit; <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />cake ki idye ot odok piny o kwede malo ka wi dogola gigoro iye cal lukerubi ki cal otit i kor ot.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keno tyer ma kitiyo ki bao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Bao me dogola ducu obedo latwoke angwen: ki inyim Kabedo Maleng onongo tye iye gin mo <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />ma obedo calo keno tyer ma kitiyo ki bao. Onongo bore romo puti abic ki lace puti adek. Twoke ducu, ki tedi tere ki murumu ducu onongo kitiyo ki bao. Lacen danonu owaca ni, “Man aye meja ma kicibo cung inyim Rwot.”<verse eid="EZK 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ikom dogola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Ci onongo tye dogola laiye aryo i agiki me yoo ma donyo i kicika maditi, dok bene onongo tye dogola laiye aryo i agiki yoo ma cito i Kabedo Maleng makato ducuni. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Kun dogola acel acel onongo kiyubu laiye aryo ma giwire giyabe idye ot kamaleng. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Dok ikom dogola me kicika madite onongo kigoro iye cal lukerubi ki cal yadi otit, kit macalo onongo kong kigoro i kor ot me kicika ducuni. Ki tung woko onongo tye iye bolo me bao me gengo ceng matye inyim dogola me donyo. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />Dok bene onongo tye wang dirica mading tungcel, ki yadi otit tye tungcel ki tungcel, ikom cel ma inget kicika ma i dogola me donyo.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s1">Odi aryo ma kigerogi cok ki Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Danonu dok otelo nyima ci otera wa idyekal ma i iye matye tung kumaloni, ci dok okela wa i kicika mapol ma onongo gukeme ki dyekal me Ot pa Lubanga ma onongo okeme ki ot matye tung kumaloni. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Ot man ma onongo tye tung kumaloni onongo bore romo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel, ki lace onongo romo puti pyere aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Ki tungcel onongo okemo kabedo ma lace romo puti pyere adek wiye aryo ma inget Ot pa Lubanga, ki tungcel onongo okemo kabedo kama kicano iye gweng me dyekal ma woko. Ot man onongo yam kigero i dul adek ma gukube malo iwi wadi, dul ot acel acel onongo tye ki yoo mukemo yoo wadi ma donyo i odi ma gukube malo i dul adeki. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Inyim kicika magi onongo yoo tye iye me donyo i ot ki tung kuiye kunu, ma lace onongo romo puti apar wiye abicel ki bore puti miya acel ki pyere abicel; ki dogolagi ducu onongo tye tung kumalo. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Kicika mamalo onongo kigero mading, pien kicika ma piny ki ma idyere onongo gumayo kabedo ki piny woko malac. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Pien onongo gitye odi ma gukube malo i dul adek, ci onongo wir bene pe i igi calo wir ma onongo tye idyekal ma wokoni. Ma omiyo kicika mamalo kidiyo woko obedo mading makato kicika ma gucung i ngom ki ma idyeregu. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Onongo bene tye cel ki woko ma opime ki kicika ducu atir, kun okemo tung dyekal ma woko, dong kama okeme ki kicika onongo bore romo puti pyere aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Kicika ma onongo tye ikom dyekal ma woko onongo bocogi romo puti pyere aboro, kun kicika ducu ma gukemo Ot pa Lubanga bocogi onongo romo puti miya acel ki pyere abicel. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Ki tung piny ite kicika magi onongo tye iye dogola me donyo tung kunyango, ka dok onongo dano gidonyo i igi ki tung idyekal ma woko, <verse eid="EZK 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />kama cel matye tung woko ocake ki iye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 42:10">Onongo tye kicika mogo bene tung kupiny ma gukeme ki dyekal dok gukeme bene ki ot maditi, <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />ci yoo onongo bene tye inyimgi. Onongo giromrom ki me kicika ma gitye tung kumalo, ma bocogi ki lacgi bene rom, ki kit ma kigerogi kwede bene rom, ki wa dogolagu ducu girom. <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />Kidok onongo bene tye dogola me donyo tung kunyango ki piny ite kicika ma gitye tung kupiny, kama dano donyo ki iye tuc i yoo, ki i dog cel ma opoko kin gi onongo okeme kwedgi.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Danonu dok owaca ni, “Kicika magi ducu matye tung kumalo ki kicika ma gitye tung kupiny ma gukeme ki dyekalgi aye kicika maleng. I kicika magi en aye ajwaki ma gidonyo katic inyim Rwot gicamo iye gityer maleng makato ducu. Kunu aye kiketo iye gityer maleng makato ducu, gityer me moko kwon, gitum pi bal, ki gitum pi tingo alii, pien kabedo meno aye kabedo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Ka inen dong ajwaki gudonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, pe gibia gikato woko ki iye gicito idyekal ma woko labongo weko bongigi ma giruku ka gitye katic kunu, pien bongi magi gileng. Gibiruku bongi mukene ma pud peya nongo gucito cok ki kabedo kama lwak gucoke iye.”<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kipimo kwede kabedo murumu Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Lacen ka dong danonu otyeko pimo kabedo matye tung i iye murumu Ot pa Lubanga, ci otelo nyima otera wadonyo ki i dogcel ma okemo tung kunyango, ci ocako pimo kabedo ma orumu Ot pa Lubanga ki woko. <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" />Ci opimo kabedo matye tung kunyango ki lagada me pimo piny, ci opimo ki lagada meno oromo puti miya aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />Ka dok oloke ci opimo kabedo matye tung kumalo, opimo ki lagada me pimo piny oromo puti miya aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Ka dok oloke opimo kabedo matye tung kupiny, opimo ki lagada me pimo piny ci oromo puti miya aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />Lacen en dok oloke yo tung kupotoceng ci opimo ki lagada lapim piny, ci oromo puti miya aboro. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />Ci dok opimo twoke angwen ducu. Onongo bene tye cel murumu woko litit, ma bore romo puti miya aboro ki lace bene puti miya aboro, wek opok kin kabedo maleng ki kabedo me nino ducu.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Lubanga odwogo i Ode ki deyone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Lacen dok danonu okela wa i dogcel ma okemo yo tung kunyango. <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 10:3-4">Eje 10:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:18-19">10:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:22-23">11:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:15">Niy 1:15</ref></char></note>Nen, deyo pa Lubanga pa Icrael oa ki yo tung kunyango, kun mor calo mor pa pii ma core; ci omiyo lobo obedo karyeny aryenya ki deyone. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />Dong ginanyuta ma aneno obedo rom ki ginanyuta mayam con aneno ma onongo Rwot obino kajwero taun madit me Jerucalem wokoni, dok bene obedo calo ginanyuta mayam aneno inget kulu Kebarni. Ci cutcut apoto aryebe woko piny. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />Deyo pa Rwot okato ki i dogcel matye yo tung kunyango ci odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="EZK 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot dok otinga woko malo, okela wa idyekal me Ot pa Lubanga ma i iye; ci aneno deyo pa Rwot opongo i Ot pa Lubanga woko. <verse eid="EZK 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />Ikare ma onongo danonu pud ocung kangeta, ci awinyo ngat mo tye kalok kweda ki i Ot pa Lubanga, <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />kun waca ni, “Wod pa dano, man aye kabedo kama komkera bedo iye, dok bene en aye kabedo kama ateno iye tyena; en aye kama abibedo iye ikin jo Icrael matwal. Dong jo Icrael, nyo lukergi, pe dok gibimede ki balo nyinga malengi, kun giworo iye lubanga mukenegu nyo gibicibo iye gin me nipo pi lukergi mogo ma dong guto woko ci kiyikogi iye. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Lukergi yam guyubu dogolagi okeme ki dogolana ki dok bene guketo yat dogolagi okeme ki mera, man omiyo dong tye cel acel keken ma opoko kinwa kwedgi. Oweko gubalo nyinga malengi ki gin me kwergu ducu mayam gutimo, ci omiyo kiniga omaka atyekogi woko liweng. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Kombedi dong myero gukwany cal lubangagigu gubol woko, ki gin me po ikom lukergi mayam dong guto wokogu, ci gubol woko kamabor ki kangeta, ci an abibedo i dyegi matwal.”<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />Ci Rwot dok omede ki loke kun waca ni, “Wod pa dano, tit kit yub me Ot pa Lubanga bot jo Icrael, ki tit botgi bene kit ma onongo nen kwede, ki kit ma yub pa Rwot tye kwede pire, wek omii lewic omakgi pi balgi. <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" />Ka dong ineno lewic omakogi pi bal ducu mayam gutiyo, ci dong itit botgi yub ma onongo kigero ki Ot pa Lubangani, ki kit ma kigero kwede dogolane me donyo ki dogcel kama kikato ki iye ki kama kidonyo ki iye, ki kit ma gedo me Ot pa Lubanga ducu ocung kwede. Dok bene imii gunge kit me lubu cike ducu, ki gin ma Rwot bene ociko ducu; ci icoogi woko piny ki inyimgi ma gin bene gineno, wek omii gin gugwok dok guti gin ma giciko ducu kun gilubu cike ducu. <verse eid="EZK 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />Man aye cik me Ot pa Lubanga: kabedo ducu murumu matye iwi got bibedo kabedo maleng makato ducu. Man aye cik me Ot pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keno tyer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Nia 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2 Tek 4:1</ref></char>
    </note>Magi aye kit pim ma kipimo kwede keno tyer, kun kitiyo ki gin me pimo piny marom ki kit macalo kipimo kwede Ot pa Lubangani, ki kama orumu te tedi me keno tyer onongo tye ducu romo puti acel ki incic aboro, ki lace bene puti acel ki incic aboro, ki rii matye ka wiye bore romo incic apar. Meno aye bor me keno tyer tung malo. <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />Dul kom keno tyer ma pinye makato ducu onongo bore romo puti adek. Dul mukene ma lubu onongo kiketo ocung cen manok tungi ki tungi ci oromo puti acel ki incic aboro, ki bore onongo romo puti abiro. Ki dul mukene matye iwi meno ma kiketo ocung wa cen manok tungi ki tungi oromo puti acel ki incic aboro. <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />Meno aye wi keno tyer kama kiwango iye gitum awanga; kun bore onongo bene romo puti abiro. Ten keno angwengu ducu onongo giboco gikato wi keno tyer mukenegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Wi keno tyer onongo tye latwoke angwen maromrom, ma twoke acel acel onongo romo puti pyere aryo. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />Ki dul ma idyere bene onongo obedo latwoke angwen, maromrom, ma acel acel onongo romo puti pyere aryo wiye adek; ki rii ma giketo orumu ducu bore onongo romo incic apar. Tedi tere onongo lace ducu romo puti acel ki incic aboro. Kidok rwom me cito malo ikom keno tyer onongo tye yo tung kunyango.<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero keno tyer wek obed maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dok awaca kuman ni, “Wod pa dano, magi gin aye cik me keno tyer: ka dong kityeko gerone me tyero lee me gitum awanga iwiye ki pi coro remo ikome, <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />ci ibimiyo twon me gitum pi bal bot ajwaki ma gin Lulevi ma gin jo me dog ot pa Jadok, ma gibibino cok kweda katic bota. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />Ci ibikwanyo remo mogo ki ikom remo pa twon ca, ci iket iteng keno tyer angwengu ki ikom twok doge angwen, ka dok ikom rii ma kiketo orumu wokoni. Meno aye kit macalo ibilonyo kwede keno tyer wek obed maleng, ci ibimiyo bedo labongo bal mo ikome. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />Dok bene ibikwanyo twon me gitum pi bal, ci kibiwangone woko i kabedo ma kiyero ma inget Ot pa Lubanga, ki tung woko me kabedo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />Ka dok ikom nino me aryone ibityero nyok dyel ma kome pe kimwonyo me gitum pi bal, ci kibilonyo keno tyer bene kitmeno macalo kikwongo lonyo ki twoni. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" />Ka dong ityeko lonyone, ci dong ibityero twon ma kome pe kimwonyo ki nyok romo ma kikwanyo ki ikin lwak romi ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" />Ibityero bot Rwot, ki ajwaki gibikiro kado ikomgi ka dong gicako tyerogi bot Rwot macalo gitum awanga. <verse eid="EZK 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />Dok ibimiyo dyel pi nino abiro me gitum pi bal, kun inino acel acel nongo imiyo dyel acel. Dok bene kibimiyo twon ki nyok romo ma gikwanyo ki ikin lwak romi ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Ci gibityero gitum lakwany bal pi keno tyer pi nino abironu kun gilonyo obed leng, dok kikwero bene. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:35-37">Nia 29:35-37</ref></char></note>Ka dong gutyeko nino magi abiro, ci dong cake inino me aborone cito kwede anyim, ajwaki gibityero gitum awangawu ki gityer lakwecwiny ikom keno tyer, ci an abigamowu. An Rwot Lubanga dong atyeko loko man.”<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s1">Tic ma kitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Lacen danonu dok odwoka cen i dogcel ma woko me kabedo maleng, ma onongo tye yo tung kunyango; ento onongo kiloro woko. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" />Ci owaco bota ni, “Dogcel man bibedo alora kare ducu, ma pe kibiyabo, dok bene ngat mo pe dong bidonyo ki iye; pien Rwot, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, dong otyeko donyo ki iye. Pimeno bibedo alora kare ducu. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Laker matye kaloc keken aye gwok bibedo iye kunu kacamo kwon inyim Rwot; en bidonyo ki i yoo ma wok ki i kicika ma i dogola me donyo, dok bene bikato ci cito woko ki i yoo acelu.”<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma ye dano me donyo i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Ci danonu dok okela kun wok kweda ki i dogcel matye tung kumalo wa inyim Ot pa Lubanga. Ka aneno piny ci aneno ni deyo pa Rwot opongo Ot pa Lubanga woko. Cutcut apoto aryebe woko piny, <verse eid="EZK 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />ci Rwot owaca ni, “Wod pa dano, ket cwinyi me niang maber ikom gin ducu ma ineno ki ma iwinyo ki iti. Abititi cik ducu me Ot pa Lubanga ki ikom gin ducu ma myero dano guti dok gulubi. Dok iket cwinyi me niang maber ikom kit dano ma kiyegi me donyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ki jo ducu ma pe kiyegi me donyo i kabedo maleng.<verse eid="EZK 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />Ci dong iwac lok man bot jo Icrael ma gin jo ma lujemoni ni, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni; gin jo Icrael myero dong gugik kit tim me kwergigu woko ducu liweng. <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Gupyedo oda pi ye lurok ma pe kilirogi i cwinygi ki ikomgi me bedo i kabedona maleng, ikare ma dong kityero bota cam ma mega, moo dwolo ki remo me gitum. Pimeno jona dong gutyeko turu gicikena woko ken gi, medo ikom gin me kwergu ducu mayam gutimo. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Pe bene gubedo kagwoko kit ma kitiyo kwede ki jamina malenggu ducu; ento guketo lurok aye me tic i kabedona maleng.<verse eid="EZK 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Ma omiyo an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni: pe tye larok mo ma pe kiliro i cwinye ki ikome ma bidonyo i kabedona maleng, kadi bed larok mo ma ikin lurok ducu ma gibedo ikin jo Icrael.<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />Ento Lulevi mayam gua woko ki bota gucito woko kamabor, ma gungak gubwota woko calo jo Icrael mayam gungak woko gubedo kaworo jogi, kombedi dong atye kamiyo pwod ikomgi malube ki weko winyo lok mera ma gutiyo. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />Gin gibibedo lutica i kabedona maleng, kun gigwoko dogcel me Ot pa Lubanga, kun gitiyo bene tic i Ot pa Lubanga. Gin aye ma gibineko lee ma dano gikelo me atyera me gitum awanga ki gitum pi lwak, dok bene gibibedo i dog ticgi kun gitiyo bot lwak. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" />Ento kit macalo gubedo katelo, jona jo Icrael kaworo cal jogi ma kipayo apaya ma en aye gin ma omiyo jo Icrael gupoto i bal, pimeno an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong akwongo kwong ma okemogi ni abipwodogi pi kwero winyo lok mera. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Pe dong gibibedo katic bota macalo ajwaki, dok bene pe gibinyiko cok ikom jamina malenggu ki ikom jamina maleng makato ducugu. Ento lewic bimakogi pi gin me kwer ducu mayam gutimogu. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Kadi bed kumeno pud abiyerogi aketogi me tic i Ot pa Lubanga, kun gitiyo kwayi tice ducu ki kwayi tic ducu ma mite ma myero giti iye.”<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dok owaco ni, “Ajwaki ma gin Lulevi, ma gin likwayo pa Jadok, ma gubedo katiyo tic i kabedona maleng ikare ma jo Icrael gungak gubwota woko, gin aye gibibino cok bota katic bota. Gin aye dong gibitiyo bota kun gityero bota moo dwolo ki remo. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Gin aye gibidonyo i kabedona maleng, kun bene ginyiko cok ki mejana, pi tiyo tic bota, ki pi lubu gin ma an aciko ducu. <verse eid="EZK 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:39-43">Nia 28:39-43</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:4">Lev 16:4</ref></char></note>Ka gudonyo i dogcel me dyekal ma woko, ci gibiruku bongi camanini. Pe gibibedo ki ginaruka mo me yer romo ikomgi ikare ma nongo gitye katic i dogcel me dyekal ma i iye, ki bene i Ot pa Lubanga kikome. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Ci gibiboyo wigi ki kitambara me bongo camanini, dok bene gibiruku pali bongo camanini i pyergi; pe gitweyo nyo giruku gin mo mamiyo kwok makogi. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:23">Lev 16:23</ref></char></note>Ka inen gikato gicito woko bot lwak idyekal ma woko, ci gibilunyu bongi ma gubedo katic kwedgini woko ki ikomgi, ci giketo bedo i kicika malengi. Dong gibiruku bongi mukene, wek pe gunyob lwak ki bongigi malenggu. <verse eid="EZK 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:5">Lev 21:5</ref></char></note>Ajwaki pe gibilyelo wigi woko dong maleng, dok bene pe gibiweko yer wigi lot maboco; ento gibinyaro yer wigi woko anyara keken. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:9">Lev 10:9</ref></char></note>Ajwaka mo pe bimato kongo bwino kacito kadonyo idyekal ma i iye ma i ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:7">Lev 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 21:13-14">21:13-14</ref></char></note>Ajwaki pe gibinyomo dato mo, nyo dako ma cware oryemo woko, ento gibinyomo nyako ma pe ongeyo laco i dog Ot pa jo Icrael kikome, dok bene gitwero nyomo dato mo ma onongo yam kong cware obedo ajwaka.<verse eid="EZK 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 10:10">Lev 10:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci gibipwonyo jona me ngeyo apokapoka matye ikin jami maleng ki jami me nino ducugu, kun ginyutu botgi bene kit ma myero gupok kwede ikin gin ma keni ki gin ma pe keni. <verse eid="EZK 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />Kace lok daa nyo pido mo tye, ci gin ajwaki gibibedo lungolkop, ci gibingolo kop kun gilubu kit ma an angolo kwede kop. Gibigwoko cika ki gin ma an aciko ducu, pi kwero nino madito ma giciko ducu, ci dok bene gibigwoko ceng Cabita ducu bedo nino maleng.<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 21:1-4">Lev 21:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dong ajwaki pe bibalo komgi keken gi pi cito cok ki kom dano ma oto; gwok nyo kono gitwero balo komgi kace kom dano mo ma otoni obedo wegigi nyo megigi, kom latin awobigi nyo nyako ma meggi, kom omegigi nyo kom lumegigi ma pe kinyomogi. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Lacen ma nongo dong ajwaka mo obalo kome woko kekene, ci en bikwano nino abiro ma myero ebed kwede, ka dong ingeye lonye woko bedo leng. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />Inino ma en cito i kabedo maleng, idyekal ma i iye, katic kunu, ci en ajwaka bityero gitum pi bale. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:20">Wel 18:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dong dul gin me aleya pa ajwaki ki ikom gin ma amiyo bot jo Icrael me aleyagi en aye obedo ticgi me bedo ajwakina. Gin ajwaki pe gibibedo ki kit jami mo i lobo Icrael; ento lonyo ma kimiyo pirgi me agwoka aye an Rwot. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:8-19">Wel 18:8-19</ref></char></note>Ajwaki gibicamo gityer me moko kwon, gitum pi bal, ki gitum me tingo alii; ki gin ducu ma kidyero i cinga i Icrael bibedo meggi. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />Ajwaki myero kimii botgi cam ducu mukwongo cek i poti ki kit kwayi gin mukenegu ducu ma kityero bota. Pi tyen mukwongo ma nongo lwak gitedo mugati omyero kong gukwany mugati ma kikwongo tedone gumii bot ajwaki, wek gum mera obed ikom jo ma i pacogi. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:8">Lev 22:8</ref></char></note>Ajwaki pe gibicamo kit gin mo ma oto kene nyo lee mo ma nguu aye okayo, kadi ka winyo onyo lee tim.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s1">Dul lobo ma kipoko ci kimiyo bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />Kace wupoko lobo kun wumiyo dul ki kaka acel acel, ci dul acel myero kiket cen pat obed gin maleng pa Rwot. Bor pa dul lobo man myero obed mairo apar ki lace mairo aboro. Dong dul lobo meno ducu bibedo kabedo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />Dul lobo mo ma twoke angwen ducu romrom myero kiwek pi Ot pa Lubanga, ma twoke acel acel nongo romo puti miya aboro. Ci kabedo ma kiweko nongo bene bibedo tye murumu kabedo meno woko dyere ma lace romo puti pyere aboro. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />Ikom dul lobo man malengi myero kipim dul mo ma bore romo mairo apar ki lace mairo angwen, kipok wange woko obed pat, ci Ot pa Lubanga bibedo i kabedo man, ma en aye kabedo maleng makato ducu. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Man bibedo dul lobo maleng dok bene bibedo pi ajwaki ma gitiyo i kabedo maleng, kun ginyiko cok bot Rwot me tic bote. Man bene bibedo kabedo kama odigi bibedo iye ki kabedo maleng pi Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Dul mukene ma bore romo mairo apar ki lace mairo angwen, kibiketo ne pat bedo dul pa Lulevi ma gitiyo tic i Ot pa Lubanga. Dul lobo man Lulevi gibicamo bedo meggi matwal, dok bene i kabedo man aye gibigero iye ganggi kama gibibedo iye. <verse eid="EZK 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />Inget dul lobo ma kiketo pat me bedo kabedo malengi, ci omyero kipim kabedo kama kibigero iye gang, ma bore romo mairo apar ki lace mairo aryo. Kabedo man bibedo pa jo Icrael ducu.<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo pi laker matye kaloc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />Myero bene kipim dul lobo kiket pi laker. Cake ikom kabedo murumu kabedo maleng ki ikom gang, lobone bidok kwede tung kupotoceng ki tung kunyango oo iwang apoki matye yo tung kunyango. Cake ki tung kunyango o kwede yo tung potoceng bore bibedo rom ki bor pa dul lobo ma kipoko kimiyo ki kaka me Icraeli. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Meno bibedo dul lobo pa laker i lobo Icrael. Dong lukera ma gin luloc pe dong gibiunu jona matwal; ento gibimiyo jo Icrael gigamo lobo kun lubu kakagi ducu.”<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik pi luloc ma i Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Wun luloc me Icrael dong wutimo bal oromo! Wugik tim bwami ki unu dano woko. Wutim gin matye atir dok kakare. Pe myero dok wuryem jona woko ki i lobogi, an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu aye ma atye kawaco lok man botwu.<verse eid="EZK 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:6">Lev 19:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wun ducu, ngat acel acel myero obed ki ratili maber ma en pimo kwede jami i mijani ki me pimo gin ma pige ikare ni. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Epa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:11 </char><char style="fk">Epa </char> bat, komer ki kor gubedo lapim jami mapatpat pa jo Icrael.</note> ma kipimo ki jami ma otwo bibedo rom ki bat ma kipimo kwede jami ma pige. Bat rom ki acel me apar me komer, ki epa bene rom ki acel me apar me komer; dong komer aye bibedo gin ma dano ducu myero gupim ki jami. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Cekel acel bibedo rom ki gera pyere aryo; cekel abic bibedo cekel abic, ki cekel apar bibedo cekel apar, ka dong mina acel bibedo rom ki cekel pyere abic.<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />Ci man aye gityer ma wubikelo me atyera: acel me abicel me epa ma oa ki ikom komer acel acel me ngano, ki acel me abicel ma oa ki ikom komer acel acel me cayiri. <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />Kit dul ma kimoko me pimo moo tye kuman: acel me apar me bat ma oa ki ikom kor acel acel (kor obedo calo komer, tye iye bat apar). <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />Dok bene wubikwanyo romo acel ki ikin lwak romi miya aryo, kun wukwanyogi ki bongo me dog Ot pa Icrael ducu. Man aye gityer ma kibityero pi gityer me moko kwon, gitum awanga, ki gityer lakwecwiny, pi timo gin me lakwany bal woko ki ikomgi. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Ci lwak ducu me lobo man gibimiyo gityer man bot laker matye i Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Ci dong ngat matye kaloc aye ma bimiyo lee me gitum awanga, gityer me moko kwon, ki gityer amata ikare me kwero nino madito, i Por Dwe, ki nino me Cabit ducu, ki ikare me kwero nino madito ducu ma giciko pi jo Icrael. En laloc meno bimiyo lee me gitum pi bal, ki gityer me moko kwon, ki gitum awanga, ki gityer lakwecwiny, pi timo gin me lakwany bal woko ki ikom jo Icrael.”<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino madito me Kato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Nia 12:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lev 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Inino mukwongo me dwe mukwongo, wubikwanyo latin twon ma kome pe kimwonyo, ci wulonyo kwede kabedo maleng. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Ajwaka bikwanyo remo manok me gitum pi bal ci keto ikom dogola me Ot pa Lubanga; biketo bene i twok keno tyer angwen ni, ki ikom yat me dogcel me dyekal ma i iye. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Ibitimo kitmeno inino me abiro me dwe mukwongo pi dano mo ma otimo bal pi roc mo nyo pi kwiya piny. Ibitimo gin lakwany bal woko pi lonyo Ot pa Lubanga wek obed maleng. <verse eid="EZK 45:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Nia 12:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Wel 28:16-25</ref></char></note>Inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo, en aye wubikwero iye nino me Karama me Kato, kun wubedo kacamo mugati ma tobi pe iye pi nino abiro. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Inino meno laloc bikwanyo latin romo miyo me gitum pi bale ki pi bal pa lwak ducu ma i lobo. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Dok inino acel acel ikom nino abiro me kwero nino me Karama me Kato aye en bimiyo lutino twoni abiro ki nyogi romi abiro ma komgi pe kimwonyo, ci tyero me gitum awanga bot Rwot. En bene bibedo katyero nyok dyel acel acel nino ki nino me gitum pi bal. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />Ci en laloc dok bimiyo gityer me moko kwon maromo agwata adek pi twon acel acel, ki dok agwata adek pi nyok romo acel acel, ki moo maromo cupa apar pi moko kwon maromo agwata adekadek.<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />Inino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro ki bene pi nino abiro ma kibedo kakwero nino madito me Boloni, en pud dok bimede ki miyo gitum pi bal, gitum awanga, ki gityer me moko kwon, ki moo bene ikit yo aceli.”<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s1">Kit ma laloc bikwero ki nino madito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu awaco kuman ni, “Dogcel me dyekal ma i iye matye yo tung kunyango kibiloro woko pi nino abicel, ma en aye kare ma nongo dano gitye katic. Ento kibiyabo inino me Cabit ki inino me Karama me Por Dwe. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Dong laloc bidonyo kun wok ki i kicika ma i dogola me donyo matye yo tung woko, ci bicung cok ki yat me dogcel. Ka dong ajwaki gicako tyero gitum awangane ki gityer lakwecwiny ma en okelo, ci en dong cako woro Lubanga idyekal matye cok ki dogcel. Ka ingeye dong en bia kato woko, ento dogcel meno pe kibiloro nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Lwak me lobo gibibedo kaworo Rwot i kabedo kama kidonyo ki iye matye i dogcel meno inino me Cabit ducu ki inino Karama me Por Dwegu ducu. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Gitum awanga ma laloc bityero bot Rwot inino me Cabit bibedo lutino romi abicel ma komgi pe kimwonyo, ki nyok romo acel ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />En bikelo gityer me moko kwon pi nyok romo maromo epa acel, ki bene gityer me moko kwon pi lutino romi en bikelo kit macalo en twero, kacel ki cupa apar me moo pi agwata adekadek me moko. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Inino me Karama me Por Dwe en bityero latin twon ma kome pe kimwonyo, ki lutino romi abicel ki nyok romo acel, ma gin ducu myero komgi pe obed kimwonyo. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />Gin ma en bityero macalo gityer me moko kwon aye agwata adek pi wod twon, ka dok agwata adek pi nyok romo, ki pi lutino romi moko kwon kit macalo en twero nongone, kacel ki cupa apar me moo pi agwata adekadek me moko. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Ka laloc donyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci en bidonyo kun wok ki i kicika ma i dogola me donyo me dogcel, dok bene en bia kato woko ki i yoo acelu.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />Ka inen lwak me lobo meno gubino kaworo Rwot inino madito ma giciko, ci jo ma gibidonyo ki i dogcel matye yo tung kumalo, ka gutyeko woro Rwot ci gibikato woko ki i dogcel matye yo tung kupiny. Ci jo ma bidonyo ki i dogcel matye yo tung kupiny, gibikato woko ki i dogcel matye yo tung kumalo. Ngat mo pe ma bidok cen ki ngeye ki i dogcel ma kong onongo en odonyo kwedeni, ento dano acel acel bicito atir kato woko ki i dogcel matye inyime. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Ka inen lwak gidonyo kaworo Rwot, ci laloc bene donyo kacel kwedgi, ka gikato woko, ci en bene bikato woko kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="EZK 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />Ikare me kwero nino madito ki kare ma kiciko, gibikelo gityer me moko kwon ki latin twon marom pi epa acel, ki nyok romo marom pi epa acel, ki lutino romi pi moko kwon kit macalo dano moni twero miyone kwede; kacel ki cupa apar me moo pi epa acel acel me moko.<verse eid="EZK 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Kace laker mito miyo gityer ma iye opwoyo, kadi onyo gitum awanga nyo gityer lakwecwiny calo gin ma iye opwoyo bot Rwot, ci gibiyabo bote dogcel matye yo tung kunyangoni, ci en bidonyo ki iye. Ka dong en cako tyero gitum awangane nyo gityer lakwecwiny kit macalo en tyero inino me Cabit. Ci lacen en dong a kato woko, ki ingeye ma en dong nongo okato woko ci kibiloro dogcele woko kakare.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer ma gityero bot Rwot nino ki nino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />Laloc dok bimiyo latin romo acel me mwaka acel makome pe kimwonyo me gitum awanga bot Rwot nino ki nino, i odiko. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Dok bene omyero omii gityer me moko kwon kacel ki gitum awanga i odiko ki odiko, ki acel me abicel me epa, ki moo cupa adek wek okwe moko woko, ma kimiyo calo gityer me moko kwon bot Rwot. Man aye cik ma omyero kilubgi pi gitum awanga ma kityero nino ducu. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Gityer ma kikelo pi gitum awanga me nino ducu odiko ki odiko tye kit man: latin romo ki gityer me moko kwon ki moo.”<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laker ki lobo ma gipoko bote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kace inen laker mito miyo mot bot latine mo ki ikin awobene bene, kun poko ki kom dul lobo mayam kimiyo me bedo ginaleyane, meno bibedo ginaleya pa awobene ducu, meno dong odoko jamigi. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:10">Lev 25:10</ref></char></note>Ento kace en okwanyo dul ma kipoke ci omiyo me mot bot lutice, ci lacen bibedo jami pa laloc ka mwaka me bedo agonya dong oo. Pimeno ginaleyani dong obedo mere, dok lutinone keken aye gitwero gamone bedo meggi matwal. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Laloc pe bikwanyo kit dul mo ki ikom ginaleya pa lwak, pe bikwanyo jamigi woko ki botgi. En omyero omii dul mo bot lutinone me bedo meggi kun kwanyo ki ikom lobo ma dong kimiye me bedo mere, wek pe en oun dano mo ki ikom jona kun kwanyo lobogi woko.”<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jokon matye i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Lacen danonu dok otera wa i dogola kama kidonyo kwede i kicika mapol matye cok ki dogcel matye tung kupiny me dyekal ma i iye. Magi aye kicika maleng ma kiyubu pi ajwaki. Ci en ocimo bota kabedo mo matye wa i agiki me kicika magi matye tung kunyangoni, ci aneno. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />Ci en dok owaca ni, “Man aye kabedo kama ajwaki omyero guted iye gitum me tingo alii ki gitum pi bal, ki kama bene kitedo iye gityer me moko kwon, wek pe guting gin mo maleng ci gukel idyekal ma woko kama gitwero nyobo ki lwak kwede.”<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Lacen en okela idyekal ma woko, ci otela otera itwok dyekal angweni; itwoke acel acel onongo dyekal matidi tye iye. <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />Itwok dyekal angweni onongo tye iye dyekal matinotino, ma acel acel bore romo puti pyere abicel wiye angwen ki lace puti pyere abic, gin angwenni ducu onongo ditogi rom. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Dyekal acel acel onongo kirumu woko ki cel ma kigero ki got, ki keno kama kikutu iye mac bene kiyubu inget cel. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Ci danonu owaca ni, “Magi aye jokon kama lutic ma gitiyo i Ot pa Lubanga omyero guted iye gitum ducu ma lwak gityero.”<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s1">Laora kulu matye kamol a ki i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Jek 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:38">Jon 7:38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Niy 22:1</ref></char>
    </note>Danonu dok otela odwoka cen i dogola kama kidonyo ki iye i Ot pa Lubanga. Ci aneno pii tye kamol kun kati ki ite dogola dok yo tung kunyango (pien Ot pa Lubanga bene onongo tye okemo yo tung kunyango). Ci piine onongo tye kamol bino piny kun a ki piny yo tung kupiny ite dogola me Ot pa Lubanga, kun wok kwede inget keno tyer tung kupiny. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Lacen okela woko kun wok kweda ki i dogcel matye yo tung kumalo, ci owoto kweda orumu cel ki yo tung woko obino kwede i dogcel ma woko ma okemo yo tung kunyango. Laora kulu ni onongo tye kamol kati woko inget dogcel yo tung kupiny. <verse eid="EZK 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Ikare ma wacito wadok yo tung kunyango ci danonu dok omako lagada lapim piny i cinge, ci opimo piny mita miya abic kun lubu i laora yo tung piny dok kwede tung kunyango, ci omiyo akato ki idye pii. Piine onongo tute o wa i odilo tyena. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Ka dok opimo piny mita miya abic, ci omiyo awoto ki i pii ki tyena; piine onongo tute o wa iwangcong. Dok opimo piny mita miya abic, ci omiyo anyono dye pii; piine onongo dong tute o wa i pyera. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Ka dok opimo mita miya abic, ci laora dong odoko kulu mo ma pe dong atwero kato ki idyere, pien pii onongo dong opong omede woko. Kulunu onongo dong tut ma pe kitwero ngolone ki tyen, kono ka kikwang iye akwanga aye romo kate. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Ci en openya ni, “Wod pa dano, dong ityeko neno gin man ducu maber?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Ka dong odwoka cen kun woto kweda ki i dog kulu. <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Ikare ma atye kawot me dok cen kwede, aneno yadi mapol tutwal i dog kulu tungi ki tungi. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Ci en owacca ni, “Pii man tye kamol kemo lobo matye yo tung kunyango ci cito wa i Araba. Ka pii dong oo i pii me nam ma ocung mot liywi ma pe mol, ci pii me nam dong ocako doko leng. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />I kabedo ducu ma kulu man mol cito iye, gin ma core limuk ma gibedo i pii gibibedo kwo, ki rec bene gibedo pol ata. Pii man mol cito kunu wek pii me nam odok leng; dok bene gin makwo ducu gibibedo kwo kama kuluni mol cito iye ducu. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Cake ki i En-gedi dok kwede tung iwang pii En-eglaim, lumakrec bibedo kunu i dog nam, ci gibimoyo obwogi bibedo katwo kunu bene. Kwayi rec ma patpat bibedo kunu calo rec ma gibedo i Nam Mediterranean. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Ento pii matye i kabedo ma obedo dagodago ki i jorogu pe gibidoko leng. Gibiweko piine ducu bedo pii me kado. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:2">Niy 22:2</ref></char></note>Dong i dog kulu ryoryo ducu, yadi ducu ma kitgi patpat bidongo iye kun ginyako nyiggi me acama pa dano. Potgi bene pe bitwo dok bene pe gibigiko nyak. Ci gibibedo kanyak dwe ki dwe, pien gilimo pii ma mol a ki i kabedo malengi. Nyiggi bene bibedo me acama pa dano, ki potgi bibedo yat ma cango two ki ikom dano.”<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wang apoki lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dok awaco kuman ni, “Magi aye wang apoki lobo ma ibilubu ka i poko lobo ikin kaka apar wiye aryo me Icrael me bedo ginaleyagi. Ento jo me kaka pa Yucepu ibipoko botgi dul lobo ma dodo pa jo mukenenigu kiryo. <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" />Yam onongo akwongo kwong kun acike bot kwariwu ni abimiyo lobo man botgi wek gucam odok meggi; pimeno kombedi myero dong ipok i lobo man woko marom ikinwu.<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />Ci wang apoki lobo ne bibedo kit man: tung kumalo wange cake ki i Nam Mediterranean kun wok ki i Ketlon cito kwede i yoo ma donyo i Kamat, o kwede wa i Jedad, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Berota, Cibraim (matye iwang apoki ikin Damaciko ki Kamat), dok mede cito kwede wa yo tung Kajer-atikon; matye iwang apoki me Kauran. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Kitmeno wang apoki lobo matye yo tung kumalo bicake ki i Nam Mediterranean cito kwede tung Kajar-enon, matye iwang apoki me Damaciko, ki wang apoki me Kamat matye yo tung kumalo.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />Ci wang apoki lobo matye yo tung kunyango bicake ki i Kajar-enon ikin Kauran ki Damaciko, ma lubu kulu Jordan ikin Gilead ki lobo Icrael, dok kwede i nam matye yo tung kunyango kun o kwede wa i Tamar.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />Ci wang apoki lobo matye yo tung kupiny bicake ki i Tamar cito wok kwede ki i pii me Meriba-kadec, ka dong lubu laora kulu me Ejipt o kwede wa i Nam Mediterranean.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />Wang apoki lobo matye yo tung kupotoceng bicake i dog Nam Mediterranean cito kwede i kabedo ma okeme ki yoo ma donyo i Kamat. Man aye bibedo wang apoki matye yo tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="EZK 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />Ci ibipoko lobo man woko ikinwu kitmeno kun lubu kit macalo wel kaka pa jo Icrael tye kwede. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />Dok ibipoko lobo man kun ibolo ki gin kwir me ngeyo lobo ma obedo ginaleyawu kikome, ki pi lurok ma gin lubedo ma gibedo ikinwu, ma dong bene gutyeko nywalo lutinogi ikinwu. Kun wubitic kwedgi macalo gin anywali me Icrael kikome, ma gin bene gibibolo kwir kacel kwedwu wek ginong dul lobo mo me bedo ginaleyagi ki ikin kaka pa Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Larok acel acel ma labedo gibimiye dul lobo me bedo ginaleyane, kacel ki lwak me kaka moni ma en bedo ikin gi. An Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu dong atyeko loko.<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s1">Poko lobo ikin kaka pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />Magi aye nying kaka ducu me Icrael: cake ki iwang apoki lobo matye yo tung kumalo, kun a ki i Nam Mediterranean wok ki i taun madit me Ketlon cito kwede i yoo ma donyo i Kamat, nio kwede wa i taun madit me Kajar-enon (matye yo tung kumalo me wang apoki lobo me Damaciko ki yo tung malo ikom Kamat), kun mede kwede a ki tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Dan. <verse eid="EZK 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Dan, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Acer. <verse eid="EZK 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Acer, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Naputali. <verse eid="EZK 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki pa Naputali, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Manace. <verse eid="EZK 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Manace, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Epraim. <verse eid="EZK 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki Epraim, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Reuben. <verse eid="EZK 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Reuben, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Juda.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Juda, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, bibedo dul ma kipoko bedo pat ma lace romo mairo apar ki bore bibedo rom ki bor pa dul lobo ma dong kityeko pokogi bot jo me kaka pa Icraeli, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kun nongo kabedo maleng tye idyere.<verse eid="EZK 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko pi Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />Lobo ma ibipoko bedo pat pi Rwoti bore bibedo mairo apar ki lace bibedo mairo aboro. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Magi aye bibedo kit macalo gipoko kwede dul lobo maleng: ajwaki kibimiyo botgi dul lobo matye yo tung kumalo ma bore romo mairo apar, ki yo tung kupotoceng lace romo mairo angwen, ki yo tung kunyango bene lace romo mairo angwen, ki bore yo tung kupiny romo mairo apar, kun kabedo maleng pa Rwot tye idyere. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Kabedo ducu ma orumu kabedo man malengi bibedo pa ajwaki ma gin likwayo pa Jadok. Gin gutiyo bota ki ada, pe gungak gubwota woko ikare ma jo Icrael gungak woko ca, kit macalo Lulevi gutimo. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Dul lobo man bibedo botgi calo dul lobo ma kipoko ki ikom dul lobo maleng, ma en aye kabedo maleng makato ducu, ma orwate ki lobo pa Lulevi. <verse eid="EZK 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />Dong inget lobo pa ajwaki, kipoko iye dul lobo bot Lulevi, ma bore romo mairo apar ki lace mairo angwen. Bore ka kiribo ducu dong bedo mairo apar ki lace mairo aboro. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />Dul lobo ma kidyero bot Rwoti obedo dul maber makato ducu, pe tye mo ma kitwero cato nyo lokone ki gin mo, dok bene pe kitwero kobone bot larok mo. Pien man dul lobo maleng, ma dong odoko pa Rwot.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />Ento dul lobo mudong ma bore romo mairo apar ki lace mairo aryo, meno lwak ma gibedo i taun madit gibitic kwede kit me nino ducu; gitwero bedo iye dok bene gitwero weko mukene bedo macalo bar. Gang bibedo idyere, <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />dok bibedo latwoke angwen ma bocogi romrom ma twoke acel acel bore romo mita alip aryo ki miya aryo ki pyere abic. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />I kabedo ducu murumu taun madit itwoke acel acel, bar bibedo tye iye ma bore ari romo mita miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye abic. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Dul lobo ma odonge ma orabo nget dul lobo maleng, bore bibedo mairo angwen tung kunyango, ki mairo angwen yo tung kupotoceng. Ci cam ducu ma bicek iye bibedo cam pa lutic ma gitiyo i taun madit. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Lutic ducu ma gitiyo i taun madit, ma gua ki i kaka ducu pa Icrael, gibipuru lobo meno. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Dul lobo ma ibipoko bedo pat bibedo latwoke angwen, ma bor pa twoke acel acel bibedo mairo apar; meno nongo oribo dul lobo maleng wa ki lobo pa jo ma gibedo i taun madit.<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo ma kipoko pi laker</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" />Lobo ma odong inget dul lobo maleng ki lobo pa jo ma gibedo i taun madit en aye lobo ma odong tungi ki tungi inget dul lobo ma latwoke angwen ma bore ki lace romo mairo apar, bibedo pa laloc. Wang apokine bibedo wang apoki me lobo kikome tung kunyango ki tung kupotoceng. Dul lobo malengi, ki kabedo maleng ma i Ot pa Lubanga matye i dyereni, <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />ki lobo pa Lulevi kacel ki lobo pa jo ma gibedo i taun madit meno ducu, bibedo idye lobo ma dong kipoko me bedo pa laloc. Lobo pa laloc bibedo ikin dul lobo ma kipoko bot kaka, kun wang lobo pa jo Juda tye tung kumalo ki wang lobo pa jo Benjamin nongo tye yo tung kupiny.<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lobo pa kaka mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />Dong poko dul lobo bot kaka mudonge tye kit man: cake ki yo tung kunyango nio kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kipoko iye dul lobo acel bot Benjamin. <verse eid="EZK 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Benjamin, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Cimeon. <verse eid="EZK 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Cimeon, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo gimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Icakar. <verse eid="EZK 48:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Icakar, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Jabulon. <verse eid="EZK 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />Iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Jabulon, cake ki yo tung kunyango dok kwede yo tung kupotoceng, kenyo kimiyo iye dul lobo acel bot Gad. <verse eid="EZK 48:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />Ka dong iwang lobo ma orwate ki lobo pa Gad, wang lobone biwoto kun cake ki i Tamar kawok ki i pii Meriba-kadec, kun wok kwede ki inget laora kulu me Ejipt cito o kwede i Nam Mediterranean.<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />Man aye lobo ma ibipoko ikin kaka pa jo Icrael me bedo ginaleyagi, dong magi aye gin dul mapatpat ma kipoko. Man an Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu ma awaco.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dogcel me Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:12-13">Niy 21:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Magi aye bibedo dogcel ma kibidonyo kwede i taun madit me Jerucalem. Itung kumalo kipimo romo mita alip aryo ki miya aryo ki pyere abic. <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" />Dok onongo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Reuben, dogcel pa Juda, ki dogcel pa Levi. Dogcel me taun madit onongo kicako nyinggi ki nying kaka pa Icrael. <verse eid="EZK 48:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />Itung kunyango bene onongo kipimo mita alip aryo ki miya aryo ki pyere abic. Onongo bene tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Yucepu, dogcel pa Benjamin, ki dogcel pa Dan. <verse eid="EZK 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />Itung kupiny bene kipimo oromo mita alip aryo ki miya aryo ki pyere abic. Ci onongo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Cimeon, dogcel pa Icakar, ki dogcel pa Jabulon. <verse eid="EZK 48:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />Me agikine yo tung kupotoceng kipimo oromo mita alip aryo ki miya aryo ki pyere abic. Ki bene onongo tye iye dogcel adek, dogcel pa Gad, dogcel pa Acer, ki dogcel pa Naputali. <verse eid="EZK 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />Dong bor pa cel ma orumu taun maditi ducu onongo romo mita alip abongwen. Ci cake ikare man cito kwede anyim, nying taun maditi dong kibilwongo ni: Rwot Tye Kany.”<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>